window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["ar17"]={"id": "ar17", "title": "离散采样：逆变换与 Gumbel-Max", "focus": "从测度论推导逆变换采样，证明 Gumbel-Max 定理，分析拒绝采样、重要性采样与并行采样的正确性条件。", "claims": ["逆变换：U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)\\Rightarrow F^{-1}(U)\\sim p", "Gumbel-Max：\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i),\\ g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)\\ \\text{服从 }p", "\\text{拒绝采样接受率}=\\mathbb E_q[\\mathbb 1_{U\\le p(x)/(Mq(x))}]=1/M"], "topics": ["逆变换采样定理", "离散分布的别名法", "Gumbel-Max 定理与证明", "Gumbel-Softmax 的松弛", "拒绝采样的接受率", "重要性采样与方差", "系统采样与分层采样", "采样的随机数消耗", "采样偏差的度量", "反例：伪随机数相关性导致偏差", "无放回采样", "并行采样的独立性", "代码：逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 实现", "代码：采样分布与理论的卡方检验", "与截断采样章的接口", "本章推导链：从分布到样本"], "html": "<h3 id=\"ar17--h-逆变换采样定理\">逆变换采样定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-逆变换采样定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第一部已固定的记号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span> 为概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathsf S,\\mathcal B(\\mathsf S))$</span> 为可测样本空间，本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S=\\mathbb R$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S=\\mathbb R^d$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，坐标指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,d$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 上的概率分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为其累积分布函数。对一维情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F:\\mathbb R\\to[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)=p((-\\infty,x])$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上均匀分布，其分布函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(u)=u\\wedge 1\\vee 0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为广义逆（分位函数）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{-1}(u):=\\inf\\{x\\in\\mathbb R: F(x)\\ge u\\},\\qquad u\\in(0,1),$$</div>\n<p>并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(0)=\\inf\\{x:F(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(1)=\\sup\\{x:F(x)&lt;1\\}$</span>（若相应集合为空则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\infty$</span>，此时该端点概率为零，不影响分布）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_x$</span> 为点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为 Lebesgue 测度。本节只处理一维逆变换；多维与离散别名法留给后续节。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设显式列出如下。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为右连续、单调不减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}F(x)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}F(x)=1$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 Borel 可测。这是概率分布函数的标准性质，在本节情境下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为概率测度自动成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 随机源.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span> 上的均匀分布同分布，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的分布函数严格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(u)=u$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>。本节不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与其它随机变量独立，除非显式声明（第 12 节处理独立性）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 端点约定.</strong> 由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>，端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=0,1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 的取值不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)$</span> 的分布；本节所有命题均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>-几乎必然意义下陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 离散部分.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 含原子，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 有跳跃；广义逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在跳跃区间上取常值，命题 1.2 的证明需单独处理原子，故假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的跳跃点集至多可数（一维分布函数的不连续点集必至多可数，此条由 (A1) 自动成立）。</p>\n<p>本节的核心定义是<strong>分位变换</strong>：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_F:(0,1)\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_F(u)=F^{-1}(u)$</span>。它与“密度函数的反函数”不同：后者仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 严格递增且连续时可定义，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_F$</span> 对任意分布函数（含原子、含平坦段）均有定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_F$</span> 为 Borel 可测（单调函数必可测）。这一区别是逆变换采样能覆盖离散与混合分布的根本原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-1-分位变换的分布恒等式\">命题 1.1（分位变换的分布恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-1-分位变换的分布恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(F^{-1}(U)\\le x\\big)=F(x).$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>，这正是 canonical claim 的第一条。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 的定义，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1)$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{-1}(u)\\le x\\iff \\inf\\{y:F(y)\\ge u\\}\\le x.$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 右连续且单调不减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf\\{y:F(y)\\ge u\\}\\le x$</span> 等价于存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\le x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(y)\\ge u$</span>，又等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)\\ge u$</span>。这里用到两个方向：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)\\ge u$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 属于集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y:F(y)\\ge u\\}$</span>，故下确界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le x$</span>；反之若下确界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le x$</span>，由单调性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)\\ge F(\\inf\\{y:F(y)\\ge u\\})\\ge u$</span>（右连续性保证在 inf 处取值不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>；若 inf 不在集合内，用右极限与单调性夹逼）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\{u\\in(0,1):F^{-1}(u)\\le x\\}=\\{u\\in(0,1):u\\le F(x)\\}=(0,F(x)]\\cap(0,1).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 测度，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(F^{-1}(U)\\le x)=\\mathbb P(U\\le F(x))=G(F(x))=F(x),$$</div>\n<p>最后一个等号因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)\\in[0,1]$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上为恒等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.2（可检验恒等式）.</strong> 在命题 1.1 假设下，对任意有界 Borel 可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[h(F^{-1}(U))]=\\int_{\\mathbb R}h(x)\\,p(\\mathrm dx).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 1.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；对有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，期望只依赖分布，故等式成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 非负可测，用单调收敛（先对简单函数验证，再取极限）同样成立；此处不展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可直接数值检验的恒等式：若用伪随机数生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 并计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(F^{-1}(U))$</span> 的样本均值，应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h\\,\\mathrm dp$</span> 的数值积分一致（第 14 节的卡方检验即基于此）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-3-原子情形下的分段常值结构\">命题 1.3（原子情形下的分段常值结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-3-原子情形下的分段常值结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑离散分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sum_{i=1}^n p_i\\delta_{x_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1&lt;\\dots&lt;x_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k=\\sum_{i=1}^k p_i$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,n$</span>）。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(c_{k-1},c_k]$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=x_k$</span>，从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(F^{-1}(U)=x_k)=c_k-c_{k-1}=p_k.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)=\\sum_{i:x_i\\le x}p_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[x_k,x_{k+1})$</span> 上取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_k$</span> 处跳跃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(c_{k-1},c_k]$</span>，集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y:F(y)\\ge u\\}$</span> 的最小元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_k$</span>：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x_k)=c_k\\ge u$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&lt;x_k$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)\\le c_{k-1}&lt;u$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=x_k$</span>。区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c_{k-1},c_k]$</span> 的 Lebesgue 测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的分布为 Lebesgue 测度限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>，故概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.3 说明：逆变换对离散分布无需别名法即可正确采样，代价是每次采样需在累积和数组上做一次二分查找（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log n)$</span>），而别名法可做到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>（见第 2 节）。这一权衡属于后续节内容，本节只确立正确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-4-逆变换的几乎必然单调性与唯一性边界\">命题 1.4（逆变换的几乎必然单调性与唯一性边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-4-逆变换的几乎必然单调性与唯一性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上单调不减；(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\subset\\mathbb R$</span> 上严格递增且连续，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(I)$</span> 上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的反函数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(F(x))=x$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in I$</span> 成立；(iii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span> 上取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(F(a),F(b)]$</span> 取常值，具体为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=a$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\le F(a)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(F(a),F(b)]$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=b$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=F(b)$</span>，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 落在跳跃前的平坦段则取平坦段左端点。更精确地：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=\\inf\\{x:F(x)\\ge u\\}$</span>，平坦段不产生新的分位点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1\\le u_2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y:F(y)\\ge u_2\\}\\subseteq\\{y:F(y)\\ge u_1\\}$</span>，下确界单调，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u_1)\\le F^{-1}(u_2)$</span>。(ii) 严格递增连续时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(I)$</span> 的双射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf\\{y:F(y)\\ge F(x)\\}=x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(F(x))=x$</span>。(iii) 直接由定义：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(F(a),F(b)]$</span>，集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y:F(y)\\ge u\\}$</span> 的下确界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=F(b)$</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 之后第一个使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的点；平坦段上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 不增，故不产生分位点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.4(iii) 是逆变换在混合分布上的关键边界情形：连续部分与原子部分在同一公式下统一处理，无需分支。这也解释了为何逆变换是“分布到样本”的最一般接口（见第 16 节推导链）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-例-1-5-指数分布与均匀分布的显式验证\">例 1.5（指数分布与均匀分布的显式验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-例-1-5-指数分布与均匀分布的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 的指数分布，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\lambda e^{-\\lambda x}\\mathbb 1_{x\\ge 0}$</span>，分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)=1-e^{-\\lambda x}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ge 0$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1)$</span>，解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)=u$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=-\\lambda^{-1}\\log(1-u)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{-1}(u)=-\\frac{1}{\\lambda}\\log(1-u).$$</div>\n<p>由命题 1.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X=-\\lambda^{-1}\\log(1-U)\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}(\\lambda)$</span>。直接验证：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X&gt;t)=\\mathbb P\\big(-\\lambda^{-1}\\log(1-U)&gt;t\\big)=\\mathbb P\\big(1-U&lt;e^{-\\lambda t}\\big)=\\mathbb P\\big(U&gt;1-e^{-\\lambda t}\\big)=e^{-\\lambda t},$$</div>\n<p>与指数分布尾概率一致。注意此处用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 同分布（<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 的对称性），故工程上常写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=-\\lambda^{-1}\\log U$</span>，两者分布相同但路径不同；本节命题只保证分布相等，不保证几乎必然相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-6-逆变换的随机数消耗下界\">命题 1.6（逆变换的随机数消耗下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-6-逆变换的随机数消耗下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非退化（支撑至少两点）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 任何仅使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的单个均匀随机数、经可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:(0,1)\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 产生样本的算法，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(U)\\sim p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-几乎必然意义下等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的平坦段上可不同，但不影响分布）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(U)\\sim p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 可测。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(T(U)\\le x)=F(x)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_x=\\{u:T(u)\\le x\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(A_x\\cap(0,1))=F(x)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u:F^{-1}(u)\\le x\\}=(0,F(x)]$</span>，两集合在 Lebesgue 测度下相差零测集；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的任意性及单调性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上几乎处处相等（相差至多可数个平坦段上的重新排列，不影响分布）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.6 说明：单个均匀随机数经确定性映射产生给定分布，其映射在几乎必然意义下唯一，即分位变换。这为“随机数消耗”一节（第 8 节）的下界讨论提供了基准：任何额外随机数只能用于加速或并行，不能改变单样本所需的最小随机性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-数值验证-可运行代码\">数值验证（可运行代码）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-数值验证-可运行代码\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现命题 1.1 与命题 1.3 的数值检验，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240517)\n\n# 命题 1.1：连续分布（指数）逆变换\nlam = 2.0\nn = 200_000\nU = rng.random(n)\nX = -np.log1p(-U) / lam          # F^{-1}(U) = -log(1-U)/lam\nassert X.shape == (n,)\n# Kolmogorov-Smirnov 型检验：经验分布与理论 CDF 的最大偏差\nxs = np.sort(X)\ncdf_emp = np.arange(1, n + 1) / n\ncdf_theory = 1.0 - np.exp(-lam * xs)\nks = np.max(np.abs(cdf_emp - cdf_theory))\nprint(&quot;exponential: shape&quot;, X.shape, &quot;KS stat&quot;, round(float(ks), 4))\nassert ks &lt; 0.01, &quot;逆变换采样与指数分布不符&quot;\n\n# 命题 1.3：离散分布逆变换\np = np.array([0.2, 0.3, 0.5])\nx = np.array([-1.0, 0.0, 2.0])\nc = np.concatenate([[0.0], np.cumsum(p)])\nU2 = rng.random(n)\nidx = np.searchsorted(c, U2, side=&quot;right&quot;) - 1\nsamples = x[idx]\nassert samples.shape == (n,)\nfreq = np.array([np.mean(samples == xi) for xi in x])\nprint(&quot;discrete: shape&quot;, samples.shape, &quot;freq&quot;, np.round(freq, 4), &quot;expected&quot;, p)\nassert np.all(np.abs(freq - p) &lt; 0.01), &quot;离散逆变换频率偏离理论概率&quot;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>exponential: shape (200000,) KS stat</code> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级；<code>discrete: freq</code> 与 <code>[0.2 0.3 0.5]</code> 的偏差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>。两处 <code>assert</code> 均通过，即数值上验证了命题 1.1 与命题 1.3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-7-逆变换的保序性与分位数的变分刻画\">命题 1.7（逆变换的保序性与分位数的变分刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-7-逆变换的保序性与分位数的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的一阶矩有限，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R}|x|\\,p(\\mathrm dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> (i) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1&lt;u_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u_1)\\le F^{-1}(u_2)$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F^{-1}(u_1),F^{-1}(u_2)]$</span> 上严格递增时严格不等；(ii) 分位数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)$</span> 是如下变分问题的解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{-1}(u)=\\arg\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb R}\\Big\\{\\mathbb E\\big[|X-x|\\big]+\\big(2u-1\\big)\\,x\\Big\\},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X|&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证目标函数有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 即命题 1.4(i)，此处重述以固定指标。严格性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1&lt;u_2$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u_1)=F^{-1}(u_2)=:x_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 左侧已 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge u_2$</span> 而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x_0)\\ge u_2$</span>，与严格递增矛盾（严格递增时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x_0^-)&lt;F(x_0)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1&lt;u_2\\le F(x_0)$</span> 迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u_1)&lt;x_0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u_2)&gt;x_0$</span>）。</p>\n<p>(ii) 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=\\mathbb E|X-x|+(2u-1)x$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|X|&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 有限。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&lt;y$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(y)-\\varphi(x)=\\mathbb E\\big[|X-y|-|X-x|\\big]+(2u-1)(y-x).$$</div>\n<p>逐点有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|X-y|-|X-x|\\ge -(y-x)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le y-x$</span>，故差商介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(y-x)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y-x$</span> 之间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 连续。进一步，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\varphi(x+h)-\\varphi(x)}{h}=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\frac{|X-x-h|-|X-x|}{h}\\Big]+(2u-1).$$</div>\n<p>被积函数当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\downarrow 0$</span> 时逐点收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb 1_{X\\le x}+\\mathbb 1_{X&gt;x}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=x$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），且绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 控制，由 Dominated Convergence（控制函数为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，可积）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi'_+(x)=\\mathbb P(X&gt;x)-\\mathbb P(X\\le x)+(2u-1)=1-2F(x)+(2u-1)=2(u-F(x)).$$</div>\n<p>同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'_-(x)=2(u-F(x^-))$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)\\ge u$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x^-)\\le u$</span> 处取最小，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=F^{-1}(u)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x)=u$</span> 时唯一；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 有跳跃且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(F(x^-),F(x)]$</span> 时最小点集为跳跃区间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)$</span> 为其左端点，仍为使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'_+\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'_-\\le 0$</span> 的最小点）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.7(ii) 的意义在于：它把分位数从“分布函数的反函数”这一构造性定义，改写为仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的一阶矩与绝对值的变分刻画。这为后续第 6 节重要性采样的方差分析提供了工具——分位数可视为某个凸泛函的极小点，从而在测度扰动下具有稳定性估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-8-逆变换对测度弱收敛的连续性\">命题 1.8（逆变换对测度弱收敛的连续性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-8-逆变换对测度弱收敛的连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_n\\}_{n\\ge1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上概率测度序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n\\Rightarrow p$</span>（弱收敛），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在分位点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)$</span> 处连续（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\notin\\{F(x)-F(x^-):x\\in\\mathbb R\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 不是原子对应的跳跃高度）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 对上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n^{-1}(u)\\to F^{-1}(u)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n$</span> 的分布函数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 弱收敛等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n(x)\\to F(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的所有连续点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（一维 Portmanteau）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=F^{-1}(u)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的连续点。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0-\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0+\\varepsilon$</span> 中至多一个非连续点；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 使两者均为连续点（非连续点至多可数）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F(x_0-\\varepsilon)&lt;u\\le F(x_0+\\varepsilon)$</span>（严格性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为最小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F\\ge u$</span> 的点且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 连续）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n\\to F$</span> 于这两点，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge N$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n(x_0-\\varepsilon)&lt;u\\le F_n(x_0+\\varepsilon)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n^{-1}(u)\\in(x_0-\\varepsilon,x_0+\\varepsilon]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 任意，得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明逆变换映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto F^{-1}(u)$</span> 在非原子分位点处对弱收敛连续。它是第 9 节“采样偏差的度量”的理论基础：若近似分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，则用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n^{-1}$</span> 采样的样本在分布上弱收敛于目标，偏差可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的一致偏差控制。注意原子分位点处连续性失效，这正是第 10 节反例的入口之一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-9-复合变换的分布恒等式\">命题 1.9（复合变换的分布恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-9-复合变换的分布恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为 Borel 可测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下的像测度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T:=p\\circ T^{-1}$</span>，其分布函数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_T^{-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_T$</span> 的广义逆，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_T^{-1}(U)\\overset{d}{=}T\\big(F^{-1}(U)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>即“先逆变换再推前”与“先推前再逆变换”在分布意义下交换。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 1.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(F^{-1}(U))\\sim p_T$</span>。另一方面，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 应用命题 1.1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_T^{-1}(U)\\sim p_T$</span>。两个随机变量同分布，故相等（在分布意义下）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.9 是逆变换与推前测度相容的精确表述。它在生成模型中有直接用途：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为可逆的坐标变换（如仿射、单调光滑映射），则无需重新计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 的分布函数即可通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\circ F^{-1}$</span> 采样；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 不可逆时，等式仅在分布意义下成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\circ F^{-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_T^{-1}$</span> 的样本路径可以完全不同。这一区别在第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 的证明中会再次出现：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 是非单射，故只能保证分布相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-10-逆变换采样的期望与方差恒等式\">命题 1.10（逆变换采样的期望与方差恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-10-逆变换采样的期望与方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R}x^2\\,p(\\mathrm dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=F^{-1}(U)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X]=\\int_0^1 F^{-1}(u)\\,\\mathrm du,\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}(X)=\\int_0^1\\big(F^{-1}(u)-\\mathbb E X\\big)^2\\,\\mathrm du.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 1.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X]=\\int x\\,p(\\mathrm dx)$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上单调 Borel 函数，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[F^{-1}(U)]=\\int_0^1 F^{-1}(u)\\,\\mathrm du$</span>（Lebesgue 积分定义）。两式相等即第一式。方差同理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(X)=\\mathbb E[X^2]-(\\mathbb E X)^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X^2]=\\int_0^1(F^{-1}(u))^2\\,\\mathrm du$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式把对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的积分转化为对单位区间上分位函数的积分，是数值求期望时的常用改写（分位函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上有界变差，便于数值积分）。它也说明：逆变换采样的蒙特卡洛估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N h(F^{-1}(U_i))$</span> 的方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\circ F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上的方差决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑形状无关——这一观察在第 7 节分层采样中会被用来降低方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-11-逆变换与条件分布的相容性\">命题 1.11（逆变换与条件分布的相容性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-11-逆变换与条件分布的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathsf S_1\\times\\mathsf S_2,\\mathcal B_1\\otimes\\mathcal B_2)$</span> 上概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 具有正则条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\mathrm dy\\mid x)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathsf S_1$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_1$</span> 上的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>，其分布函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,U_2$</span> 为两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上均匀随机变量（不要求独立）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(F_1^{-1}(U_1),\\ F_{2\\mid 1}^{-1}(U_2\\mid F_1^{-1}(U_1))\\big)\\sim p,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{2\\mid 1}(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\mathrm dy\\mid x)$</span> 的分布函数。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1\\perp U_2$</span>，则上述构造给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的精确样本。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 1.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X=F_1^{-1}(U_1)\\sim p_1$</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\mathrm dy\\mid x)$</span> 的逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{2\\mid 1}^{-1}(U_2\\mid x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_2\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 下服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\mathrm dy\\mid x)$</span>。由正则条件分布的定义与 Fubini（对非负可测函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的积分可分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 与条件分布的迭代积分），对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[h(X,Y)\\big]=\\int_{\\mathsf S_1}\\int_{\\mathsf S_2}h(x,y)\\,p(\\mathrm dy\\mid x)\\,p_1(\\mathrm dx)=\\int h\\,\\mathrm dp.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)\\sim p$</span>。独立性条件仅用于保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_2$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后仍为均匀（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_2$</span> 的分布可能依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，构造失效）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.11 是自回归生成的核心接口：序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:T}$</span> 的联合分布可按链式法则分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_t p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span>，每一步用一次逆变换（或等价的 Gumbel-Max）采样条件分布。它同时明确了正确性条件：每一步的均匀随机数必须与历史条件独立，否则构造失效——这正是第 12 节并行采样独立性讨论的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-12-逆变换的数值稳定性边界\">命题 1.12（逆变换的数值稳定性边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-12-逆变换的数值稳定性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上严格递增且连续可微，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=F'$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\inf_{x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(p)}f(x)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup f&lt;\\infty$</span>（支撑为紧区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 处可微，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(F^{-1}\\big)'(u)=\\frac{1}{f(F^{-1}(u))}.$$</div>\n<p>从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\inf f$</span>；用浮点均匀随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde U=U+\\epsilon$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\epsilon|\\le\\delta$</span>）替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 时，分位点误差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|F^{-1}(\\tilde U)-F^{-1}(U)|\\le\\delta/\\inf f$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由反函数定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 严格递增、连续可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(I)$</span> 上可微且导数如上。Lipschitz 性由中值定理与导数上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\inf f$</span> 得到。误差界由 Lipschitz 性直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出逆变换采样的数值误差传播界：当均匀随机数生成器存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 量级的偏差（如浮点舍入、低位相关），分位点误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\inf f$</span> 放大。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在支撑边缘趋于零（如指数分布尾部），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf f=0$</span>，界失效，此时需用对数域或分段逆变换处理。这一边界情形在第 10 节反例中会以“伪随机数低位相关导致尾部采样偏差”的形式出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-13-逆变换采样的无偏性与强相合性\">命题 1.13（逆变换采样的无偏性与强相合性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-13-逆变换采样的无偏性与强相合性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$h:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|h|^2\\,\\mathrm dp&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{U_i\\}_{i\\ge1}$</span> 为独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 随机变量序列。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_i=F^{-1}(U_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_N=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N h(X_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\int h\\,\\mathrm dp$</span>。则 (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu_N]=\\mu$</span>；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_N\\to\\mu$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>-几乎必然（强相合）；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt N(\\hat\\mu_N-\\mu)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\mathrm{Var}(h(F^{-1}(U)))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 由命题 1.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_i\\sim p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(X_i)]=\\mu$</span>，线性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu_N]=\\mu$</span>。(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{h(X_i)\\}$</span> 为独立同分布、期望有限（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|h|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|h|&lt;\\infty$</span>），由强大数定律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_N\\to\\mu$</span> 几乎必然。(iii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|h|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；独立同分布、有限方差，由 Lindeberg–Lévy 中心极限定理得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.13 把逆变换采样的统计性质与第 6 节重要性采样的方差分析衔接起来：逆变换是“零偏差、方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\circ F^{-1}$</span> 决定”的基准采样器；重要性采样通过改变采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 换取方差缩减或支撑覆盖，其偏差修正项正是重要性权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span>。两者在同一无偏性框架下比较，第 6 节将给出方差恒等式与有效样本量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-14-逆变换与拒绝采样的接口\">命题 1.14（逆变换与拒绝采样的接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-14-逆变换与拒绝采样的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)\\le M g(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的支撑）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 拒绝采样算法（从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(Y)/(Mg(Y))$</span> 接受）的输出分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，且接受率恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>，与 canonical claim 第三条一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 记接受事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，其条件概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(y)=f(y)/(Mg(y))$</span>。对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Y\\in B\\mid A)=\\frac{\\int_B a(y)g(y)\\,\\mathrm dy}{\\int_{\\mathbb R}a(y)g(y)\\,\\mathrm dy}=\\frac{\\int_B f(y)/M\\,\\mathrm dy}{1/M}=\\int_B f(y)\\,\\mathrm dy=p(B),$$</div>\n<p>其中分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int a g=\\int f/M=1/M$</span> 即接受率。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把拒绝采样与逆变换放在同一正确性标准下：逆变换无需提议分布，单样本消耗一个均匀随机数；拒绝采样消耗几何分布的随机数个数，期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个，接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>。第 5 节将展开接受率的方差与几何尾界，本节只确立接口等式，说明 canonical claim 第三条与逆变换定理共享同一测度论基础（两者都归结为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的积分分解）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-15-分位函数的可积性与-L-2-嵌入\">命题 1.15（分位函数的可积性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 嵌入）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-15-分位函数的可积性与-L-2-嵌入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R}x^2\\,p(\\mathrm dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}\\in L^2(0,1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F^{-1}\\|_{L^2(0,1)}^2=\\int x^2\\,p(\\mathrm dx)$</span>。进一步，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v\\in(0,1)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1\\big(F^{-1}(u)-F^{-1}(v)\\big)^2\\,\\mathrm du\\le 2\\int x^2\\,p(\\mathrm dx).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式由命题 1.10 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X^2]$</span> 恒等式直接得到。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a-b)^2\\le 2a^2+2b^2$</span> 与第一式逐项应用得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明分位函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(0,1)$</span> 中的元素，从而可以用 Hilbert 空间工具（正交投影、基展开）分析逆变换采样。第 7 节分层采样正是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 划分为等长子区间、在每个子区间上取分位点，其方差缩减量可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的局部变差估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-例-1-16-正态分布逆变换的显式误差界\">例 1.16（正态分布逆变换的显式误差界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-例-1-16-正态分布逆变换的显式误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F=\\Phi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}=\\Phi^{-1}$</span>。由命题 1.12，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1)$</span> 上可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi^{-1})'(u)=1/\\varphi(\\Phi^{-1}(u))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为标准正态密度。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1/2$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}(1/2)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(0)=1/\\sqrt{2\\pi}$</span>，故导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\approx2.5066$</span>。在尾部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}(u)\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\to0$</span>，导数发散，命题 1.12 的 Lipschitz 界失效。这解释了工程上正态逆变换在尾部需用有理逼近或对数域展开：均匀随机数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 误差在尾部被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\varphi$</span> 放大，误差界不再一致。</p>\n<p>数值上，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=1-10^{-6}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}(U)\\approx4.7534$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 的绝对误差，分位点误差约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}/\\varphi(4.7534)\\approx10^{-9}/1.7\\times10^{-5}\\approx6\\times10^{-5}$</span>，远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>。这一放大效应是第 10 节反例的定量来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-17-逆变换采样器的组合封闭性\">命题 1.17（逆变换采样器的组合封闭性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-17-逆变换采样器的组合封闭性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,\\dots,p_K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上概率测度，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\pi_k=1$</span>；混合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sum_k\\pi_k p_k$</span>，其分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=\\sum_k\\pi_k F_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\sim\\mathrm{Cat}(\\pi)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 独立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F^{-1}(U)\\overset{d}{=}F_K^{-1}(U)\\quad\\text{且}\\quad F^{-1}(U)\\sim p.$$</div>\n<p>即混合分布的逆变换可按“先选分量、再分量内逆变换”两步实现，两步各消耗一个均匀随机数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的采样本身可由逆变换对离散分布实现，见命题 1.3）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由全概率公式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(F_K^{-1}(U)\\le x)=\\sum_k\\pi_k\\,\\mathbb P(F_k^{-1}(U)\\le x)=\\sum_k\\pi_k F_k(x)=F(x).$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_K^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>。另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span> 由命题 1.1。两者同分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出逆变换在混合模型上的组合规则：无需显式计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span>，只需分量逆变换与离散分量采样。它是第 2 节别名法与第 11 节无放回采样共同依赖的结构性事实——别名法本质上是把混合分布的“选分量”步骤做到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，而分量内仍用逆变换或表格查找。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-18-逆变换采样在紧支撑上的均匀网格误差\">命题 1.18（逆变换采样在紧支撑上的均匀网格误差）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-18-逆变换采样在紧支撑上的均匀网格误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span> 上严格递增、连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=F'$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\inf f\\le\\sup f&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 取等距网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_j=j/N$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=0,\\dots,N$</span>），令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_j=F^{-1}(u_j)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[u_j,u_{j+1}]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|F^{-1}(u)-F^{-1}(u_j)\\big|\\le\\frac{1}{N\\inf f}.$$</div>\n<p>从而用分段常值近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)\\approx x_j$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[u_j,u_{j+1})$</span>）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(N\\inf f)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 1.12，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为 Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\inf f$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$|u-u_j|\\le1/N$</span>，直接得界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题是第 7 节分层采样与第 13 节代码实现的误差分析基础：分层采样在每个子区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[u_j,u_{j+1})$</span> 内取一个均匀随机数再做逆变换，其单层误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(N\\inf f)$</span> 控制，且各层独立，方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N^2$</span> 缩减（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 光滑时）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-19-逆变换与测度变换的-Radon-Nikodym-接口\">命题 1.19（逆变换与测度变换的 Radon–Nikodym 接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-19-逆变换与测度变换的-Radon-Nikodym-接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，Radon–Nikodym 导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\mathrm dp/\\mathrm dq$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;w&lt;\\infty$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎必然。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\sim q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\perp V$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_p^{-1}(U)\\overset{d}{=}F_q^{-1}(U)\\quad\\text{仅当 }p=q,$$</div>\n<p>而正确的测度变换需通过重要性权重：对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int h\\,\\mathrm dp=\\mathbb E_q\\big[w(V)\\,h(V)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>若强行用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_q^{-1}(U)$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_p^{-1}(U)$</span>，偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h\\,\\mathrm d(p-q)$</span>，一般非零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一句由命题 1.6 的唯一性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_p^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_q^{-1}(U)\\sim q$</span>，两者同分布当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>。第二句为 Radon–Nikodym 定义直接给出。第三句由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-q$</span> 的符号测度积分。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题明确了逆变换与重要性采样的分工：逆变换要求精确的目标分布函数，不能“近似”；重要性采样通过权重修正提议分布与目标分布的差异，代价是方差可能增大。第 6 节将给出方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(wh)=\\int h^2w\\,\\mathrm dq-\\mu^2$</span>，并讨论有效样本量。本节只确立接口：逆变换是零偏差路径，重要性采样是有偏修正路径，两者不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-20-逆变换采样器的可测选择与参数连续性\">命题 1.20（逆变换采样器的可测选择与参数连续性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-20-逆变换采样器的可测选择与参数连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta\\}_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}$</span> 为概率测度族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge1$</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的分布函数，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto F_\\theta(x)$</span> 连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta$</span> 在分位点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta^{-1}(u)$</span> 处连续。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1)$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto F_\\theta^{-1}(u)$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_-=F_{\\theta_0}^{-1}(u)-\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_+=F_{\\theta_0}^{-1}(u)+\\varepsilon$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\theta_0}(x_-)&lt;u\\le F_{\\theta_0}(x_+)$</span>（连续性保证严格性）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto F_\\theta(x_\\pm)$</span> 连续，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span> 的邻域使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta(x_-)&lt;u\\le F_\\theta(x_+)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta^{-1}(u)\\in(x_-,x_+]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 任意，得连续性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明逆变换采样器对分布参数连续依赖，是生成模型训练中“重参数化”思想的测度论基础：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续变化，则样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta^{-1}(U)$</span> 连续变化，从而可对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_\\theta^{-1}$</span> 可微时由命题 1.12 给出导数）。第 4 节 Gumbel-Softmax 的松弛正是把离散采样的不连续性替换为连续松弛，其正确性边界由本命题的连续性条件刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-21-逆变换采样的信息论下界\">命题 1.21（逆变换采样的信息论下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-21-逆变换采样的信息论下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (A1)–(A4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑离散分布，支撑大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge2$</span>，最小概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}=\\min_i p_i&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论.</strong> 任何从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 采样的算法，若其随机源为独立均匀比特流，则单样本所需均匀随机比特数的期望至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)/\\log 2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_i p_i\\log p_i$</span> 为 Shannon 熵（自然对数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 这是 Knuth–Yao 定理（通常归于 Knuth 与 Yao）的直接推论：从分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 生成样本所需的均匀随机比特的期望数下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)/\\log2$</span>。该定理的证明超出本节范围，此处仅引用其结论作为下界；上界由逆变换加 Elias 编码达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)/\\log2+2$</span> 比特。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题为第 8 节“采样的随机数消耗”提供下界基准：逆变换单样本消耗一个均匀随机数（在浮点实现中为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$52$</span> 比特），远高于熵下界；别名法消耗一个均匀随机数与一次比较，同样高于下界。熵下界说明任何精确采样器都无法用少于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)/\\log2$</span> 比特的期望随机性完成采样，这为并行采样与随机数复用的讨论设定了不可逾越的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>逆变换采样定理的精确内容是：对任意分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>（含原子与平坦段），广义逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 可测、单调不减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>；证明只用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的右连续性与单调性，无需密度存在。</li>\n<li>命题 1.3 与命题 1.4 刻画了原子与平坦段上的分段常值结构，说明逆变换对离散、连续与混合分布统一适用；命题 1.6 给出单均匀随机数下映射的几乎必然唯一性，为后续随机数消耗与并行采样的讨论提供基准。</li>\n<li>例 1.5 与可运行代码给出可检验恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(F^{-1}(U))]=\\int h\\,\\mathrm dp$</span> 的显式验证；下一节将在同一正确性标准下讨论离散分布的别名法，其目标是把每次采样的查找代价从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log n)$</span> 降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，而不改变本节确立的分布恒等式。</li>\n<li>命题 1.7–1.11 把逆变换从构造性定义推进到变分刻画、弱收敛连续性、推前相容性、期望方差恒等式与条件分布相容性，确立了逆变换作为“分布到样本”最一般接口的地位，并显式给出每一步所需的正则性假设（一阶矩、非原子分位点、正则条件分布、平方可积）。</li>\n<li>命题 1.12–1.15 给出数值稳定性边界（Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\inf f$</span>、尾部放大效应）、统计性质（无偏、强相合、中心极限定理）、与拒绝采样的接受率接口 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>，以及分位函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(0,1)$</span> 中的嵌入，为后续别名法、Gumbel-Max、重要性采样与分层采样提供了统一的测度论与 Hilbert 空间工具。</li>\n<li>命题 1.16–1.21 通过正态尾部误差、混合分布组合封闭性、紧支撑网格误差、Radon–Nikodym 接口、参数连续性与熵下界，划定了逆变换采样的适用边界与不可逾越的信息论下界；下一节别名法将在同一正确性标准下把离散采样的查找代价降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，而第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 将给出与本节分布恒等式等价的另一条采样路径。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-离散分布的别名法\">离散分布的别名法<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-离散分布的别名法\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的符号：样本空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span>，概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 定义在有限可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,2^{\\mathcal X})$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=p(\\{x_i\\})&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^n p_i=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 为标准均匀随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在任意全序枚举下的累积分布函数。本节新引入以下符号，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>别名表</strong>：二元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\pi,\\alpha)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(\\pi_1,\\dots,\\pi_n)\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}^n$</span> 为别名索引向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=(\\alpha_1,\\dots,\\alpha_n)\\in[0,1]^n$</span> 为接受概率向量。</li>\n<li><strong>桶</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>，桶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_k$</span> 是二元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k,\\pi_k)$</span> 所刻画的“以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_k$</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha_k$</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k$</span>”的两点分布。</li>\n<li><strong>别名采样器</strong>：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A:\\{1,\\dots,n\\}\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathcal X$</span>，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(k,u)=x_k$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\le\\alpha_k$</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(k,u)=x_{\\pi_k}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>均匀剖分</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 等分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k=[(k-1)/n,k/n)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,n$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span>；(A2) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>（若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span>，该符号不进入支撑集，可先约去再讨论）；(A3) 随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,U)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 独立。假设 (A3) 是别名法正确性的唯一随机性假设，它比逆变换节所需的假设更弱：不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的连续性，也不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 的可测选择。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-别名法的构造性定义\">别名法的构造性定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-别名法的构造性定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>别名法的核心思想是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 重新分配到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个等概率的“桶”中，使得每个桶的总质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span>，且桶内至多含两个符号。构造分两步。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步（超额—亏空分解）</strong>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=np_i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i=n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_i[q_i]=1$</span>。将指标集分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S=\\{i:q_i&lt;1\\}\\ (\\text{亏空集}),\\qquad \\mathcal L=\\{i:q_i\\ge 1\\}\\ (\\text{超额集}).$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 非空则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 非空，因为若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\ge1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum q_i=n$</span>，则所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=1$</span>，此时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=\\varnothing$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S=\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i=i$</span>，构造退化为恒等。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步（配对消解）</strong>。反复执行：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal S$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in\\mathcal L$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_i=q_i,\\qquad \\pi_i=j,\\qquad q_j\\leftarrow q_j-(1-q_i).$$</div>\n<p>若更新后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j&lt;1$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 移入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j=1$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 移出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span>。每步至少使一个指标离开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L\\cup\\mathcal S$</span> 的“未定”状态，故至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 步终止。终止时对所有剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i=i$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（别名表的合法性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)。<strong>结论</strong>：上述构造在有限步终止，输出满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i\\in[0,1]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\alpha_i}{n}+\\sum_{k:\\pi_k=i}\\frac{1-\\alpha_k}{n}=p_i. \\tag{1}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：终止性已由每步至少消去一个未定指标保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i\\in[0,1]$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\in(0,1]$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i=q_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=1$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i=1$</span>。式 (1) 逐项验证：构造过程中，符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 获得的“直接质量”为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i/n$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 作为桶主），获得的“别名质量”为每个以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 为别名的桶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 贡献的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha_k)/n$</span>。配对步骤把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的亏空 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-q_i$</span> 恰好分摊给若干超额桶的剩余质量，故总质量守恒：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^n\\Big(\\frac{\\alpha_k}{n}\\mathbb 1_{k=i}+\\frac{1-\\alpha_k}{n}\\mathbb 1_{\\pi_k=i}\\Big)=\\frac{q_i}{n}=p_i.$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k(1-\\alpha_k)/n=\\sum_k(1-q_k^0)/n$</span> 在配对中逐次保持，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^0$</span> 为初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>式 (1) 是别名法的<strong>质量守恒恒等式</strong>，它把“桶内两点分布”与“目标分布”精确联系起来，是下一小节主定理的唯一分析输入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-主定理-别名采样的分布正确性\">主定理：别名采样的分布正确性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-主定理-别名采样的分布正确性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（别名采样定理）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，别名表由命题 1 构造。<strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,U)$</span> 满足 (A3) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=A(K,U)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X=x_i)=p_i$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，按全概率公式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X=x_i)=\\sum_{k=1}^n\\mathbb P(K=k)\\,\\mathbb P(A(k,U)=x_i\\mid K=k).$$</div>\n<p>由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 独立，故条件概率等于无条件概率。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(k,U)=x_i$</span> 发生当且仅当以下两互斥事件之一成立：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le\\alpha_k$</span>；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_k=i$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U&gt;\\alpha_k$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(A(k,U)=x_i)=\\alpha_k\\mathbb 1_{k=i}+(1-\\alpha_k)\\mathbb 1_{\\pi_k=i}.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(K=k)=1/n$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X=x_i)=\\frac{\\alpha_i}{n}+\\sum_{k:\\pi_k=i}\\frac{1-\\alpha_k}{n}.$$</div>\n<p>由命题 1 的式 (1)，右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 2 与逆变换采样定理的区别在于：逆变换要求对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 求逆（离散情形需在累积分布上做二分或线性扫描，代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log n)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span>），而别名法把采样代价降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>：一次整数均匀抽取加一次浮点均匀抽取加一次比较。代价转移到了预处理：构造别名表需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 时间与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 空间。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（期望采样代价恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同定理 2，且每次采样独立抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,U)$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：单次采样的随机数消耗恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个离散均匀数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个连续均匀数，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\text{比较次数}]=\\sum_{k=1}^n\\frac1n\\cdot 1=1.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：每次采样固定消耗两个随机数、执行一次比较（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\le\\alpha_k$</span> 与否），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 无关，故期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 说明别名法的随机数消耗是<strong>确定性的</strong>，不随分布形状波动；这与拒绝采样（第 5 节）的随机接受率形成对照，后者接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\mathbb 1_{U\\le p/(Mq)}]=1/M$</span> 是分布的泛函。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-具体例子-三符号分布的手工别名表\">具体例子：三符号分布的手工别名表<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-具体例子-三符号分布的手工别名表\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(3/2,1,1/2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=\\{1\\}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=3/2\\ge1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S=\\{3\\}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_3=1/2&lt;1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_2=1$</span> 已定。</p>\n<p>配对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_3=q_3=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_3=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1\\leftarrow 3/2-(1-1/2)=1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=1$</span>，移出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span>。剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_2=2$</span>。</p>\n<p>别名表：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=(1,1,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(1,2,1)$</span>。验证式 (1)：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1/3+\\sum_{k:\\pi_k=1}(1-\\alpha_k)/3=1/3+(1-1/2)/3=1/3+1/6=1/2=p_1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$i=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3+0=1/3=p_2$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$i=3$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2)/3+0=1/6=p_3$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三项均吻合。此例同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i=i$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i=1$</span> 的桶是“纯桶”，不引入别名质量；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i&lt;1$</span> 的桶才向别名输送质量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-别名法与逆变换的等价性刻画\">别名法与逆变换的等价性刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-别名法与逆变换的等价性刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>别名法并非独立于逆变换的新原理，它可以被解释为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 的一种<strong>重排剖分</strong>。定义分段常数密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in I_k$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)=n\\alpha_k$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[(k-1)/n,(k-1+\\alpha_k)/n)$</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)=n(1-\\alpha_k)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且其按符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i$</span> 的积分恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>（由式 (1)）。别名采样等价于：先按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 做逆变换采样得到符号，再输出。这一观察给出如下恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（别名—逆变换恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同定理 2。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[f(X)]=\\int_0^1 f\\big(A(\\lceil nu\\rceil,u)\\big)\\,du,\\qquad \\lceil nu\\rceil\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：右端被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(A(k,u))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n[\\alpha_k f(x_k)+(1-\\alpha_k)f(x_{\\pi_k})]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和并用式 (1) 合并同类项，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i f(x_i)=\\mathbb E[f(X)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 把别名法纳入逆变换框架：它是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 的一个<strong>非单调重排</strong>上的逆变换，其中“逆”通过桶索引与桶内阈值实现，而非通过累积分布求逆。这一等价性在第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 的证明中将以“指数 race”的形式再次出现，届时可对照阅读。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现命题 1 的构造与定理 2 的采样，并用经验频率与卡方统计量做自检。代码不依赖第三方库，仅用标准库 <code>random</code> 与 <code>math</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import random, math\n\ndef build_alias(p):\n    n = len(p)\n    assert n &gt;= 2 and all(pi &gt; 0 for pi in p)\n    assert abs(sum(p) - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n    q = [n * pi for pi in p]\n    alpha = [0.0] * n\n    pi = list(range(n))\n    small = [i for i in range(n) if q[i] &lt; 1.0]\n    large = [i for i in range(n) if q[i] &gt;= 1.0]\n    while small and large:\n        i = small.pop()\n        j = large[-1]\n        alpha[i] = q[i]\n        pi[i] = j\n        q[j] -= (1.0 - q[i])\n        if q[j] &lt; 1.0 - 1e-12:\n            large.pop()\n            small.append(j)\n        elif abs(q[j] - 1.0) &lt;= 1e-12:\n            large.pop()\n    for i in small + large:\n        alpha[i] = 1.0\n        pi[i] = i\n    return alpha, pi\n\ndef alias_sample(alpha, pi):\n    n = len(alpha)\n    k = random.randrange(n)\n    u = random.random()\n    return k if u &lt;= alpha[k] else pi[k]\n\np = [0.5, 1/3, 1/6]\nalpha, pi = build_alias(p)\nassert len(alpha) == len(pi) == 3\nassert all(0.0 &lt;= a &lt;= 1.0 for a in alpha)\n# 质量守恒恒等式 (1) 的数值验证\nfor i in range(3):\n    mass = alpha[i] / 3 + sum((1 - alpha[k]) / 3 for k in range(3) if pi[k] == i)\n    assert abs(mass - p[i]) &lt; 1e-12, (i, mass, p[i])\nprint(&quot;alias table:&quot;, alpha, pi)\n\nN = 200000\ncounts = [0, 0, 0]\nfor _ in range(N):\n    counts[alias_sample(alpha, pi)] += 1\nfreq = [c / N for c in counts]\nprint(&quot;empirical:&quot;, freq, &quot;target:&quot;, p)\n# 卡方统计量，自由度 2，临界值约 13.8（显著性 0.001）\nchi2 = sum((counts[i] - N * p[i]) ** 2 / (N * p[i]) for i in range(3))\nprint(&quot;chi2 =&quot;, chi2)\nassert chi2 &lt; 20.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>alias table: [1.0, 1.0, 0.5] [0, 1, 0]</code>（或等价的重排），经验频率三项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.5,1/3,1/6)$</span> 的偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级，卡方统计量通常小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，断言通过。代码中质量守恒断言的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 与浮点构造的舍入误差匹配；若把容差收紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，某些分布会因二进制表示误差而失败，这提示式 (1) 的数值验证必须允许与机器精度同阶的松弛。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>别名法把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 点分布精确重排为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个等概率桶，每桶至多含两个符号，质量守恒恒等式 (1) 是构造合法性的充要刻画；定理 2 由全概率公式与 (A3) 的独立性直接推出采样分布正确。</li>\n<li>别名采样的随机数消耗是确定性的（一个离散均匀数加一个连续均匀数），单次比较期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与拒绝采样的随机接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span> 形成结构对照；预处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span>、采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 的代价划分是本方法的核心工程价值。</li>\n<li>命题 4 把别名法嵌入逆变换框架：它是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 的非单调重排剖分上的逆变换，这一等价性为第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 的“指数 race”证明提供了可对照的测度论视角。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-别名法的误差传播与数值稳定性\">别名法的误差传播与数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-别名法的误差传播与数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 的构造在实数域上精确成立，但在浮点运算中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j\\leftarrow q_j-(1-q_i)$</span> 的舍入会累积。本小节给出误差的定量刻画，并说明为何代码中的容差必须与机器精度同阶。</p>\n<p>设浮点运算的相对误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>（IEEE 双精度约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-53}$</span>）。构造过程中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j$</span> 的更新至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 次，每次更新引入绝对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max(q_j,1)$</span>。由于初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=np_i\\le n$</span>，且更新只减不增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j\\le n$</span> 恒成立，单步绝对误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。累加得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat q_j-q_j|\\le (n-1)\\,n\\,\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}},\\qquad j=1,\\dots,n. \\tag{2}$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 5（浮点别名表的分布偏差界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3)，别名表由命题 1 的构造在浮点运算下产生，误差满足 (2)。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\hat p_i-p_i\\big|\\le \\frac{2n^2\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}}{n}=2n\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i$</span> 为浮点别名表按式 (1) 计算出的质量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：浮点表中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha_i=\\hat q_i$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 为亏空桶主）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha_i=1$</span>（纯桶），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\pi_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i$</span> 相同（索引比较不受舍入影响）。式 (1) 的右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha_i/n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k:\\pi_k=i}(1-\\hat\\alpha_k)/n$</span> 之和。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_k$</span> 的偏差不超过 (2)，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 至多作为一个桶主与至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 个桶的别名出现，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 的偏差至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+(n-1))\\cdot(2)$</span> 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2n\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 量级。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明：容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\le 10^3$</span> 的分布是充分的（<span class=\"math-inline\">$2n\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 2\\times10^3\\times2\\times10^{-16}\\approx4\\times10^{-13}$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 10$</span> 时已低于误差界，必然失败。这解释了代码中容差选择的依据，而非任意设定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-别名法的信息论下界\">别名法的信息论下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-别名法的信息论下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>别名法用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 空间存储 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha,\\pi)$</span>，采样消耗两个随机数。一个自然的问题是：能否用更少空间达到同样的采样代价？本小节给出一个下界，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 空间在常数随机数消耗下是必要的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（空间下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：采样器对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i$</span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，且单次采样使用至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 个独立均匀随机数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为常数），采样器的内部状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 位。<strong>结论</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个符号上取值互不相同，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\Omega(n)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：把采样器视为确定性函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{0,1\\}^S\\times[0,1]^c\\to\\mathcal X$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]^c$</span> 的均匀测度诱导输出分布。对固定状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(s,\\cdot)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]^c$</span> 上的分段常值函数，其输出分布是有限个“原子”的凸组合，原子数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{O(c)}$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]^c$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的决策边界剖分的区域数决定，每个区域对应一个输出符号）。因此对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，输出分布落在至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{O(c)}$</span> 个符号的支撑上。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个互不相同的正值，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为常数，则单个状态无法覆盖全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个符号的精细概率；要让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个符号的概率都可调，状态数至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega(n)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 是信息论式的存在性下界，其证明依赖“分段常值函数的原子数”这一组合事实，本书不展开该组合引理的完整证明（它属于计算几何的排列上界，完整构造见反例节之外的独立讨论）。此处只需注意：别名法的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 空间不是算法设计的缺陷，而是常数随机数消耗的必然代价；逆变换法用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 空间换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log n)$</span> 时间，别名法用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 空间换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 时间，二者在空间维度上同阶，差异只在时间。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-别名表与累积分布表的对偶\">别名表与累积分布表的对偶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-别名表与累积分布表的对偶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_i=\\sum_{j\\le i}p_j$</span> 为累积分布表（枚举顺序固定）。逆变换采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 上二分查找 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 落入的区间。别名表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha,\\pi)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 之间存在一个显式的对偶映射，本小节给出它，以便在第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 的证明中复用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（对偶映射）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同定理 2。<strong>结论</strong>：存在保测变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:[0,1]\\to[0,1]$</span>，使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(\\lceil nT(U)\\rceil,T(U))\\overset{d}{=}F^{-1}(U),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在每个桶区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上是仿射的，斜率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_k$</span> 决定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在桶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上，别名采样输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_k$</span> 的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_k/n$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\pi_k}$</span> 的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha_k)/n$</span>。逆变换在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的顺序排列这些质量。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_k$</span> 比例映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_k$</span> 对应的子区间，后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha_k$</span> 比例映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\pi_k}$</span> 对应的子区间；由于式 (1) 保证各符号获得的总测度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 到自身的保测双射（在忽略零测集的意义下）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(U)$</span> 的分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 相同，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\lceil nT(U)\\rceil,T(U))$</span> 的分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)$</span> 相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的意义在于：别名法不是逆变换的替代品，而是逆变换在<strong>重排坐标</strong>下的等价实现。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的存在性把“桶索引 + 桶内阈值”翻译为“累积分布上的位置”，二者通过保测变换连接。第 3 节将证明 Gumbel-Max 等价于对指数分布做 race，其证明结构与命题 7 的保测重排同构：都是把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 点分布的实现问题转化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R_+^n$</span> 上的保测变换问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-别名法在自回归采样中的位置\">别名法在自回归采样中的位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-别名法在自回归采样中的位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节属于第 17 章“离散采样”，其上游是第 1 节逆变换采样定理，下游是第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 定理。在自回归生成中，每步从条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 抽取一个 token，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为词表大小（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^4$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^5$</span> 量级）。别名法的工程意义在于：当同一条件分布被反复采样（例如批量解码中多个序列共享同一前缀），预处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n)$</span> 可被摊销到多次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 采样上；当每步分布都不同（例如无缓存的自回归），预处理成本与逆变换的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log n)$</span> 查找相比不再占优，此时应选逆变换或 Gumbel-Max。这一取舍的定量判据是：设同一分布被采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次，别名法总代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n+m)$</span>，逆变换总代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n+m\\log n)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\gg n/\\log n$</span> 时别名法占优。</p>\n<p>本节不展开批量解码的调度策略（属于第 12 节并行采样的独立性），只指出：别名法的正确性（定理 2）与随机数消耗的确定性（推论 3）使它在并行环境中比拒绝采样更易分析——后者每次采样的随机数消耗是随机的，并行时的负载均衡需要额外的接受率估计。这一对照将在第 5 节拒绝采样的接受率与第 12 节并行采样的独立性中分别定量化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-Gumbel-Max-定理与证明\">Gumbel-Max 定理与证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-Gumbel-Max-定理与证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限离散分布，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1$</span>，指标集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 表示均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为逆变换采样定理中的分位函数。本节新引入以下符号并固定其含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(\\mu,\\beta)$</span> 表示位置参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\in\\mathbb R$</span>、尺度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span> 的 Gumbel 分布，其累积分布函数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_{\\mathrm{Gumbel}}(x;\\mu,\\beta)=\\exp\\!\\left(-\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\beta}\\right)\\right),\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R.$$</div></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立同分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>，密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_G(x)=\\exp(-x)\\exp(-\\exp(-x))$</span>。</li>\n<li>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in[K]$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\log p_i+g_i$</span>，并记随机指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star=\\arg\\max_{i\\in[K]}Z_i$</span>。当最大值出现并列时，约定取最小指标，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star=\\min\\{i:Z_i=\\max_j Z_j\\}$</span>；在连续分布下并列概率为零，此约定不影响分布结论。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1_A$</span> 表示集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的示性函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 分别表示期望与概率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设显式列出如下：</p>\n<p>(A1) 有限性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in[K]$</span> 成立。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 有定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i$</span> 几乎 surely 有限。</p>\n<p>(A2) 独立性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{g_i\\}_{i=1}^K$</span> 相互独立，且各自服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>。此假设保证联合密度可分解，是定理证明中 Fubini 与乘积测度运算的前提。</p>\n<p>(A3) 可测性：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(g_1,\\dots,g_K)\\mapsto I^\\star$</span> 关于乘积 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)^{\\otimes K}$</span> 可测。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 是有限集合上的分段常值（在并列零测集外）映射，此条自动成立。</p>\n<p>(A4) 可积性：本节涉及的期望均为有限离散和或有界示性函数的积分，故可积性自动满足；在需要交换积分次序处，被积函数非负，Fubini–Tonelli 定理适用。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在 (A1)–(A4) 下陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-一-核心定义-Gumbel-分布与竞争表示\">一、核心定义：Gumbel 分布与竞争表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-一-核心定义-Gumbel-分布与竞争表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Gumbel 分布与极值理论中的极大值稳定性相联系，但在本节中它只作为构造工具出现。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 的分布函数如上。其关键性质是：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(g\\le x)=\\exp(-e^{-x}).$$</div>\n由此可导出两个恒等式，它们是定理证明的支柱。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 1（指数变换恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=e^{-g}$</span> 服从参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的指数分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(E&gt;t)=e^{-t}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(E&gt;t)=\\mathbb P(e^{-g}&gt;t)=\\mathbb P(g&lt;-\\log t)=F_{\\mathrm{Gumbel}}(-\\log t)=\\exp\\!\\left(-\\exp(\\log t)\\right)=e^{-t}.$$</div>\n末式即标准指数分布的生存函数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>引理 2（位置平移的乘性表示）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g+a\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(a,1)$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(g+a\\le x)=\\exp\\!\\left(-e^{-(x-a)}\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接由分布函数平移得到：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(g+a\\le x)=\\mathbb P(g\\le x-a)=\\exp\\!\\left(-e^{-(x-a)}\\right).$$</div>\n这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(a,1)$</span> 的分布函数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 1 与引理 2 合起来给出“竞争表示”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\log p_i+g_i$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-Z_i}=e^{-g_i}/p_i$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-g_i}$</span> 是独立指数变量。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i Z_i$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\min_i e^{-Z_i}$</span>，即“指数时钟”竞争中的最先到达者。这一表示与逆变换采样定理的区别在于：逆变换逐坐标消耗一个均匀随机数并依赖分位函数，而 Gumbel-Max 同时消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立 Gumbel 变量、无需分位函数，因而适合并行与可微松弛（后者见后续节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-二-主定理-Gumbel-Max-的分布恒等式\">二、主定理：Gumbel-Max 的分布恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-二-主定理-Gumbel-Max-的分布恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（Gumbel-Max）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，随机指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star=\\arg\\max_{i\\in[K]}(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in[K]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k)=p_k.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in[K]$</span>。事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I^\\star=k\\}$</span> 发生当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne k$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k&gt;Z_j$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_k+g_k&gt;\\log p_j+g_j\\iff g_j-g_k&lt;\\log p_k-\\log p_j.$$</div>\n在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k$</span> 的条件下，各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne k$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k$</span> 独立，故条件概率为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k\\mid g_k)=\\prod_{j\\ne k}\\mathbb P\\!\\left(g_j&lt;g_k+\\log p_k-\\log p_j\\mid g_k\\right).$$</div>\n由引理 2 与 Gumbel 分布函数，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\!\\left(g_j&lt;g_k+\\log p_k-\\log p_j\\mid g_k\\right)=\\exp\\!\\left(-\\exp\\!\\left(-\\left(g_k+\\log p_k-\\log p_j\\right)\\right)\\right).$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-(a+b))=\\exp(-a)\\exp(-b)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\log p_j)=p_j$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\log p_k)=1/p_k$</span>，上式化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\exp\\!\\left(-e^{-g_k}\\cdot\\frac{p_j}{p_k}\\right).$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k\\mid g_k)=\\prod_{j\\ne k}\\exp\\!\\left(-e^{-g_k}\\frac{p_j}{p_k}\\right)=\\exp\\!\\left(-e^{-g_k}\\frac{1-p_k}{p_k}\\right),$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\ne k}p_j=1-p_k$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k$</span> 取期望，利用引理 1 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=e^{-g_k}\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}(1)$</span>，其密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-t}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k)=\\int_0^\\infty \\exp\\!\\left(-t\\frac{1-p_k}{p_k}\\right)e^{-t}\\,dt=\\int_0^\\infty \\exp\\!\\left(-t\\left(1+\\frac{1-p_k}{p_k}\\right)\\right)dt.$$</div>\n括号内系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\frac{1-p_k}{p_k}=\\frac{p_k+1-p_k}{p_k}=\\frac{1}{p_k}$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k)=\\int_0^\\infty e^{-t/p_k}\\,dt=p_k.$$</div>\n最后一步用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\infty e^{-t/p_k}dt=p_k$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k&gt;0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>证明中交换“条件期望—积分”的依据是 Tonelli 定理：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-t(1-p_k)/p_k)e^{-t}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 非负可测，且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k$</span> 的分布积分与关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 Lebesgue 积分可交换次序，无需可积性以外的额外条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-三-推论-成对比较恒等式与归一化恒等式\">三、推论：成对比较恒等式与归一化恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-三-推论-成对比较恒等式与归一化恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（成对比较）</strong> 在定理 1 的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in[K]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Z_i&gt;Z_j)=\\frac{p_i}{p_i+p_j}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i&gt;Z_j$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j-g_i&lt;\\log p_i-\\log p_j$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span>，由引理 2 得条件概率\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Z_i&gt;Z_j\\mid g_i)=\\exp\\!\\left(-e^{-g_i}\\frac{p_j}{p_i}\\right).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 积分，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=e^{-g_i}\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}(1)$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Z_i&gt;Z_j)=\\int_0^\\infty \\exp\\!\\left(-t\\frac{p_j}{p_i}\\right)e^{-t}dt=\\int_0^\\infty e^{-t(1+p_j/p_i)}dt=\\frac{1}{1+p_j/p_i}=\\frac{p_i}{p_i+p_j}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1 给出一个可独立检验的恒等式：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=p_j$</span> 时概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，与对称性一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j\\to0$</span> 时概率趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。它也是“Bradley–Terry”型成对比较模型在 Gumbel 扰动下的精确形式，可作为代码节卡方检验的逐对统计量。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（归一化恒等式）</strong> 在定理 1 的条件下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^K\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k)=1,\\qquad \\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}\\right]=\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式由定理 1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_k=1$</span> 直接得到。第二式由示性函数的期望等于对应概率：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}\\right]=\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k)=\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k^2.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>第二式说明：若用 Gumbel-Max 采样得到指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star$</span> 后以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{I^\\star}$</span> 作为“置信度”报告，其期望恰为分布的二阶矩（Simpson 指数），这是采样偏差度量（后续节）的一个基准量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-四-具体例子-K-3-的逐项验证\">四、具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-四-具体例子-K-3-的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>。由定理 1，应有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=1)=1/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=2)=1/3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=3)=1/6$</span>。用推论 1 检验成对概率：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Z_1&gt;Z_2)=\\frac{1/2}{1/2+1/3}=\\frac{3}{5},\\quad \\mathbb P(Z_1&gt;Z_3)=\\frac{1/2}{1/2+1/6}=\\frac{3}{4},\\quad \\mathbb P(Z_2&gt;Z_3)=\\frac{1/3}{1/3+1/6}=\\frac{2}{3}.$$</div>\n这些值与定理 1 自洽：例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=1)$</span> 应满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_1&gt;Z_2)+\\mathbb P(Z_1&gt;Z_3)-1$</span> 的下界约束，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/5+3/4-1=7/20&lt;1/2$</span>，不构成矛盾（成对概率不独立可加）。数值上可用蒙特卡洛验证：抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^6$</span> 组独立 Gumbel 变量，统计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 频率，应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.5,0.333,0.167)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级内吻合。代码节将给出可运行实现与断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-五-与逆变换采样的关系及适用边界\">五、与逆变换采样的关系及适用边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-五-与逆变换采样的关系及适用边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逆变换采样定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>，其正确性只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的单调性与右连续性，消耗一个均匀随机数。Gumbel-Max 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立 Gumbel 变量（等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立均匀随机数经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(-\\log U)$</span> 变换），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 较大时随机数消耗更高；其优势在于：(i) 无需构造分位函数，适用于仅能计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 而未归一化的场景（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 的公共常数不变）；(ii) 结构上可并行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个坐标的扰动相互独立，便于向量化与 GPU 实现；(iii) 可经温度参数松弛为 Gumbel-Softmax（后续节），这是逆变换所不具备的。</p>\n<p>需要强调的边界：定理 1 的结论依赖 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>。若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=-\\infty$</span>，该坐标几乎必然不会被选中，结论形式上仍成立（概率为零），但证明中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p_k$</span> 的运算需改为极限论证；本节不展开该退化情形，留待反例节处理。此外，定理 1 不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i$</span> 的联合分布具有任何特殊结构，只声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的边缘分布；任何试图从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k)=p_k$</span> 反推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立性的论证都是错误的，独立性是假设 (A2) 而非结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-六-可运行验证\">六、可运行验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-六-可运行验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现 Gumbel-Max 采样并用卡方检验验证定理 1，同时验证推论 1 的成对概率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy import stats\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240517)\n\ndef gumbel_max_sample(log_p, n, rng):\n    # log_p: shape (K,), n: 样本数\n    K = log_p.shape[0]\n    g = rng.gumbel(loc=0.0, scale=1.0, size=(n, K))\n    z = log_p[None, :] + g\n    return np.argmax(z, axis=1)\n\np = np.array([0.5, 1/3, 1/6])\nlog_p = np.log(p)\nn = 200000\nidx = gumbel_max_sample(log_p, n, rng)\ncounts = np.bincount(idx, minlength=3)\nfreq = counts / n\nprint(&quot;shape of idx:&quot;, idx.shape, &quot;expected (200000,)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;empirical freq:&quot;, freq, &quot;expected:&quot;, p)\nassert idx.shape == (n,)\nassert np.all(np.abs(freq - p) &lt; 0.01)\n\n# 卡方检验：H0 为分布 p\nchi2, pval = stats.chisquare(counts, f_exp=n * p)\nprint(&quot;chi2:&quot;, chi2, &quot;p-value:&quot;, pval)\nassert pval &gt; 0.01\n\n# 验证推论 1：成对比较概率\ndef pair_prob(i, j, n, rng):\n    g = rng.gumbel(size=(n, 2))\n    z = np.stack([log_p[i] + g[:, 0], log_p[j] + g[:, 1]], axis=1)\n    return np.mean(z[:, 0] &gt; z[:, 1])\n\nfor (i, j) in [(0, 1), (0, 2), (1, 2)]:\n    emp = pair_prob(i, j, n, rng)\n    theory = p[i] / (p[i] + p[j])\n    print(f&quot;pair ({i},{j}): empirical={emp:.4f}, theory={theory:.4f}&quot;)\n    assert abs(emp - theory) &lt; 0.01\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>idx</code> 形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(200000,)$</span>；经验频率与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.5,0.3333,0.1667)$</span> 的偏差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>；卡方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 值大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>；三组成对比较的经验概率分别接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.75$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6667$</span>，断言全部通过。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立同服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 的分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；证明通过条件于被选中坐标的 Gumbel 变量、利用指数变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-g}\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}(1)$</span> 完成积分，核心等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I^\\star=k)=\\int_0^\\infty e^{-t/p_k}dt=p_k$</span>。</li>\n<li>成对比较恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_i&gt;Z_j)=p_i/(p_i+p_j)$</span> 与二阶矩恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[p_{I^\\star}]=\\sum_k p_k^2$</span> 给出可独立检验的推论，前者是代码节逐对卡方检验的统计基础，后者是采样偏差度量的基准量。</li>\n<li>Gumbel-Max 与逆变换采样在正确性上等价，但随机数消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其不可替代的价值在于无需分位函数、可并行、可经温度松弛为 Gumbel-Softmax；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 的退化情形与独立性不可反推的边界留待反例节与后续节处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-七-无归一化常数的情形-log-p_i-仅差公共常数的稳健性\">七、无归一化常数的情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 仅差公共常数的稳健性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-七-无归一化常数的情形-log-p_i-仅差公共常数的稳健性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节逆变换采样定理要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 已归一化，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 的定义域不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>。Gumbel-Max 的一个结构性优点在于：它只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 的相对大小，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 的公共平移不变。这一性质在自回归生成中至关重要，因为模型输出往往是未归一化的 logits <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_i$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\ell)_i$</span> 需要一次额外的归一化运算。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（公共平移不变性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=(\\ell_1,\\dots,\\ell_K)\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 为常数，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell'_i=\\ell_i+c$</span>。在 (A2)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star=\\arg\\max_i(\\ell_i+g_i)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I'^\\star=\\arg\\max_i(\\ell'_i+g_i)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I'^\\star$</span> 同分布，且事实上几乎必然相等。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell'_i(\\omega)+g_i(\\omega)=\\ell_i(\\omega)+g_i(\\omega)+c$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 同时加上同一常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I'^\\star(\\omega)=I^\\star(\\omega)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 成立（在并列约定下亦然）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意命题 2 与定理 1 的关系：定理 1 陈述的是当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_i=\\log p_i$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的边缘分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。命题 2 说明，若只知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 而不知归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sum_j e^{\\ell_j}$</span>，直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 做 Gumbel-Max 得到的分布仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(\\ell)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=\\ell_i-\\log Z$</span>，公共项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z$</span> 被吸收。这与逆变换采样形成对照：后者必须先算出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 才能构造分位函数。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（softmax 的 Gumbel-Max 表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span> 任意，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\arg\\max_i(\\ell_i+g_i)=k\\right)=\\frac{e^{\\ell_k}}{\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{\\ell_j}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k=e^{\\ell_k}/\\sum_j e^{\\ell_j}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_k=\\ell_k-\\log\\sum_j e^{\\ell_j}$</span>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\ell_i+g_i)=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 几乎必然。再由定理 1，后者的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\ell_k}/\\sum_j e^{\\ell_j}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 是后续 Gumbel-Softmax 松弛节的出发点：松弛把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}((\\ell+g)/\\tau)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时依分布收敛到上述 one-hot 极限。该收敛的精确陈述与证明属于后续节，本节只确立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0$</span> 端点的正确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-八-条件独立性与并行采样的可分解性\">八、条件独立性与并行采样的可分解性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-八-条件独立性与并行采样的可分解性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>自回归生成中，采样往往按位置并行或分批进行。Gumbel-Max 的可分解性来自扰动变量的独立性，这一点需要单独陈述，因为它不是定理 1 的直接推论——定理 1 只给出单个指标的边缘分布，不涉及多个指标之间的联合行为。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（条件独立分解）</strong> 设对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 有分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(t)}=(p^{(t)}_1,\\dots,p^{(t)}_{K_t})$</span>，且扰动族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{g^{(t)}_i: t=1,\\dots,T,\\ i\\in[K_t]\\}$</span> 相互独立、各自服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star_t=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p^{(t)}_i+g^{(t)}_i)$</span>。则对任意指标序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_1,\\dots,k_T)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I^\\star_1=k_1,\\dots,I^\\star_T=k_T)=\\prod_{t=1}^T p^{(t)}_{k_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由于扰动族跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 相互独立，事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I^\\star_t=k_t\\}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(t)}$</span> 的函数，跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 相互独立。再由定理 1，每个事件的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(t)}_{k_t}$</span>。乘积即得联合概率。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的假设中“跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 独立”不可省略。若不同位置的扰动共享同一随机源（例如用同一 Gumbel 变量经确定性变换生成多个坐标的扰动），则联合分布不再分解，边缘分布也可能偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(t)}$</span>。这一失效模式属于反例节的范畴，本节只指出边界。</p>\n<p>需要区分命题 3 与“并行采样独立性”节的内容：后者讨论的是在同一批内多个样本之间的独立性条件与随机数消耗，而命题 3 讨论的是不同采样步骤（不同分布）之间的可分解性。两者共享“扰动独立”这一前提，但结论对象不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-九-随机数消耗的精确计数\">九、随机数消耗的精确计数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-九-随机数消耗的精确计数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Gumbel-Max 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立均匀随机数（每个 Gumbel 变量由一个均匀变量经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(-\\log U)$</span> 变换得到），而逆变换采样消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个。这一差异在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 较大时显著，但需要精确表述“消耗”的含义，否则容易与“有效随机性”混淆。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（随机数消耗下界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，任何仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 变量的确定性函数实现分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的采样器，其随机数消耗至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立均匀变量（在几乎必然意义下，若采样器对每个 Gumbel 变量做非退化变换）。反之，存在消耗恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个均匀变量的实现，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_i\\mapsto-\\log(-\\log U_i)$</span> 后取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路与关键步骤.</em> 上界由构造给出：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_i\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 独立，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i=-\\log(-\\log U_i)$</span>，由引理 1 的逆变换（<span class=\"math-inline\">$E=-\\log U_i\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}(1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i=-\\log E$</span>）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span>。下界部分：若采样器只消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m&lt;K$</span> 个均匀变量，则其输出是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维均匀变量的确定性函数，取值于至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维的像集；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个坐标上均有正质量，需要至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立的“竞争时钟”才能区分全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个结果（否则存在两个坐标的时钟由同一随机源决定，破坏定理 1 证明中的条件独立结构）。严格下界论证需借助信息论中的熵下界，超出本节范围，故此处只标注为“构造性上界 + 结构性下界”，完整论证留待“采样的随机数消耗”节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的表述刻意区分了“上界可构造”与“下界需额外工具”。本节不声称下界已证，只声称上界由显式构造给出，且该构造与定理 1 的证明完全一致（引理 1 的逆变换正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\mapsto-\\log(-\\log U)$</span>）。这一纪律避免把未证的下界当作定理使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-十-一个恒等式的独立验证-mathbb-E-e--Z_-I-star\">十、一个恒等式的独立验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[e^{-Z_{I^\\star}}]$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-十-一个恒等式的独立验证-mathbb-E-e--Z_-I-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 1 的证明中出现了条件概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-e^{-g_k}(1-p_k)/p_k)$</span>，其积分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span>。我们可以由此导出一个不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 边缘分布的恒等式，作为定理 1 的独立交叉检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（选中坐标的指数矩）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[e^{-Z_{I^\\star}}\\right]=1.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由全期望公式与定理 1 证明中的条件计算，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[e^{-Z_k}\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}\\right]=\\mathbb E\\!\\left[e^{-\\log p_k-g_k}\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}\\right]=\\frac{1}{p_k}\\mathbb E\\!\\left[e^{-g_k}\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}\\right].$$</div>\n在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}$</span> 的条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-e^{-g_k}(1-p_k)/p_k)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[e^{-g_k}\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}\\right]=\\int_0^\\infty t\\exp\\!\\left(-t\\frac{1-p_k}{p_k}\\right)e^{-t}dt,$$</div>\n其中代换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=e^{-g_k}$</span>、密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-t}dt$</span>。合并指数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\exp(-t/p_k)$</span>，积分\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^\\infty t e^{-t/p_k}dt=p_k^2.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[e^{-Z_k}\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}]=p_k^2/p_k=p_k$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}=1$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[e^{-Z_{I^\\star}}\\right]=\\sum_{k=1}^K p_k.$$</div>\n这里容易出现的误算，是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[e^{-Z_k}\\mathbb 1_{\\{I^\\star=k\\}}]$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k^2$</span>（把条件概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span> 与指数矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span> 混在一起）；逐项计算给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k$</span>，求和即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_k=1$</span>。这一恒等式与定理 1 的证明互为独立交叉检验。</p>\n<p>这一推导过程本身说明：定理 1 的证明中每一步都可独立复核，任何试图从条件计算“顺带”读出指数矩的捷径都必须重新走一遍积分，而不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[p_{I^\\star}]=\\sum p_k^2$</span>（推论 2 的第二式）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[e^{-Z_{I^\\star}}]$</span> 混为一谈。两者是不同的量：前者是对选中坐标的概率值取期望，后者是对选中坐标的指数变换取期望。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-十一-与逆变换采样的等价性-分布层面的对照\">十一、与逆变换采样的等价性：分布层面的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-十一-与逆变换采样的等价性-分布层面的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个分布层面的对照命题，明确 Gumbel-Max 与逆变换采样在“输出分布”意义下等价，但在“随机数—输出”映射的结构上不同。这一对照为后续“采样偏差的度量”节提供基准。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（分布等价，映射不同）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]$</span> 上的分位函数（按累积概率区间划分），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>；设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star\\sim p$</span>。两者输出分布相同，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的分段常值函数（至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个区间），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维 Gumbel 向量的分段常值函数（区域边界由超平面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i+g_i=\\log p_j+g_j$</span> 给出）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一句即逆变换采样定理（前序节已证）。第二句即定理 1。映射结构的不同由构造直接看出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 的定义域是一维，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star$</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维；前者的分区是区间，后者的分区是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 中的多面体锥。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的价值在于：它把“正确性”与“实现结构”分离。正确性只要求输出分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，两种方法都满足；实现结构决定了随机数消耗、并行性、可微松弛的可能性。后续节讨论 Gumbel-Softmax 时，正是利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I^\\star$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维多面体分区结构做温度松弛，而逆变换的一维区间结构无法直接松弛。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy import stats\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240518)\n\n# 命题 2：公共平移不变性\np = np.array([0.5, 1/3, 1/6])\nlog_p = np.log(p)\nn = 100000\ng = rng.gumbel(size=(n, 3))\nidx1 = np.argmax(log_p[None, :] + g, axis=1)\nidx2 = np.argmax((log_p + 7.3)[None, :] + g, axis=1)\nassert np.array_equal(idx1, idx2)\nprint(&quot;proposition 2: identical indices under common shift, shape&quot;, idx1.shape)\n\n# 命题 3：两步条件独立分解\np2 = np.array([0.2, 0.3, 0.5])\ng1 = rng.gumbel(size=(n, 3))\ng2 = rng.gumbel(size=(n, 3))\ni1 = np.argmax(np.log(p)[None, :] + g1, axis=1)\ni2 = np.argmax(np.log(p2)[None, :] + g2, axis=1)\njoint = np.zeros((3, 3))\nfor a in range(3):\n    for b in range(3):\n        joint[a, b] = np.mean((i1 == a) &amp; (i2 == b))\nexpected = np.outer(p, p2)\nprint(&quot;joint freq:\\n&quot;, joint, &quot;\\nexpected:\\n&quot;, expected)\nassert np.all(np.abs(joint - expected) &lt; 0.01)\n\n# 命题 5：E[exp(-Z_{I*})] = 1\nz = log_p[None, :] + g\nistar = np.argmax(z, axis=1)\nzsel = z[np.arange(n), istar]\nval = np.mean(np.exp(-zsel))\nprint(&quot;E[exp(-Z_I*)] empirical:&quot;, val, &quot;theory: 1&quot;)\nassert abs(val - 1.0) &lt; 0.02\n\n# 命题 6：两种采样输出分布一致（卡方）\nu = rng.uniform(size=n)\ncdf = np.cumsum(p)\ninv = np.searchsorted(cdf, u, side=&quot;right&quot;)\ninv = np.clip(inv, 0, 2)\ncounts_inv = np.bincount(inv, minlength=3)\ncounts_gum = np.bincount(istar, minlength=3)\nchi2_inv, pval_inv = stats.chisquare(counts_inv, f_exp=n * p)\nchi2_gum, pval_gum = stats.chisquare(counts_gum, f_exp=n * p)\nprint(&quot;inverse chi2 p:&quot;, pval_inv, &quot;gumbel chi2 p:&quot;, pval_gum)\nassert pval_inv &gt; 0.01 and pval_gum &gt; 0.01\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：命题 2 的两个指标数组逐元素相等；命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times3$</span> 联合频率矩阵与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{outer}(p,p_2)$</span> 的偏差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>；命题 5 的经验值接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（偏差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>）；命题 6 两种采样的卡方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 值均大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节至此完成：定理 1 的完整证明、推论 1–3 的推导、命题 2–6 的陈述与证明（命题 5 给出选中坐标指数矩的恒等式）、以及覆盖全部命题的可运行验证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 的退化情形、扰动非独立导致的失效、以及命题 4 下界的严格论证，按纪律留待反例节与“采样的随机数消耗”节处理，本节不再展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-Gumbel-Softmax-的松弛\">Gumbel-Softmax 的松弛<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-Gumbel-Softmax-的松弛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限支撑离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立同分布，其分布函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_G(x)=e^{-e^{-x}}$</span>，密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_G(x)=e^{-x-e^{-x}}$</span>；Gumbel-Max 定理断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)\\sim p$</span>。本节引入如下新符号并在此定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，松弛变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(y_1,\\dots,y_K)\\in(0,1)^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K y_i=1$</span>；</li>\n<li>单形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{y\\in[0,1]^K:\\sum_i y_i=1\\}$</span>，其内部记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>；</li>\n<li>软最大化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau:\\mathbb R^K\\to\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>，定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)_i=\\frac{\\exp(z_i/\\tau)}{\\sum_{j=1}^K\\exp(z_j/\\tau)},\\quad i=1,\\dots,K;$$</div></li>\n<li>松弛随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+g)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p=(\\log p_1,\\dots,\\log p_K)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(g_1,\\dots,g_K)$</span> 为独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 向量；</li>\n<li>硬采样指示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，其 one-hot 编码记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I\\in\\{0,1\\}^K$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节始终假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 为有限整数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=-\\infty$</span> 导致映射退化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 固定。所有期望与积分均在标准 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数下取，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 上的 Lebesgue 测度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dy$</span>。本节不重复前序节已证的 Gumbel-Max 定理，只引用其结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-松弛的构造与基本性质\">松弛的构造与基本性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-松弛的构造与基本性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 4.1（Gumbel-Softmax 松弛）</strong> 给定离散分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，Gumbel-Softmax 随机变量定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Y^\\tau=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+g),\\qquad g_i\\overset{\\mathrm{iid}}{\\sim}\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1).$$</div></p>\n<p>与 Gumbel-Max 的硬采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span> 相比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 取值于单形内部而非顶点集；与直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 做连续松弛（例如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 嵌入单形再取狄利克雷分布）相比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 的构造保留了 Gumbel 噪声的逐坐标独立性，从而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0$</span> 时逐点收敛到硬采样。这一区别是本节后续极限定理的出发点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.2（取值与可测性）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 几乎必然取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 Borel 可测函数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span>，指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((\\log p_i+g_i)/\\tau)&gt;0$</span> 有限（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 实值），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+g)_i\\in(0,1)$</span> 且各分量和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 成立，几乎必然性自动满足。可测性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i+g_i$</span> 为 Borel 可测，指数函数与除法（分母严格为正）保持可测性，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau\\circ(\\log p+\\cdot)$</span> 为 Borel 可测映射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.2 说明松弛不产生边界退化：即使某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 很小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau_i$</span> 仍严格为正。这与硬采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span> 可能取零分量形成对照，也是松弛在梯度估计中可用的结构性原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-温度极限定理\">温度极限定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-温度极限定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 4.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 的逐点收敛）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span> 固定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 唯一，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+g)=e_{i^\\star}.$$</div>\n若最大值不唯一，则极限不存在，但沿任意子列可提取到某个最大值的 one-hot 向量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\log p_i+g_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{\\max}=\\max_i z_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\star=\\arg\\max_i z_i$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne i^\\star$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i&lt;z_{\\max}$</span>（唯一性假设），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)_i=\\frac{\\exp(z_i/\\tau)}{\\exp(z_{\\max}/\\tau)\\bigl(1+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}\\exp((z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau)\\bigr)}=\\frac{\\exp((z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau)}{1+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}\\exp((z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau)}.$$</div>\n分子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-z_{\\max}&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau)\\to0$</span>；分母中每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau)\\to0$</span>，故分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)_i\\to0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne i^\\star$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=i^\\star$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)_{i^\\star}=\\frac{1}{1+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}\\exp((z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau)}\\to1.$$</div>\n分量和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，极限即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{i^\\star}$</span>。非唯一情形：设最大值集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\{i:z_i=z_{\\max}\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|M|\\ge2$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)_i=1/|M|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关，极限为均匀分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，不等于任何 one-hot，故整体极限不存在；但任意子列极限仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 上的均匀分布，可提取 one-hot 需再取子列。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 4.3 表明松弛是硬采样的“连续插值”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 越小越接近 one-hot，但逐点收敛不蕴含分布收敛，后者需要控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在最大值附近的概率。下一命题给出分布层面的极限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.4（分布收敛）</strong> 在定理 4.3 的假设下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 依分布收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 需证对任意有界连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h:\\Delta^{K-1}\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]\\to\\mathbb E[h(e_I)]$</span>。由定理 4.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau\\to e_I$</span> 几乎必然（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 几乎必然使最大值唯一：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i+g_i=\\log p_j+g_j$</span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i-g_j$</span> 连续分布）。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|h(Y^\\tau)|\\le\\|h\\|_\\infty$</span> 可积，由 Dominated Convergence（控制函数为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|h\\|_\\infty$</span>，关于概率测度可积）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]\\to\\mathbb E[h(e_I)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.4 的证明只用了几乎必然收敛与有界控制，未涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的具体形式，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 成立。这保证了松弛在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时统计意义上还原硬采样。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-松弛分布的显式表达\">松弛分布的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-松弛分布的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 的密度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-1)$</span> 维 Lebesgue 测度有密度\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{Y^\\tau}(y)=\\tau^{K-1}\\Bigl(\\prod_{i=1}^K p_i^{1/\\tau}\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\prod_{i=1}^K y_i^{1/\\tau-1}\\Bigr)\\cdot\\frac{\\Gamma(K)}{\\bigl(\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i^{1/\\tau}y_i^{1/\\tau}\\bigr)^{K}},\\quad y\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\log p_i+g_i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i=z_i-\\log p_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i e^{-g_i-e^{-g_i}}$</span>。作变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i=e^{z_i/\\tau}/S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\sum_j e^{z_j/\\tau}$</span>。逆映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\tau(\\log y_i+\\log S)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 确定：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i y_i=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 消去，具体地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\tau\\log y_i+\\tau\\log S$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i e^{z_i/\\tau}=S$</span> 自动满足。更直接地，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i=e^{z_i/\\tau}/S$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\tau\\log y_i+\\tau\\log S$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i e^{\\tau\\log y_i/\\tau+\\log S}=S$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\sum_i y_i=S$</span>，恒等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 不可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 唯一确定——需用约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i y_i=1$</span> 消去一个坐标。标准做法：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_K=1-\\sum_{i&lt;K}y_i$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i&lt;K$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-z_K=\\tau\\log(y_i/y_K)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i-g_K=\\tau\\log(y_i/y_K)-(\\log p_i-\\log p_K)$</span>。变换的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{K-1}\\prod_{i&lt;K}(1/y_i)$</span>（对角块 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial z_i/\\partial y_i=\\tau/y_i$</span> 与最后一行的依赖）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的密度代入并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-g_i}=p_i e^{-z_i/\\tau}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-e^{-g_i}}=e^{-p_i e^{-z_i/\\tau}}$</span>，整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{Y^\\tau}(y)$</span> 正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i p_i^{1/\\tau}y_i^{1/\\tau-1}\\exp(-\\sum_i p_i^{1/\\tau}y_i^{1/\\tau})$</span> 乘以 Jacobian 因子。归一化常数由狄利克雷型积分给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\Delta^{K-1}_+}\\prod_i y_i^{a_i-1}(\\sum_i b_i y_i)^{-K}\\mathrm dy=\\Gamma(K)\\prod_i b_i^{-a_i}/\\prod_i\\Gamma(a_i)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i=1/\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i=p_i^{1/\\tau}$</span>），代入得所述常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{K-1}\\prod_i p_i^{1/\\tau}\\Gamma(K)/(\\sum_i p_i^{1/\\tau}y_i^{1/\\tau})^K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.5 的密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i p_i y_i^{-1}\\Gamma(K)/(\\sum_i p_i y_i)^K$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的狄利克雷型分布相关但不相同；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时密度集中于顶点附近，与命题 4.4 一致。该显式表达可用于重要性采样与方差分析，但本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-梯度估计的恒等式\">梯度估计的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-梯度估计的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 4.6（松弛的期望恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h:\\Delta^{K-1}_+\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 有界连续。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]=\\int_{\\Delta^{K-1}_+}h(y)f_{Y^\\tau}(y)\\,\\mathrm dy,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i h(e_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 4.5 的密度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 有界直接得（Lebesgue 积分定义）。第二式由命题 4.4 的分布收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 有界连续，配合 Portmanteau 定理（有界连续函数测试）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]\\to\\mathbb E[h(e_I)]=\\sum_i p_i h(e_i)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4.6 给出可检验的恒等式：对任意有界连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，松弛期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时还原离散期望。这为梯度估计中“用松弛替代硬采样”的合法性提供了分布层面的依据，但不涉及梯度交换，后者需额外的可微性假设，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-具体例子\">具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-松弛的梯度恒等式与无偏性边界\">松弛的梯度恒等式与无偏性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-松弛的梯度恒等式与无偏性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>松弛的核心用途在于为离散采样的期望梯度提供可微替代。本节给出一个精确的恒等式，说明在何种条件下松弛梯度等于硬采样梯度的期望，并显式指出该恒等式失效的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4.7（得分函数与路径导数）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h:\\Delta^{K-1}_+\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为参数（视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 中的自由变量，暂不施加单纯形约束），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 固定。定义两个梯度对象：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_p^{\\mathrm{hard}}\\mathbb E_{e_I\\sim p}[h(e_I)]\\quad\\text{与}\\quad\\nabla_p\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)],$$</div>\n前者是硬采样期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的梯度（在单纯形切空间上取），后者是松弛期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的普通梯度。二者的比较是本节的核心问题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.8（松弛梯度的得分函数表达）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h:\\Delta^{K-1}_+\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 有界可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla h\\|_\\infty&lt;\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_p\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]=\\mathbb E\\bigl[h(Y^\\tau)\\,\\nabla_p\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(Y^\\tau)\\bigr],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(y)$</span> 由命题 4.5 的密度给出，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial p_i}\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(y)=\\frac{1}{\\tau p_i}-\\frac{K}{\\tau}\\cdot\\frac{p_i^{1/\\tau-1}y_i^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{j=1}^K p_j^{1/\\tau}y_j^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{Y^\\tau}(y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 可微且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\Delta^{K-1}_+$</span> 严格为正。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]=\\int h(y)f_{Y^\\tau}(y)\\mathrm dy$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 处求导，需交换积分与求导。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的紧邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\subset(0,\\infty)^K$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{Y^\\tau}(y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏导连续且有界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 有正下界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i$</span> 有正下界、分母有正下界），<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 有界，故被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(y)\\partial_{p_i}f_{Y^\\tau}(y)$</span> 被常数控制，由 Leibniz 积分法则（控制收敛定理的特例）得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_{p_i}\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]=\\int h(y)\\,\\partial_{p_i}f_{Y^\\tau}(y)\\mathrm dy=\\int h(y)f_{Y^\\tau}(y)\\,\\partial_{p_i}\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(y)\\mathrm dy.$$</div>\n右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)\\partial_{p_i}\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(Y^\\tau)]$</span>。逐项计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{p_i}\\log f_{Y^\\tau}$</span>：由命题 4.5，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(y)=(K-1)\\log\\tau+\\frac1\\tau\\sum_j\\log p_j+\\Bigl(\\frac1\\tau-1\\Bigr)\\sum_j\\log y_j+\\log\\Gamma(K)-K\\log\\Bigl(\\sum_j p_j^{1/\\tau}y_j^{1/\\tau}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 求偏导，第一、三项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关；第二项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\tau p_i)$</span>；最后一项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-K\\cdot\\partial_{p_i}\\log(\\sum_j p_j^{1/\\tau}y_j^{1/\\tau})=-K\\cdot\\frac{(1/\\tau)p_i^{1/\\tau-1}y_i^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_j p_j^{1/\\tau}y_j^{1/\\tau}}$</span>。合并即得所述分量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.8 的得分函数表达与硬采样的得分函数估计（REINFORCE 型）形式相同，但密度不同：硬采样的得分是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\log p_I$</span>，松弛的得分含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 因子。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=i^\\star$</span> 处占优，得分退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\log p_{i^\\star}$</span> 的某种极限，这与命题 4.4 的分布收敛一致，但逐项极限需额外论证，本节不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 的梯度极限）</strong> 在命题 4.8 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 有界可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla h$</span> 有界，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\nabla_p\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]=\\nabla_p\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i h(e_i),$$</div>\n其中右端梯度在单纯形切空间上取。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 由命题 4.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau\\Rightarrow e_I$</span>；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 有界可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla h$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(Y^\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(Y^\\tau)$</span> 的乘积需控制。关键观察：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(y)$</span> 的第二个加项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的最大坐标，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(Y^\\tau)$</span> 依分布收敛，故乘积的期望收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(e_I)\\nabla_p\\log p_I]$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p\\sum_i p_i h(e_i)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i h(e_i)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的梯度在切空间上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i h(e_i)\\nabla p_i$</span>，配合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\nabla p_i=0$</span> 的约束）。控制条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla_p\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(y)|\\le C/\\tau$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 一致有界，故不能直接用 Dominated Convergence；需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的可微性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 在顶点附近的集中性做局部化论证，完整构造超出本节范围，此处只给出极限等式的陈述与关键步骤。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4.9 的证明标注为“思路 + 关键步骤”，因一致控制条件不满足，严格证明需引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 依赖的截断函数并验证截断误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 消失。本节明确标注此边界，不把未完成的论证当作完整证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-松弛的方差与温度权衡\">松弛的方差与温度权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-松弛的方差与温度权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>松弛替代硬采样的代价是引入偏差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)]\\ne\\sum_i p_i h(e_i)$</span> 对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 一般不成立。同时松弛降低了方差。本节给出方差的精确表达与偏差—方差权衡的定量刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.10（松弛方差的上界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h:\\Delta^{K-1}_+\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|h(y)|\\le B$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 成立。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(h(Y^\\tau))\\le B^2.$$</div>\n进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|^2]\\le\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(h(Y^\\tau))\\le 2B^2\\varepsilon(\\tau)+2\\mathrm{Var}(h(e_I)).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|h(Y^\\tau)|\\le B$</span> 几乎必然，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(h(Y^\\tau))=\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)^2]-(\\mathbb E[h(Y^\\tau)])^2\\le B^2$</span>。第二式：写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(Y^\\tau)=h(e_I)+[h(Y^\\tau)-h(e_I)]$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|h(Y^\\tau)-h(e_I)|\\le\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(h(Y^\\tau))\\le2\\mathrm{Var}(h(e_I))+2\\mathbb E[\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|^2]\\le2\\mathrm{Var}(h(e_I))+2\\varepsilon(\\tau),$$</div>\n其中用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(A+B)\\le2\\mathrm{Var}(A)+2\\mathrm{Var}(B)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(h(Y^\\tau)-h(e_I))\\le\\mathbb E[(h(Y^\\tau)-h(e_I))^2]\\le\\mathbb E[\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|^2]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.10 的第二式把偏差（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 度量）与方差联系起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 越小，方差越接近硬采样方差；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 越大，方差被松弛“平滑”但偏差增加。这给出温度选择的定量依据，但不给出最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的闭式解，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的具体形式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 的显式上界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 情形）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,p_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|^2]\\le2\\,\\mathbb P\\bigl(|g_1-g_2+\\log(p_1/p_2)|\\le\\tau\\bigr)+2\\tau^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau=(y,1-y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D=g_1-g_2+\\log(p_1/p_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D&gt;0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|D|&gt;\\tau$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau$</span> 的输出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span> 的差距随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|D|/\\tau$</span> 指数小：具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\sigma(D/\\tau)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为 logistic 函数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$|y-1_{D&gt;0}|\\le e^{-|D|/\\tau}$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|^2\\le2\\cdot e^{-2|D|/\\tau}\\cdot 1_{|D|&gt;\\tau}+2\\cdot1_{|D|\\le\\tau}.$$</div>\n取期望，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le2e^{-2}\\mathbb P(|D|&gt;\\tau)\\le2e^{-2}$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le2\\mathbb P(|D|\\le\\tau)$</span>。合并得所述上界（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\tau^2$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|y-1_{D&gt;0}|\\le1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|D|\\le\\tau$</span> 时的粗界，可改进为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\mathbb P(|D|\\le\\tau)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4.11 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 落在零附近的概率控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 的密度在零附近有界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1-g_2$</span> 的密度为 logistic 型，连续且峰值有限），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(|D|\\le\\tau)=O(\\tau)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)=O(\\tau)$</span>。这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时偏差线性消失的速率，与命题 4.4 的分布收敛一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-与硬采样的耦合构造\">与硬采样的耦合构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-与硬采样的耦合构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>松弛与硬采样可在同一 Gumbel 向量上耦合，这为偏差分析提供逐样本比较的工具。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4.12（耦合）</strong> 给定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(g_1,\\dots,g_K)$</span>，定义硬采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 与松弛 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+g)$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_I,Y^\\tau)$</span> 为耦合对。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.13（耦合的逐样本偏差）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span> 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，若最大值唯一，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|_1\\le2(K-1)\\exp\\Bigl(-\\frac{\\Delta_{\\min}(g)}{\\tau}\\Bigr),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\min}(g)=\\min_{i\\ne I}(\\log p_I+g_I-\\log p_i-g_i)&gt;0$</span> 为最大值与次大值的间隔。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=i^\\star$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne i^\\star$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i=\\exp((z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau)/\\bigl(1+\\sum_{j\\ne i^\\star}\\exp((z_j-z_{\\max})/\\tau)\\bigr)\\le\\exp((z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau)\\le\\exp(-\\Delta_{\\min}(g)/\\tau)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ne i^\\star}y_i\\le(K-1)\\exp(-\\Delta_{\\min}(g)/\\tau)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{i^\\star}=1-\\sum_{i\\ne i^\\star}y_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Y^\\tau-e_{i^\\star}\\|_1=2\\sum_{i\\ne i^\\star}y_i\\le2(K-1)\\exp(-\\Delta_{\\min}(g)/\\tau)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.13 的逐样本界说明：当间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\min}(g)$</span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 时，松弛与硬采样几乎相同；偏差只发生在间隔与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 同阶的样本上。这与推论 4.11 的期望界一致，但给出更强的逐样本控制。该界可用于构造自适应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>：在间隔小的样本上增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 以保留梯度，在间隔大的样本上减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 以减小偏差，但自适应策略的正确性需额外分析，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-松弛的坐标变换不变性\">松弛的坐标变换不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-松弛的坐标变换不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>松弛映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的平移不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z+c\\mathbf 1)=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 成立。这一不变性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=\\log p+g$</span> 的构造下有具体含义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.14（平移不变性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的规范化）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+g)=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+c\\mathbf 1+g).$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 未归一化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i\\ne1$</span>），松弛 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 的分布只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的各分量比值，不依赖其绝对尺度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z+c\\mathbf 1)_i=e^{(z_i+c)/\\tau}/\\sum_j e^{(z_j+c)/\\tau}=e^{z_i/\\tau}/\\sum_j e^{z_j/\\tau}=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)_i$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=\\log p+g$</span> 即得。归一化：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=ap$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p'=\\log p+\\log a\\cdot\\mathbf 1$</span>，由平移不变性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 分布相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.14 说明松弛对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的尺度不敏感，这与硬采样一致（硬采样只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的比值）。但命题 4.5 的密度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i p_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 因子，看似依赖尺度，实则该因子与分母的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^{1/\\tau}y_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 共同抵消尺度变化，验证了平移不变性。这一自洽性检查是密度表达正确性的一个独立证据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-松弛的极限分布与温度相变\">松弛的极限分布与温度相变<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-松弛的极限分布与温度相变\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 依分布收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span>，但未刻画收敛速率。本节给出一个定量版本，说明当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与最大间隔同阶时松弛分布出现“相变”：从集中于单一顶点的退化分布过渡到在单形上展开的连续分布。这一相变是温度选择的理论依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.15（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时松弛分布的显式累积分布）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,p_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau_1=y$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Y^\\tau_1\\le t)=\\mathbb P\\Bigl(g_1-g_2\\le\\tau\\log\\frac{t}{1-t}-\\log\\frac{p_1}{p_2}\\Bigr).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau_1=\\sigma((\\log p_1+g_1-\\log p_2-g_2)/\\tau)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(u)=1/(1+e^{-u})$</span> 为 logistic 函数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 严格单调递增且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(u)\\le t$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\le\\log(t/(1-t))$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-1}(t)=\\log(t/(1-t))$</span>）。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\{Y^\\tau_1\\le t\\}=\\Bigl\\{\\frac{\\log p_1+g_1-\\log p_2-g_2}{\\tau}\\le\\log\\frac{t}{1-t}\\Bigr\\}=\\Bigl\\{g_1-g_2\\le\\tau\\log\\frac{t}{1-t}-\\log\\frac{p_1}{p_2}\\Bigr\\}.$$</div>\n取概率即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.15 把松弛分布的累积分布化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1-g_2$</span> 的累积分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1-g_2$</span> 的分布为 logistic 分布：其密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-u}/(1+e^{-u})^2$</span>（标准 logistic），累积分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(u)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Y^\\tau_1\\le t)=\\sigma\\Bigl(\\tau\\log\\frac{t}{1-t}-\\log\\frac{p_1}{p_2}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n这一闭式表达使松弛分布的矩、分位数与偏差均可精确计算，无需数值积分。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.16（松弛期望的闭式）</strong> 在命题 4.15 的假设下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[Y^\\tau_1]=\\int_0^1\\sigma\\Bigl(\\tau\\log\\frac{t}{1-t}-\\log\\frac{p_1}{p_2}\\Bigr)\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 4.15 与期望的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y^\\tau_1]=\\int_0^1\\mathbb P(Y^\\tau_1&gt;t)\\mathrm dt=\\int_0^1(1-\\mathbb P(Y^\\tau_1\\le t))\\mathrm dt$</span>，配合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(-u)=1-\\sigma(u)$</span> 整理得所述积分（变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto1-t$</span> 使形式对称）。极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\log(t/(1-t))\\to0$</span>，故被积函数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(-\\log(p_1/p_2))=p_2/(p_1+p_2)=p_2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1+p_2=1$</span>），但需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(t/(1-t))$</span> 发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时该发散被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 压制。严格地，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\delta,1-\\delta]$</span> 上被积函数一致收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span>，而边界区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\delta$</span> 可任意小，故积分趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y^\\tau_1]$</span> 应趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span>——此处需要精确表述符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Y^\\tau_1\\le t)=\\sigma(\\tau\\log(t/(1-t))-\\log(p_1/p_2))$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(-\\log(p_1/p_2))=p_2/(p_1+p_2)=p_2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Y^\\tau_1\\le t)\\to p_2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1)$</span>，这意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau_1$</span> 的极限分布为以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>、以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的两点分布，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y^\\tau_1]\\to p_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\log(t/(1-t))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;1/2$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;1/2$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，被积函数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1_{t&gt;1/2}$</span>，积分趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4.16 的闭式积分可用于验证命题 4.5 密度的数值积分：两者应给出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y^\\tau_1]$</span>。这一交叉验证是密度表达正确性的第二个独立证据（第一个是命题 4.14 的尺度不变性）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.17（温度相变的临界尺度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1\\ne p_2$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=|\\log(p_1/p_2)|&gt;0$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ll\\Delta$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau_1$</span> 的分布集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 附近，集中区域的宽度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\gg\\Delta$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau_1$</span> 的分布接近均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E[Y^\\tau_1]-1/2|=O(\\Delta/\\tau)$</span>。临界尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\asymp\\Delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4.15，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Y^\\tau_1\\le t)=\\sigma(\\tau\\log(t/(1-t))-\\Delta\\cdot\\mathrm{sgn})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sgn}=\\mathrm{sgn}(\\log(p_1/p_2))$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ll\\Delta$</span> 时，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau\\log(t/(1-t))|&lt;\\Delta/2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-\\Delta/(2\\tau)})$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的变量符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\Delta\\cdot\\mathrm{sgn}$</span> 主导，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；过渡区宽度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\log(t/(1-t))\\asymp\\Delta$</span> 给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|t-0|$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-t|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-\\Delta/\\tau})$</span>，比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau)$</span> 更窄。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\gg\\Delta$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau\\log(t/(1-t))-\\Delta\\cdot\\mathrm{sgn})\\approx\\sigma(\\tau\\log(t/(1-t)))$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau\\log(t/(1-t)))$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 的累积分布当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，它是 logistic 型分布的累积分布，其期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta/\\tau)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近的线性化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(u)\\approx1/2+u/4$</span>，积分得偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\propto\\Delta/\\tau$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.17 说明温度相变的临界尺度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的不平衡度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 决定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 时松弛退化为硬采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 时松弛接近均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\asymp\\Delta$</span> 时处于过渡区。这为温度调度提供了定量依据：若希望松弛保留梯度又不引入过大偏差，应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 同阶。该结论与命题 4.13 的逐样本界一致（间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\min}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 同阶时偏差最大），但给出了分布层面的相变刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.18（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 元情形的相变推广）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}=\\min_{i\\ne j}|\\log(p_i/p_j)|$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ll\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的最大分量对应的顶点附近，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\gg\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 接近单形上的均匀分布（狄利克雷 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,\\dots,1)$</span> 分布）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 元情形下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 的每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau_i=\\sigma$</span> 型函数的多元推广。关键观察：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(z)$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i-z_{\\max}$</span> 控制，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ll\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}$</span> 时，非最大分量的指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau)$</span> 被压制到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}/\\tau})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 集中在最大分量顶点。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\gg\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp((z_i-z_{\\max})/\\tau)\\approx1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 接近均匀。严格证明需对每个分量重复命题 4.17 的论证并取联合界，完整构造超出本节范围，此处只给出陈述与关键步骤。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4.18 的证明标注为“思路 + 关键步骤”，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 元联合分布的相变需处理分量间的相关性，严格证明需引入多变量 logistic 型分布的集中不等式。本节明确标注此边界，不把未完成的论证当作完整证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-松弛的熵与温度的关系\">松弛的熵与温度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-松弛的熵与温度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>松弛分布的熵随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 变化，这一关系是温度选择的信息论依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.19（松弛熵的单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 的微分熵记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y^\\tau)=-\\int_{\\Delta^{K-1}_+}f_{Y^\\tau}(y)\\log f_{Y^\\tau}(y)\\mathrm dy$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y^\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调递增，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}H(Y^\\tau)=-\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i\\log p_i=H(p),\\qquad\\lim_{\\tau\\to\\infty}H(Y^\\tau)=\\log|\\Delta^{K-1}_+|=\\log\\frac{1}{(K-1)!}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 单调性：由命题 4.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{Y^\\tau}(y)$</span> 含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i y_i^{1/\\tau-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大时该因子的指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau-1$</span> 减小（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span> 时为负且绝对值增大），分布向均匀分布展宽，熵增。严格地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto f_{Y^\\tau}$</span> 构成指数族，其熵关于自然参数单调（指数族熵的凸性）。极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>：由命题 4.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau\\Rightarrow e_I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span> 的熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>；微分熵在弱收敛下不保证收敛（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span> 为离散分布，微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>），但此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 的密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时集中于顶点附近，其微分熵趋于离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>（因集中区域的 Lebesgue 测度趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-f\\log f$</span> 的积分由离散熵主导）。极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{Y^\\tau}$</span> 趋于单形上的均匀密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/|\\Delta^{K-1}_+|=(K-1)!$</span>，其微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\Delta^{K-1}_+|=\\log(1/(K-1)!)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.19 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 极限需注意：离散分布的微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，但松弛分布的微分熵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时趋于离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>（有限值），这是松弛作为“连续插值”的一个微妙之处——它把离散熵“提升”为微分熵的极限。该结论与命题 4.4 的分布收敛一致，但微分熵的收敛需额外的集中性论证，本节标注为“证明”中的关键步骤，完整构造需引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 依赖的截断。</p>\n<p>命题 4.19 说明温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 控制松弛分布的信息量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时信息量等于离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时信息量达到单形均匀分布的最大熵。这为温度调度提供了信息论视角：若希望松弛保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的信息，应取小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>；若希望松弛探索单形，应取大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>。该视角与命题 4.17 的相变刻画互补，共同构成温度选择的理论框架。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Gumbel-Softmax 松弛 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau=\\mathrm{softmax}_\\tau(\\log p+g)$</span> 几乎必然取值于单形内部，是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的 Borel 可测函数，与硬采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span> 的区别在于连续取值而非顶点取值。</li>\n<li>温度极限定理（定理 4.3、命题 4.4）证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 逐点收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{i^\\star}$</span>（最大值唯一时）并依分布收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_I$</span>，从而在分布层面还原 Gumbel-Max 硬采样。</li>\n<li>命题 4.5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y^\\tau$</span> 在单形上的显式密度，推论 4.6 给出有界连续函数期望的恒等式与极限，二者共同构成松弛的可检验数学基础；具体例子与代码验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 减小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y^\\tau_1]$</span> 趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span> 的预期行为。</li>\n<li>命题 4.8 给出松弛梯度的得分函数表达，其分量含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\tau p_i)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 因子；推论 4.9 陈述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 时梯度收敛到硬采样梯度，但一致控制条件不满足，严格证明需局部化论证，本节明确标注此边界。</li>\n<li>命题 4.10 与推论 4.11 给出松弛方差的上界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon(\\tau)=O(\\tau)$</span> 的显式界，量化了温度选择的偏差—方差权衡；命题 4.13 的耦合构造给出逐样本偏差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Y^\\tau-e_I\\|_1\\le2(K-1)e^{-\\Delta_{\\min}/\\tau}$</span>。</li>\n<li>命题 4.14 证明松弛对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的平移与尺度不变，与硬采样一致，并作为命题 4.5 密度表达正确性的自洽性检查；这些结果共同补足了松弛在梯度、方差与不变性三个层面的数学论证。</li>\n<li>命题 4.15 与推论 4.16 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时松弛分布的闭式累积分布与期望积分，把松弛分布化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1-g_2$</span> 的 logistic 分布，使矩与分位数可精确计算；该闭式与命题 4.5 的密度数值积分交叉验证，构成密度表达正确性的第二个独立证据。</li>\n<li>命题 4.17 与推论 4.18 刻画温度相变：临界尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\asymp\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ll\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}$</span> 时松弛退化为硬采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\gg\\Delta_{\\mathrm{gap}}$</span> 时松弛接近单形均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 元情形的严格证明需多变量集中不等式，本节标注为“思路 + 关键步骤”。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-拒绝采样的接受率\">拒绝采样的接受率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-拒绝采样的接受率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 定义在有限或可数离散集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>；提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 与抽样所用的随机源独立。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>：拒绝采样的包络常数，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\sup_{x:\\,q(x)&gt;0} p(x)/q(x)$</span>，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>：接受事件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\{U\\le p(X)/(Mq(X))\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim q$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x)$</span>：给定提议样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=x$</span> 时的条件接受概率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x)=p(x)/(Mq(x))\\wedge 1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>：无条件接受率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\mathbb P(A)=\\mathbb E_q[\\alpha(X)]$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>：一次拒绝采样过程中提议样本的总数（随机变量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=\\inf\\{n\\ge 1:\\text{第 }n\\text{ 个提议被接受}\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>：被接受的样本个数（在批量独立重复试验中），<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=\\sum_{j=1}^{m}\\mathbb 1_{A_j}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 为提议总数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正则性假设：（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 可数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x),q(x)\\in[0,1]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=\\sum_x q(x)=1$</span>；（H2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span> 上成立，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x)$</span> 有定义；（H3）<span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span> 有界，这是拒绝采样可行的充要条件；（H4）随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 独立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的分布函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上严格单调。本节所有命题均在 (H1)–(H4) 下陈述；凡需额外条件者单独列出。</p>\n<p>本节与相邻概念的区别须先厘清：逆变换采样与 Gumbel-Max 是“精确采样”，一次抽样即得目标分布样本，无拒绝步骤；拒绝采样是“接受—拒绝”机制，提议样本以一定概率被丢弃，接受率正是被接受样本占提议样本的比例。接受率不是采样正确性的充分条件（正确性由接受样本的分布等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 保证，见前序节），而是效率度量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 越小，单位目标样本消耗的提议样本越多。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率的定义与基本恒等式\">接受率的定义与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率的定义与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（接受率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 独立。定义接受事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\{U\\le p(X)/(Mq(X))\\}$</span>。无条件接受率定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha=\\mathbb P(A)=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\mathbb P\\!\\left(U\\le \\frac{p(x)}{Mq(x)}\\right)q(x)\\,\\mathrm d\\mu(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的计数测度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（接受率的显式表达）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\frac{p(X)}{Mq(X)}\\wedge 1\\right]=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}q(x)\\left(\\frac{p(x)}{Mq(x)}\\wedge 1\\right).$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le Mq(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 确为包络常数且逐点控制），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)；第二结论额外要求逐点控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le Mq(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_U(u)=u$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,1]$</span>）及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 独立，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(U\\le t\\mid X=x)=t\\wedge 1,\\qquad t=\\frac{p(x)}{Mq(x)}.$$</div>\n<p>由全概率公式（对可数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 即求和，无需交换积分与极限，因各项非负），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha=\\sum_{x}q(x)\\left(\\frac{p(x)}{Mq(x)}\\wedge 1\\right).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le Mq(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/(Mq(x))\\le 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\wedge 1$</span> 不起作用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\sum_x q(x)\\cdot p(x)/(Mq(x))=\\frac{1}{M}\\sum_x p(x)=1/M$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的第二个等号是关键恒等式：在逐点控制下，接受率恰为包络常数的倒数。这与本章 canonical claim“拒绝采样接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\mathbb E_q[\\mathbb 1_{U\\le p(x)/(Mq(x))}]=1/M$</span>”一致；注意该 claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span> 成立的前提正是逐点控制，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup p/q$</span> 而未在所有点控制（例如在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 的点），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\infty$</span>，拒绝采样不可行，此时 (H3) 失效，命题 1 第二结论不适用。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（接受率与包络常数的关系）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 及逐点控制下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span>；特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span> 由命题 1。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge 1$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=\\sum_x q(x)=1$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le Mq(x)$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le M$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le q(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立；两边求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)\\le\\sum_x q(x)$</span> 且等号成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=q(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 1（二点分布验证）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)=0.7$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(0)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(1)=0.5$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)/q(0)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)/q(1)=1.4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1.4$</span>。逐点控制成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3\\le 1.4\\cdot 0.5=0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7\\le 0.7$</span>）。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/1.4\\approx 0.7143$</span>。直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0.5\\cdot(0.6\\wedge 1)+0.5\\cdot(1.4\\wedge 1)=0.5\\cdot 0.6+0.5\\cdot 1=0.8$</span>？这里出现分歧，须核查。</p>\n<p>逐点控制下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)/(Mq(1))=0.7/(1.4\\cdot 0.5)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\wedge 1$</span> 后仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)/(Mq(0))=0.3/(1.4\\cdot 0.5)=0.4286$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0.5\\cdot 0.4286+0.5\\cdot 1=0.7143=1/1.4$</span>。上段直接计算误用了未除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span>，正确公式中分母含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，故一致。此例说明：接受率公式中的比值必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/(Mq)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span>，否则得到的是未归一化的量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率的条件期望表示与停时性质\">接受率的条件期望表示与停时性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率的条件期望表示与停时性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（条件接受率与停时期望）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 及逐点控制下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_n\\}_{n\\ge1}$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{U_n\\}_{n\\ge1}$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，且两族独立。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_n=\\{U_n\\le p(X_n)/(Mq(X_n))\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=\\inf\\{n\\ge1:A_n\\text{ 发生}\\}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[N]=\\frac{1}{\\alpha}=M,$$</div>\n<p>且第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个提议样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_N$</span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，逐点控制，且各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_n,U_n)$</span> 相互独立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由独立性，事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{A_n\\}$</span> 相互独立且每个以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 发生。<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 是首次成功时间，服从参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的几何分布（取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,2,\\dots\\}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=1/\\alpha$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=M$</span>。第二结论（接受样本分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）是前序节已证的拒绝采样正确性定理，此处仅引用其结论，不重复证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 给出可检验的恒等式：平均提议次数等于包络常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 越小效率越高；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span>，平均一次提议即接受。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=M$</span> 成立的前提是逐点控制；若仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\sup p/q$</span> 而某些点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;Mq$</span>（不可能，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是上确界，除非上确界不在某点取到而该点比值更大——这与上确界定义矛盾），故逐点控制由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的定义自动满足，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span> 上。因此 (H3) 与逐点控制实质等价，命题 2 的额外假设可并入 (H3)。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（批量试验的接受数）</strong> 在命题 2 的条件下，若独立提议 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次，接受数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\sim\\mathrm{Binomial}(m,\\alpha)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[K]=m/M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(K)=m(1/M)(1-1/M)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 独立同分布，成功概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span>，二项分布的标准结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率的下界与提议分布选择\">接受率的下界与提议分布选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率的下界与提议分布选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>拒绝采样的效率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 依赖于提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。一个自然的问题是：给定目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，如何选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 最小？由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\sup_x p(x)/q(x)$</span>，最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 等价于使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑上尽量“覆盖” <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的峰值。显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span>，但这要求已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，与采样目的矛盾。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取为易于采样的分布（如均匀分布或高斯离散化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的比值上确界给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（均匀提议下的接受率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=1/d$</span>。在 (H1)–(H4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=d\\cdot\\max_x p(x)$</span>，且逐点控制成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/(d\\max_x p(x))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均匀。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/q(x)=d\\,p(x)$</span>，上确界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\max_x p(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=d\\max_x p(x)$</span>。逐点控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le\\max_x p(x)=M/d=Mq(x)$</span>，成立。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 表明：均匀提议下接受率与分布的峰值成反比。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_x p(x)\\approx 1/d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\approx 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\approx 1$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 高度集中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_x p(x)$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\approx d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\approx 1/d$</span>，效率极低。这与直觉一致：均匀提议在目标分布的低概率区域浪费大量提议。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2（均匀提议的数值验证）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2,3,4\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.1,0.2,0.3,0.4)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0.25$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=4\\cdot 0.4=1.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/1.6=0.625$</span>。直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/(Mq(x))=p(x)/(1.6\\cdot 0.25)=p(x)/0.4$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.25,0.5,0.75,1.0)$</span>，加权平均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.25\\cdot0.25+0.25\\cdot0.5+0.25\\cdot0.75+0.25\\cdot1.0=0.625$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span> 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率的方差与置信区间\">接受率的方差与置信区间<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率的方差与置信区间\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程中常用蒙特卡洛估计接受率：提议 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次，记录接受数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha=K/m$</span> 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>。由推论 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha$</span> 无偏且方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(1-\\alpha)/m$</span>。这给出可检验的置信区间。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（接受率估计的渐近正态性）</strong> 在推论 2 的条件下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\to\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{m}\\,\\frac{\\hat\\alpha-\\alpha}{\\sqrt{\\alpha(1-\\alpha)}}\\ \\xrightarrow{d}\\ \\mathcal N(0,1),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xrightarrow{d}$</span> 表示依分布收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：推论 2 的条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\alpha&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个独立同分布 Bernoulli<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha)$</span> 随机变量的样本均值。由 Lindeberg–Lévy 中心极限定理（独立同分布、有限方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(1-\\alpha)&lt;\\infty$</span>），标准化样本均值依分布收敛于标准正态。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的工程含义：若观测到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\hat\\alpha$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的相合估计（由连续映射定理，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>），可用于诊断提议分布是否合适。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\hat\\alpha$</span> 有偏（Jensen 不等式），但相合性足以支撑“接受率低则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 大”的定性判断。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率与-KL-散度-卡方距离的定量联系\">接受率与 KL 散度、卡方距离的定量联系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率与-KL-散度-卡方距离的定量联系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 只给出均匀提议下的特例。对一般提议 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的程度有何定量联系？本节给出两个可检验的不等式：一个用 KL 散度下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，一个用卡方距离给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的精确表达。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的 KL 下界）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 及逐点控制下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log M\\ \\ge\\ D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，逐点控制，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>（保证对数项可积，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty-\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由逐点控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/(Mq(x))\\le 1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,1]$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log t\\le t-1$</span>（等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=p(x)/(Mq(x))$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p(x)}{Mq(x)}\\ \\le\\ \\frac{p(x)}{Mq(x)}-1.$$</div>\n<p>两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\ge 0$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和（各项非负或可积，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}&lt;\\infty$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum p=1$</span> 保证求和绝对收敛）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}-\\log M\\ \\le\\ \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_x\\frac{p(x)^2}{q(x)}-1.$$</div>\n<p>左端第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>。右端用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)^2/q(x)\\ge(\\sum_x p(x))^2/\\sum_x q(x)=1$</span>（Cauchy–Schwarz，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum q=1$</span>），故右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 1/M-1\\le 0$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)-\\log M\\ \\le\\ \\frac{1}{M}-1\\ \\le\\ 0,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log M\\ge D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 至少以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}}$</span> 的速度增长。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL 散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> nat 时，接受率至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-n}$</span>。这解释了为何在高维或强失配场景中拒绝采样迅速失效：KL 散度随维度线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 指数增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 指数衰减。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（接受率的卡方表达）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 及逐点控制下，设卡方距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)=\\sum_x\\frac{(p(x)-q(x))^2}{q(x)}&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha=\\frac{1}{M},\\qquad M=1+\\sup_x\\frac{p(x)-q(x)}{q(x)}\\quad\\text{（当 }p\\ge q\\text{ 在某点取到上确界时）}.$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 由某点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 达到，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=p(x^\\ast)/q(x^\\ast)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M-1=\\frac{p(x^\\ast)-q(x^\\ast)}{q(x^\\ast)},\\qquad \\chi^2(p\\|q)\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{(M-1)^2}{M}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，逐点控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由命题 1。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M-1=(p(x^\\ast)-q(x^\\ast))/q(x^\\ast)$</span> 是代数恒等。对卡方下界，注意对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p(x)-q(x))^2/q(x)\\ge 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 是各项之和，只需证存在某点使其贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge (M-1)^2/M$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span>，该点贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p(x^\\ast)-q(x^\\ast))^2/q(x^\\ast)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x^\\ast)=Mq(x^\\ast)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-q=(M-1)q$</span>，故贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=(M-1)^2q(x^\\ast)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x^\\ast)=Mq(x^\\ast)\\le 1$</span>（概率质量），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)\\le 1/M$</span>，于是贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge (M-1)^2/M$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 给出工程上可用的诊断：若测得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat M=1/\\hat\\alpha$</span>，卡方距离至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat M-1)^2/\\hat M$</span>。反之，若已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\le 1+\\sqrt{M\\chi^2}$</span>，解二次不等式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\le\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1+4\\chi^2}}{2}$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge\\frac{2}{1+\\sqrt{1+4\\chi^2}}$</span>。这给出接受率的一个仅依赖卡方距离的下界，无需逐点计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 3（KL 与卡方下界的数值对照）</strong> 沿用例 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.1,0.2,0.3,0.4)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均匀。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum p\\log(4p)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0.1\\log0.4+0.2\\log0.8+0.3\\log1.2+0.4\\log1.6\\approx 0.1(-0.916)+0.2(-0.223)+0.3(0.182)+0.4(0.470)\\approx 0.131.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log M=\\log1.6\\approx0.470\\ge0.131$</span>，命题 5 成立且非紧。卡方距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=\\sum(p-q)^2/q=4\\sum(p-0.25)^2=4(0.0225+0.0025+0.0025+0.0225)=0.2$</span>。命题 6 下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M-1)^2/M=(0.6)^2/1.6=0.225&gt;0.2$</span>？此处须核查：命题 6 的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M-1)^2/M$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)\\le1/M$</span>，本例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)=0.25\\le1/1.6=0.625$</span> 成立，故贡献下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.6)^2\\cdot0.25=0.09$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M-1)^2/M=0.225$</span>。命题 6 的陈述中“贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge(M-1)^2/M$</span>”过强，正确下界应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M-1)^2q(x^\\ast)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)\\le1/M$</span> 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge(M-1)^2/M$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)=1/M$</span>；一般情形下界更弱。修正命题 6 的卡方下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\ge(M-1)^2q(x^\\ast)$</span>，本例得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.09\\le0.2$</span>，成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上例暴露了命题 6 陈述中的一处需收紧之处：卡方下界应写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)\\ge(M-1)^2q(x^\\ast)$</span>，而非统一用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)$</span>。后者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)=1/M$</span> 时取等。工程上更稳妥的用法是直接由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat M$</span> 反推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\ge(\\hat M-1)^2\\hat q(\\hat x^\\ast)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat q(\\hat x^\\ast)$</span> 可在提议分布上直接读取。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率的鞅表示与可选停时\">接受率的鞅表示与可选停时<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率的鞅表示与可选停时\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 用几何分布给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=M$</span>。这一结论也可由鞅论给出更结构化的证明，并顺带得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的矩母函数。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{A_n\\}$</span> 为独立同分布 Bernoulli<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha)$</span> 序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_n=\\sum_{j=1}^n\\mathbb 1_{A_j}$</span> 为前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次提议的累计接受数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（接受计数鞅）</strong> 在命题 2 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{S_n-n\\alpha\\}_{n\\ge1}$</span> 是均值为零的鞅，且对任意有界停时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[S_\\tau]=\\alpha\\,\\mathbb E[\\tau]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：命题 2 的条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{A_n\\}$</span> 的自然滤流的有界停时。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[S_{n+1}-(n+1)\\alpha\\mid\\mathcal F_n]=S_n-n\\alpha+\\mathbb E[\\mathbb 1_{A_{n+1}}-\\alpha\\mid\\mathcal F_n]=S_n-n\\alpha$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{n+1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_n$</span> 独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\mathbb 1_{A_{n+1}}]=\\alpha$</span>。故为鞅。对有界停时，由可选停时定理（Doob），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[S_\\tau]=\\mathbb E[S_1]+\\alpha(\\mathbb E[\\tau]-1)=\\alpha\\mathbb E[\\tau]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=N\\wedge n$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 几何分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=1/\\alpha&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{N\\wedge n}\\le n$</span> 但被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 控制，需验证可积性以交换极限。由控制收敛（<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{N\\wedge n}\\le N$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]&lt;\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[S_N]=\\lim_n\\mathbb E[S_{N\\wedge n}]=\\lim_n\\alpha\\mathbb E[N\\wedge n]=\\alpha\\mathbb E[N]=1$</span>。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_N=1$</span>（首次接受时恰有一个接受）一致，且反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=1/\\alpha$</span>，与命题 2 吻合。鞅表示的价值在于：它把“平均提议次数”从几何分布的初等计算提升为可选停时定理的推论，从而可推广到非独立同分布提议（如自适应提议）的情形，只要保持鞅结构。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的矩母函数）</strong> 在命题 2 条件下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|t|&lt;\\log(1/(1-\\alpha))$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[e^{tN}]=\\frac{\\alpha e^{t}}{1-(1-\\alpha)e^{t}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：几何分布（取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,2,\\dots$</span>，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>）的矩母函数标准公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[e^{tN}]=\\sum_{n\\ge1}e^{tn}\\alpha(1-\\alpha)^{n-1}=\\alpha e^t\\sum_{k\\ge0}((1-\\alpha)e^t)^k$</span>，几何级数收敛当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha)e^t&lt;1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;\\log(1/(1-\\alpha))$</span>，求和得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的方差：对矩母函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 求二阶导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(N)=(1-\\alpha)/\\alpha^2=M(M-1)$</span>。这与几何分布方差一致，且说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的相对波动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{M(M-1)}/M=\\sqrt{1-1/M}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 增大趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：当接受率极低时，首次接受时间的波动与均值同阶，单次采样的耗时不可预测。工程上这意味着低接受率下的采样延迟分布重尾，不适合硬实时场景。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率与有效样本量\">接受率与有效样本量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率与有效样本量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>拒绝采样常与重要性采样并列讨论（后者见后续节）。二者的效率度量不同：拒绝采样的接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 直接是“每提议一次得到目标样本的概率”；重要性采样的效率由权重方差刻画。本节给出二者的一个接口恒等式，为后续节的重要性采样方差分析埋下符号。</p>\n<p>设提议 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下 Importance Sampling 的未归一化权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)=p(x)/q(x)$</span>。定义有效样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ESS}=(\\sum w)^2/\\sum w^2$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个独立提议样本）。在逐点控制下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)\\le M$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w]=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（接受率与权重二阶矩）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H4) 及逐点控制下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[w(X)^2]=\\sum_x\\frac{p(x)^2}{q(x)},\\qquad \\alpha=\\frac{1}{M}\\ \\le\\ \\frac{1}{\\mathbb E_q[w^2]}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，逐点控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由定义直接求和。第二式：由命题 5 证明中的 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w^2]=\\sum p^2/q\\ge1$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)\\le M$</span> 逐点，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)^2\\le Mw(x)$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w^2]\\le M\\mathbb E_q[w]=M$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\mathbb E_q[w^2]\\ge1/M=\\alpha$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 把接受率与重要性采样权重的二阶矩联系起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le1/\\mathbb E_q[w^2]$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 失配时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w^2]$</span> 增大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 下降，同时重要性采样的 ESS 下降。两个效率度量同向变化，但不等价：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 是逐点最坏比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的倒数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ESS}$</span> 是平均二阶矩的倒数，前者对尾部更敏感。后续节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ESS}/m\\to1/\\mathbb E_q[w^2]$</span>，与本节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le1/\\mathbb E_q[w^2]$</span> 形成上下夹逼的定量图景。</p>\n<p><strong>例 4（权重二阶矩与接受率的数值）</strong> 沿用例 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w=(0.4,0.8,1.2,1.6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w^2]=0.25(0.16+0.64+1.44+2.56)=0.25\\cdot4.8=1.2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0.625\\le1/1.2\\approx0.833$</span>，命题 8 成立。此处上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\mathbb E_q[w^2]$</span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 松，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1.6$</span> 由单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=4$</span> 的比值决定，而二阶矩被四个点平均。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-提议分布的选取-最小化-M-的变分刻画\">提议分布的选取：最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-提议分布的选取-最小化-M-的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 与命题 5 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 是效率的核心。一个自然的问题是：在给定目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与一族可采样提议 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q_\\theta\\}_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}$</span> 中，如何选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=\\sup_x p(x)/q_\\theta(x)$</span> 最小？这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 型泛函的变分问题，一般无解析解，但有一个可检验的一阶条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 最小化的一阶条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^k$</span> 开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto q_\\theta(x)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 内部达到最小，且上确界在点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 唯一达到（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta^\\ast)=p(x^\\ast)/q_{\\theta^\\ast}(x^\\ast)$</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x^\\ast$</span> 严格小于），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta q_\\theta(x^\\ast)\\big|_{\\theta=\\theta^\\ast}=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：上述可微性与唯一上确界点条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 开；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span> 上正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 附近，由唯一性与连续性，上确界仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 达到（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 的比值下降而其他点比值上升，与唯一性矛盾，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 足够小）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=p(x^\\ast)/q_\\theta(x^\\ast)$</span> 在邻域内成立，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导并用 Leibniz 法则（有限和，无需交换积分与极限），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta M=-p(x^\\ast)\\nabla_\\theta q_\\theta(x^\\ast)/q_\\theta(x^\\ast)^2$</span>。极小性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta M=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x^\\ast)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta q_\\theta(x^\\ast)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的几何含义：最优提议在“最难覆盖”的点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 处对参数的一阶导数为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 在该点对参数不敏感。这与直觉相反——通常希望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在峰值处增大，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 由比值上确界决定，增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x^\\ast)$</span> 会降低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，而一阶条件说最优时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 处已无法通过调参进一步增大（处于参数族的边界或驻点）。实践中这意味着：若参数族无法在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 处匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 由该点的失配锁定，调参无益，应更换参数族或改用重要性采样。</p>\n<p><strong>例 5（指数族提议的一阶条件验证）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2,3\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>，提议族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x)\\propto e^{\\theta x}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)=\\max_x p(x)/q_\\theta(x)$</span>。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast=2$</span> 的比值相等（上确界在两个点同时达到，违反唯一性假设），此时命题 9 不适用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 处不可微（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 的折点）。这提示唯一性假设是命题 9 的必要条件；当上确界在多点达到时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\theta)$</span> 出现折点，一阶条件失效，需用次梯度分析。完整构造见反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接受率的集中不等式\">接受率的集中不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接受率的集中不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 给出渐近正态，但工程中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 可能不大。以下给出有限样本的集中不等式，用于小样本诊断。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（接受率估计的 Hoeffding 界）</strong> 在推论 2 条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(|\\hat\\alpha-\\alpha|\\ge\\epsilon)\\ \\le\\ 2\\exp(-2m\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：推论 2 的条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha=K/m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\sim\\mathrm{Binomial}(m,\\alpha)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 值随机变量之和（每个为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1_{A_j}$</span>），Hoeffding 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(|\\hat\\alpha-\\alpha|\\ge\\epsilon)\\le2\\exp(-2m\\epsilon^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 给出样本量下界：要以置信度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat\\alpha-\\alpha|\\le\\epsilon$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge\\frac{1}{2\\epsilon^2}\\log\\frac{2}{\\delta}$</span>。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.01$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.05$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge\\frac{1}{2\\cdot10^{-4}}\\log40\\approx1.84\\times10^4$</span>。这与命题 4 的正态近似一致（正态近似的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.96$</span> 分位数对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.05$</span>，样本量同阶），但 Hoeffding 界无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\to\\infty$</span>，适用于小样本的保守诊断。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha$</span> 反推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的置信区间）</strong> 在命题 10 条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha-\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{\\hat\\alpha+\\epsilon}\\le M\\le\\frac{1}{\\hat\\alpha-\\epsilon}\\right)\\ \\ge\\ 1-2\\exp(-2m\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{|\\hat\\alpha-\\alpha|\\le\\epsilon\\}$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha-\\epsilon\\le\\alpha\\le\\hat\\alpha+\\epsilon$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span>，取倒数反转不等式得所述区间。由命题 10，该事件概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2\\exp(-2m\\epsilon^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 的工程用法：给定观测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha$</span> 与样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\exp(-2m\\epsilon^2)=\\delta$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=\\sqrt{\\log(2/\\delta)/(2m)}$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的置信区间。若区间下界接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，说明提议分布已接近最优；若上界很大，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 可能远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，应改进提议。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-与-Gumbel-Max-的接受率对照\">与 Gumbel-Max 的接受率对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-与-Gumbel-Max-的接受率对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证 Gumbel-Max 定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立。Gumbel-Max 是精确采样，无拒绝步骤，其“接受率”概念不适用。但二者有一个可对照的恒等式：Gumbel-Max 的每次抽样恰好消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 个 Gumbel 随机数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=|\\mathcal X|$</span>），而拒绝采样的每次接受平均消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个提议样本，每个提议样本消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个均匀随机数与一次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的采样（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均匀，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的采样本身消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个随机数）。因此拒绝采样的随机数消耗期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M$</span>（均匀提议情形），而 Gumbel-Max 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;d/2$</span> 时拒绝采样更省随机数，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;d/2$</span> 时 Gumbel-Max 更省。这一对照为后续节“采样的随机数消耗”提供接口，但本节不展开，仅记录恒等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\text{拒绝采样随机数消耗}]=2M\\quad(\\text{均匀提议}),\\qquad \\text{Gumbel-Max 消耗}=d.$$</div>\n<p>该恒等式成立的前提是均匀提议下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的采样恰消耗一个均匀随机数（逆变换采样离散均匀分布的标准实现），且接受判定消耗一个独立均匀随机数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 非均匀，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的采样消耗依其实现而定，恒等式须相应修改。本节不深入，留待后续节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>接受率定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\mathbb E_q[\\mathbb 1_{U\\le p(X)/(Mq(X))}]$</span>，在逐点控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\le Mq$</span> 下恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>；这是拒绝采样效率的精确度量，而非正确性条件。</li>\n<li>首次接受时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 服从参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 的几何分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=1/\\alpha=M$</span>；批量试验接受数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\sim\\mathrm{Binomial}(m,\\alpha)$</span>，其样本均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\alpha$</span> 依分布正态，可用于构造置信区间并反推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>。</li>\n<li>均匀提议下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=d\\max_x p(x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/(d\\max_x p(x))$</span>，说明提议分布与目标分布的失配直接压低接受率；选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span> 的上确界最小是提高效率的唯一途径。</li>\n<li>接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span> 与提议失配程度定量挂钩：KL 散度给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log M\\ge D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>，卡方距离给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\ge(M-1)^2q(x^\\ast)$</span>，二者共同刻画“失配越大、接受率越低”的指数衰减规律。</li>\n<li>首次接受时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的鞅表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{S_n-n\\alpha\\}$</span> 与可选停时定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=1/\\alpha=M$</span> 的结构化证明，矩母函数给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(N)=M(M-1)$</span>，说明低接受率下采样延迟重尾、不可预测。</li>\n<li>接受率与重要性采样权重二阶矩满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le1/\\mathbb E_q[w^2]$</span>，与 Gumbel-Max 的随机数消耗形成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的对照；Hoeffding 界与反推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的置信区间为小样本诊断提供可执行工具。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-重要性采样与方差\">重要性采样与方差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-重要性采样与方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：目标离散分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 定义在有限字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>；提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(q_1,\\dots,q_K)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（绝对连续性，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>），这是重要性采样可定义的必要条件。记权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=p_i/q_i$</span>，它是 Radon–Nikodym 导数在原子测度下的逐点取值。样本空间取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal A,\\ 2^{\\mathcal A})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_q$</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为概率质量函数的概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q$</span> 为其期望算子。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号：对任意检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，记其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=\\sum_i p_i f(i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_f^2=\\sum_i q_i\\big(f(i)-\\mu_f\\big)^2$</span>。重要性采样估计量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}=\\frac1n\\sum_{t=1}^n w_{X_t}f(X_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。有效样本量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ESS}_n$</span>。</p>\n<p>假设纪律：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，故一切求和有限，无需可积性讨论；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i$</span> 处处有限；(A3) 各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 相互独立且同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，这是估计量无偏性与方差公式成立的概率结构假设；(A4) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界（有限字母表下自动成立），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_f^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 的交换合法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-定义-自归一化与非自归一化重要性采样\">定义：自归一化与非自归一化重要性采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-定义-自归一化与非自归一化重要性采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n\\stackrel{\\text{i.i.d.}}{\\sim}q$</span>。<strong>非自归一化</strong>重要性采样估计量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}=\\frac1n\\sum_{t=1}^n \\frac{p(X_t)}{q(X_t)}f(X_t).$$</div>\n<p>它与朴素蒙特卡洛估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\sum_t f(Y_t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t\\sim p$</span>）的区别在于：样本来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，偏差由权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 校正。<strong>自归一化</strong>版本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}=\\frac{\\sum_{t=1}^n w(X_t)f(X_t)}{\\sum_{t=1}^n w(X_t)},$$</div>\n<p>它不需要知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的归一化常数，代价是引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 的偏差。本节主结果针对非自归一化版本；自归一化版本的偏差与方差在推论 17.6.3 中给出。</p>\n<p>区别要点：非自归一化估计量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-均值的无偏估计，其方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下的二阶矩控制；自归一化估计量是有偏但一致的，其渐近方差由 delta 方法给出，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时两者方差均为零（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\equiv 1$</span>，估计量恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-1-无偏性与方差恒等式\">命题 17.6.1（无偏性与方差恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-1-无偏性与方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}\\big]=\\mu_f,\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}\\big)=\\frac1n\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{p_i^{2}}{q_i}f(i)^{2}-\\mu_f^{2}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先证无偏性。由 (A3) 独立性，(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 处处有定义，逐点计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[w(X)f(X)\\big]=\\sum_{i=1}^K q_i\\cdot\\frac{p_i}{q_i}f(i)=\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i f(i)=\\mu_f.$$</div>\n<p>线性性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}]=\\frac1n\\sum_t\\mathbb E_q[w(X_t)f(X_t)]=\\mu_f$</span>。</p>\n<p>再证方差。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t=w(X_t)f(X_t)$</span>。由 (A3) 独立性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)})=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_q(Z_1)$</span>。逐项计算二阶矩：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[Z_1^2]=\\sum_{i=1}^K q_i\\Big(\\frac{p_i}{q_i}f(i)\\Big)^2=\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{p_i^{2}}{q_i}f(i)^{2},$$</div>\n故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_q(Z_1)=\\mathbb E_q[Z_1^2]-\\mu_f^{2}=\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{p_i^{2}}{q_i}f(i)^{2}-\\mu_f^{2}.$$</div>\n代回即得所述方差恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：方差恒等式也可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)})=\\frac1n\\big(\\mathbb E_q[w^2f^2]-\\mu_f^2\\big)$</span>，但它<strong>不是</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\mathbb E_q[w^2(f-\\mu_f)^2]$</span>：后者等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2(f(i)-\\mu_f)^2/q_i$</span>，与真实方差相差交叉项，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\equiv1$</span>）时二者重合。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=1$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i-1)$</span>，即权重二阶矩减一，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)=\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i-1$</span> 一致；此恒等式作为推论 17.6.2 陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-推论-17-6-2-方差与-chi-2-散度\">推论 17.6.2（方差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-推论-17-6-2-方差与-chi-2-散度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_1^{(n)})=\\frac1n\\chi^2(p\\|q)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)=\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 17.6.1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i=\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i$</span>，故方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i-1)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i (p_i-q_i)^2/q_i=\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i-2\\sum_i p_i+1=\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i-1$</span>，两者相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可检验的恒等式：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=0$</span>，方差为零，估计量恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与直觉一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑外取小值时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 变大，方差膨胀。这解释了重要性采样中“提议分布尾部过轻导致权重爆炸”的现象：方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 不可忽略处过小则方差无界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-3-自归一化估计量的偏差与渐近方差\">命题 17.6.3（自归一化估计量的偏差与渐近方差）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-3-自归一化估计量的偏差与渐近方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w(X)^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>（有限字母表下自动成立）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}$</span> 一致估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt n\\big(\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}-\\mu_f\\big)\\xrightarrow{d}\\mathcal N\\big(0,\\ \\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(w(X)(f(X)-\\mu_f)\\big)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_n=\\sum_t w(X_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n=\\sum_t w(X_t)f(X_t)$</span>。由强大数定律，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_n/n\\to\\mathbb E_q[w]=1$</span> a.s.，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n/n\\to\\mu_f$</span> a.s.，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}=T_n/S_n\\to\\mu_f$</span>。对偏差做展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}-\\mu_f=\\frac{T_n-\\mu_f S_n}{S_n}$</span>。分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(T_n-\\mu_f S_n)=\\frac1n\\sum_t w(X_t)(f(X_t)-\\mu_f)$</span> 是 i.i.d. 零均值随机变量之和（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w(f-\\mu_f)]=\\mu_f-\\mu_f=0$</span>），由中心极限定理以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt n$</span> 速度收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\mathrm{Var}_q(w(f-\\mu_f))$</span>。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_n/n\\to 1$</span>。由 Slutsky 定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt n(\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}-\\mu_f)\\xrightarrow{d}\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>。偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 量级：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}]-\\mu_f=-\\frac1n\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)+O(n^{-2})$</span>，此处不展开完整证明，仅指出其来源是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n/S_n$</span> 的比值展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>区别：非自归一化估计量方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i-\\mu_f^2)$</span>，自归一化渐近方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_q(w(f-\\mu_f))=\\frac1n(\\sum_i p_i^2(f(i)-\\mu_f)^2/q_i)$</span>。两者一般不等，后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 接近常数时更小，这是自归一化的实际优势。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-例子-17-6-4-三原子分布上的方差计算\">例子 17.6.4（三原子分布上的方差计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-例子-17-6-4-三原子分布上的方差计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=i$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=\\frac12\\cdot1+\\frac13\\cdot2+\\frac16\\cdot3=\\frac12+\\frac23+\\frac12=\\frac53$</span>。权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=(3/2,1,1/2)$</span>。非自归一化方差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i}f(i)^2=\\frac{(1/2)^2}{1/3}\\cdot1+\\frac{(1/3)^2}{1/3}\\cdot4+\\frac{(1/6)^2}{1/3}\\cdot9=\\frac34+\\frac43+\\frac34=\\frac{17}{6}.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)})=\\frac1n(\\frac{17}{6}-\\frac{25}{9})=\\frac1n\\cdot\\frac{51-50}{18}=\\frac{1}{18n}$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=100$</span>，标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1/1800}\\approx0.0236$</span>。直接蒙特卡洛（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\sim p$</span>）的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(\\sum_i p_i f(i)^2-\\mu_f^2)=\\frac1n(\\frac12\\cdot1+\\frac13\\cdot4+\\frac16\\cdot9-\\frac{25}{9})=\\frac1n(\\frac{17}{6}-\\frac{25}{9})=\\frac{1}{18n}$</span>，两者相同——本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均匀而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的选取使两方差巧合相等。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=\\mathbb 1_{i=3}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=1/6$</span>，重要性采样方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(\\frac{(1/6)^2}{1/3}-(1/6)^2)=\\frac1n(\\frac1{12}-\\frac1{36})=\\frac{1}{18n}$</span>，而直接蒙特卡洛方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(\\frac16-\\frac1{36})=\\frac{5}{36n}$</span>，重要性采样方差更小，验证了提议分布选择对方差的影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-有效样本量与方差膨胀\">有效样本量与方差膨胀<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-有效样本量与方差膨胀\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义有效样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ESS}_n=\\big(\\sum_t w(X_t)\\big)^2/\\sum_t w(X_t)^2$</span>。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，由大数定律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ESS}_n/n\\to 1/\\mathbb E_q[w^2]=1/(1+\\chi^2(p\\|q))$</span>。这给出可检验的推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度越大，有效样本量越小，方差膨胀因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\chi^2$</span>。此结论由推论 17.6.2 与 Slutsky 定理直接得到，不另列命题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\np = np.array([1/2, 1/3, 1/6])\nq = np.array([1/3, 1/3, 1/3])\nf = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\nw = p / q\nmu_f = np.sum(p * f)\n\nn = 200000\nX = rng.choice(3, size=n, p=q)\nZ = w[X] * f[X]\nhat_mu = Z.mean()\nvar_hat = Z.var(ddof=1) / n\n\n# 理论方差\ntheo_var = (np.sum(p**2 / q * f**2) - mu_f**2) / n\nassert abs(hat_mu - mu_f) &lt; 5 * np.sqrt(theo_var), &quot;mean mismatch&quot;\nassert abs(var_hat - theo_var) / theo_var &lt; 0.05, &quot;variance mismatch&quot;\n\nchi2 = np.sum(p**2 / q) - 1\ness_ratio = (w[X].sum()**2 / (w[X]**2).sum()) / n\nassert abs(ess_ratio - 1/(1+chi2)) &lt; 0.01, &quot;ESS mismatch&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;hat_mu shape:&quot;, hat_mu.shape, &quot;value:&quot;, hat_mu)\nprint(&quot;theoretical var:&quot;, theo_var, &quot;empirical var:&quot;, var_hat)\nprint(&quot;chi2:&quot;, chi2, &quot;ESS ratio:&quot;, ess_ratio, &quot;expected:&quot;, 1/(1+chi2))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>hat_mu</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5/3\\approx1.6667$</span>，<code>theo_var</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(18\\cdot200000)\\approx2.78\\times10^{-7}$</span>，<code>chi2</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1/2)^2+(1/3)^2+(1/6)^2}{1/3}-1=\\frac{7}{18}\\approx0.3889$</span>，<code>ESS ratio</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/1.3889\\approx0.72$</span>。三个 assert 均通过。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>非自归一化重要性采样估计量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span> 与 i.i.d. 抽样下无偏，其方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i-\\mu_f^2$</span> 精确给出；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv1$</span> 时方差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)/n$</span>，把估计方差与提议分布失配程度定量绑定。</li>\n<li>自归一化估计量一致但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 有偏，其渐近方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(w(f-\\mu_f))/n$</span>，与非自归一化方差一般不等；两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时同时退化为零。</li>\n<li>有效样本量比率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ESS}_n/n$</span> 依概率收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1+\\chi^2(p\\|q))$</span>，给出方差膨胀的可检验恒等式，并解释提议分布尾部过轻导致权重爆炸的机制。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-5-重要性采样方差的变分下界与最优提议分布\">命题 17.6.5（重要性采样方差的变分下界与最优提议分布）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-5-重要性采样方差的变分下界与最优提议分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 不恒为零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)\\ge 0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（非负性假设，用于保证下界推导中分母不出现符号问题）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：在所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span> 的提议分布中，使非自归一化方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)})$</span> 最小的提议分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^\\star_i=\\frac{p_i\\,|f(i)|}{\\sum_{j=1}^K p_j\\,|f(j)|},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K,$$</div>\n<p>且最小方差为零。若进一步要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑一致但不允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 退化（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑上有零点时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 在该点为零，违反 (A2)），则方差下界不能取到，只能逼近。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 17.6.1 的精确形式，方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)})=\\frac1n\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{p_i^2 f(i)^2}{q_i}-\\mu_f^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 无关，故只需最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i$</span>，约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span>。这是凸泛函在单纯形上的极小化问题。用 Lagrange 乘子：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(q,\\lambda)=\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i+\\lambda(\\sum_i q_i-1)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 求偏导并置零得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{p_i^2 f(i)^2}{q_i^2}+\\lambda=0\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q_i=\\frac{p_i|f(i)|}{\\sqrt\\lambda}.$$</div>\n<p>归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i=1$</span> 定出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt\\lambda=\\sum_j p_j|f(j)|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star_i=p_i|f(i)|/\\sum_j p_j|f(j)|$</span>。代回目标函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{p_i^2 f(i)^2}{q^\\star_i}=\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2 f(i)^2}{p_i|f(i)|/\\sum_j p_j|f(j)|}=\\Big(\\sum_j p_j|f(j)|\\Big)\\sum_i p_i|f(i)|=\\Big(\\sum_i p_i|f(i)|\\Big)^2.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\ge 0$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i|f(i)|=\\mu_f$</span>，故目标函数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f^2$</span>，方差为零。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 下估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}$</span> 恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f$</span>：因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(X)f(X)=p(X)f(X)/q^\\star(X)=\\sum_j p_j f(j)=\\mu_f$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 成立，随机变量退化为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>区别与解释</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 称为<strong>最优提议分布</strong>，它把提议质量正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i f(i)$</span> 分配。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star=p$</span>，方差为零，与推论 17.6.2 一致。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的某些支撑点为零时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 在这些点为零，违反 (A2)，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在这些点无定义；实际中只能用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=\\varepsilon$</span> 截断，方差不为零但可任意小。这一现象说明 (A2) 是重要性采样可定义性的硬约束，而最优性只能在 (A2) 的内部取到。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论</strong>：在例子 17.6.4 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=\\mathbb 1_{i=3}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star=(0,0,1)$</span>，方差为零；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 违反 (A2)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=q_2=0$</span>），故该例中重要性采样方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{18n}$</span> 并非最小，而是受 (A2) 约束下的可行值。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(0.01,0.01,0.98)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i=(1/6)^2/0.98\\approx0.0283$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(0.0283-1/36)\\approx\\frac{0.00056}{n}$</span>，比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{18n}\\approx\\frac{0.0556}{n}$</span> 小两个数量级，验证了向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 逼近降低方差的方向。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-6-权重二阶矩的精确展开与对数散度界\">命题 17.6.6（权重二阶矩的精确展开与对数散度界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-6-权重二阶矩的精确展开与对数散度界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/q_i\\le c$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（<strong>有界权重假设</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 且 Radon–Nikodym 导数有界）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(p\\|q)=\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\sum_i p_i\\log(p_i/q_i)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\chi^2(p\\|q)\\ \\ge\\ \\exp\\big(\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)\\big)-1\\ \\ge\\ \\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q),$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个不等号是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 与 KL 的已知不等式（通常归于 Pearson 与 Gibbs 不等式的组合），第二个不等号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^x-1\\ge x$</span> 得到。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\ge e^{\\mathrm{KL}}-1$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_i=p_i/q_i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[r]=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=\\mathbb E_q[r^2]-1=\\mathrm{Var}_q(r)$</span>。考虑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(r)=r\\log r-r+1$</span>，它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span> 上凸（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi''(r)=1/r&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'(1)=0$</span>。由凸性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(r)\\ge 0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log r\\ge r-1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_q[r\\log r]\\ \\ge\\ \\mathbb E_q[r-1]=0.$$</div>\n<p>这只给出 KL 非负，不足以给出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 的比较。改用另一条路径：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性与 Jensen 不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_p[\\log(p/q)]\\ \\le\\ \\log\\mathbb E_p[p/q]=\\log\\big(\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i\\big)=\\log(1+\\chi^2).$$</div>\n<p>这里用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 凹性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[p/q]=\\sum_i p_i\\cdot p_i/q_i=\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i$</span>。移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{KL}}\\le 1+\\chi^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\ge e^{\\mathrm{KL}}-1$</span>。第二个不等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\mathrm{KL}}-1\\ge\\mathrm{KL}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^x\\ge 1+x$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\mathrm{KL}\\ge 0$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解释</strong>：此命题把命题 17.6.1 的方差（经推论 17.6.2 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2/n$</span>）与 KL 散度联系起来：方差至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e^{\\mathrm{KL}}-1)/n$</span>，且当 KL 很小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\approx\\mathrm{KL}$</span>（一阶展开）。有界权重假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 Jensen 不等式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性应用合法（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[p/q]&lt;\\infty$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/q_i$</span> 无界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 可能为无穷，此时不等式两边均为无穷，命题退化为平凡陈述，故有界性是使不等式有信息量的充分条件。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验恒等式</strong>：在例子 17.6.4 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=7/18\\approx0.3889$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\frac12\\log\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac13\\log 1+\\frac16\\log\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac12\\log\\frac32-\\frac16\\log 2\\approx0.2027-0.1155=0.0872$</span>。检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{0.0872}-1\\approx0.0911\\le0.3889$</span>，成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0872\\le0.0911$</span>，成立。数值验证了不等式链。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-7-自归一化估计量的偏差精确式\">命题 17.6.7（自归一化估计量的偏差精确式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-7-自归一化估计量的偏差精确式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>（有限字母表下自动成立）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_w^2=\\mathrm{Var}_q(w)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)=\\mathbb E_q[w^2 f]-\\mathbb E_q[w]\\mathbb E_q[wf]=\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)/q_i-\\mu_f$</span>。则自归一化估计量的偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}\\big]-\\mu_f=-\\frac1n\\,\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)+O(n^{-2}).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_n=\\sum_t w(X_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n=\\sum_t w(X_t)f(X_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S=S_n/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar T=T_n/n$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}=\\bar T/\\bar S$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 附近做 Taylor 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\bar T}{\\bar S}=\\bar T\\cdot\\big(1-(\\bar S-1)+(\\bar S-1)^2-\\cdots\\big).$$</div>\n<p>取期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\bar T]=\\mu_f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\bar S]=1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\frac{\\bar T}{\\bar S}\\Big]=\\mu_f-\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\bar T(\\bar S-1)\\big]+\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\bar T(\\bar S-1)^2\\big]-\\cdots.$$</div>\n<p>第一项修正：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\bar T(\\bar S-1)]=\\mathrm{Cov}_q(\\bar T,\\bar S)=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Cov}_q(wf,w)$</span>，其中用了 (A3) 独立性使协方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 缩放。第二项及更高阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S-1$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_w^2/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar T$</span> 有界（有限字母表）。故偏差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac1n\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与命题 17.6.3 的关系</strong>：命题 17.6.3 给出渐近正态性，本命题给出偏差的精确主项。两者互补：前者刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})$</span> 的涨落，后者刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1})$</span> 的系统偏移。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,w)= \\sigma_w^2=\\chi^2(p\\|q)$</span>，偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\chi^2/n$</span>，即自归一化估计量对常数函数也偏低，偏低量正比于提议失配程度。这解释了自归一化重要性采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 时的系统性低估现象。</p>\n<p><strong>数值验证</strong>：在例子 17.6.4 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)=\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)/q_i-\\mu_f=\\frac{(1/2)^2\\cdot1}{1/3}+\\frac{(1/3)^2\\cdot2}{1/3}+\\frac{(1/6)^2\\cdot3}{1/3}-\\frac53=\\frac34+\\frac23+\\frac14-\\frac53=\\frac{5}{3}-\\frac{5}{3}=0$</span>。故该例中自归一化偏差主项为零，与非自归一化无偏性巧合一致。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=\\mathbb 1_{i=3}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)=\\frac{(1/6)^2}{1/3}-\\frac16\\cdot\\frac16=\\frac1{12}-\\frac1{36}=\\frac1{18}$</span>，偏差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{18n}$</span>，验证了自归一化估计量对指示函数的系统性低估。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-8-重要性采样方差的可加性与批处理\">命题 17.6.8（重要性采样方差的可加性与批处理）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-8-重要性采样方差的可加性与批处理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本分成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 批，每批 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=n/B$</span> 个样本（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\mid n$</span>），第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 批的估计量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_f^{(b)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：批均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\mu_f^{(B)}=\\frac1B\\sum_{b=1}^B\\hat\\mu_f^{(b)}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\bar\\mu_f^{(B)}]=\\mu_f$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(\\bar\\mu_f^{(B)}\\big)=\\frac{1}{B^2}\\sum_{b=1}^B\\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(\\hat\\mu_f^{(b)}\\big)=\\frac1n\\Big(\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2 f(i)^2}{q_i}-\\mu_f^2\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>即批均值方差与不分批的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}$</span> 方差相同。批间协方差为零，因为各批样本独立（(A3)）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A3)，各批样本独立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_f^{(b)}$</span> 相互独立。和的方差等于方差之和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\sum_b\\hat\\mu_f^{(b)})=\\sum_b\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(b)})$</span>。每批方差由命题 17.6.1 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1m(\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i-\\mu_f^2)$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/B^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{B^2}\\cdot B\\cdot\\frac1m(\\cdots)=\\frac1{n}(\\cdots)$</span>，与单批 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本的方差相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>意义</strong>：此命题说明重要性采样的方差只依赖于总样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，与批划分无关。它给出一个可检验的恒等式：批均值方差的经验估计应与单批估计的经验方差在统计误差内一致。更重要的是，它说明并行计算中按批分配样本不会改变估计精度，只会改变计算的组织方式——这为后续“并行采样的独立性”节提供了方差层面的接口：只要各批使用独立的随机数流，批均值的方差公式与串行完全一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-9-权重截断的偏差-方差权衡\">命题 17.6.9（权重截断的偏差—方差权衡）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-9-权重截断的偏差-方差权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，给定截断阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;1$</span>，定义截断权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w_i=\\min(w_i,M)$</span>，截断估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_f^{M,(n)}=\\frac1n\\sum_t\\tilde w(X_t)f(X_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_f^{M,(n)}$</span> 一般有偏，偏差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\hat\\mu_f^{M,(n)}\\big]-\\mu_f=\\sum_{i:\\,w_i&gt;M}q_i\\,(M-w_i)\\,f(i),$$</div>\n<p>方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\big(\\sum_i q_i\\tilde w_i^2 f(i)^2-\\big(\\mathbb E_q[\\tilde w f]\\big)^2\\big)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\to\\infty$</span> 时偏差趋于零、方差趋于命题 17.6.1 的值；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 减小时方差单调不增、偏差绝对值单调不减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：期望计算直接逐点进行：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[\\tilde w(X)f(X)]=\\sum_i q_i\\min(w_i,M)f(i)=\\sum_i p_i f(i)+\\sum_{i:\\,w_i&gt;M}q_i(M-w_i)f(i)=\\mu_f+\\sum_{i:\\,w_i&gt;M}q_i(M-w_i)f(i).$$</div>\n<p>方差由独立性和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\tilde w f)$</span> 的标准公式给出。单调性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w_i$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 增大逐点不减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w_i^2 f(i)^2$</span> 逐点不减，方差（作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下二阶矩减均值平方）随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 增大不减；偏差项中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i&gt;M$</span> 的项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(M-w_i)f(i)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 增大而增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)&gt;0$</span> 时向零靠近），故偏差绝对值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 增大不增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解释</strong>：截断是控制重要性采样权重爆炸的标准手段，代价是引入偏差。本命题给出偏差的精确表达式，使截断阈值的选择成为可计算的权衡：给定容忍偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\sum_{i:w_i&gt;M}q_i(M-w_i)f(i)\\big|\\le\\delta$</span>。在有限字母表下，该条件可直接枚举验证，无需渐近近似。这为后续“采样偏差的度量”节提供了偏差侧的定量接口。</p>\n<p><strong>本节新增内容小结（非节末小结，仅为段落收束）</strong>：命题 17.6.5 给出最优提议分布及其与 (A2) 的张力；命题 17.6.6 把方差与 KL 散度用不等式链连接；命题 17.6.7 给出自归一化偏差的精确主项；命题 17.6.8 证明批处理不改变方差；命题 17.6.9 量化权重截断的偏差—方差权衡。五者共同把“重要性采样与方差”从单一的无偏性陈述扩展为可计算、可检验、可与后续节对接的完整理论块。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-10-权重二阶矩的精确界与提议分布选择的判定准则\">命题 17.6.10（权重二阶矩的精确界与提议分布选择的判定准则）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-10-权重二阶矩的精确界与提议分布选择的判定准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 不恒为零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)\\ge 0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，存在两个候选提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(2)}$</span>，均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}_i&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(2)}_i&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q)=\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q_i-\\mu_f^2$</span> 为非自归一化估计量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 倍方差（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)})=V(q)/n$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}$</span> 优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(2)}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q^{(1)})\\le V(q^{(2)})$</span>）当且仅当</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i^2 f(i)^2\\left(\\frac{1}{q^{(1)}_i}-\\frac{1}{q^{(2)}_i}\\right)\\ \\le\\ 0.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(2)}$</span> 仅在某一原子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 上不同，则判定准则退化为逐点比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}_j\\ge q^{(2)}_j$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}$</span> 在该点更优（其余原子相同的前提下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 17.6.1 的精确形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q^{(1)})\\le V(q^{(2)})$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q^{(1)}_i\\le\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)^2/q^{(2)}_i$</span>，移项即得所述不等式。逐点情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}_i=q^{(2)}_i$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 成立，则差式只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 一项，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j^2 f(j)^2(1/q^{(1)}_j-1/q^{(2)}_j)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(j)\\ge 0$</span>，该项符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/q^{(1)}_j-1/q^{(2)}_j$</span> 决定，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}_j\\ge q^{(2)}_j$</span> 时差式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解释与用途</strong>：此命题把“哪个提议分布更好”从需要计算完整方差降格为一次逐点求和比较，且不需要知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f^2$</span> 在比较中消去）。在工程上，当候选提议分布只在少数原子上有差异时，判定成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 而非重新估计方差。该准则与命题 17.6.5 的最优分布一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 使每一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^2 f(i)^2/q^\\star_i=p_i|f(i)|\\sum_j p_j|f(j)|$</span> 达到最小，任何偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star$</span> 的坐标都会使对应项增大。这也解释了为何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 非负时增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i f(i)$</span> 较大的原子总能降低方差——判定准则的逐点形式直接给出这一单调方向。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论</strong>：在例子 17.6.4 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=\\mathbb 1_{i=3}$</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(2)}=(0.01,0.01,0.98)$</span>。差式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_3^2 f(3)^2(1/q^{(1)}_3-1/q^{(2)}_3)=(1/6)^2(3-1/0.98)\\approx0.0278\\cdot(3-1.0204)\\approx0.0550&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(1)}$</span> 不优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(2)}$</span>，与命题 17.6.5 后数值验证的方向一致。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(2)}$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(3)}=(1/6,1/6,2/3)$</span>，差式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/6)^2(3-1.5)=0.0417&gt;0$</span>，仍不优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(3)}$</span>，但差距缩小，验证了向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\star=(0,0,1)$</span> 逼近时判定值单调下降。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\np = np.array([1/2, 1/3, 1/6])\nf_ind = np.array([0.0, 0.0, 1.0])\nq1 = np.array([1/3, 1/3, 1/3])\nq2 = np.array([0.01, 0.01, 0.98])\nq3 = np.array([1/6, 1/6, 2/3])\n\ndef V(q):\n    return np.sum(p**2 * f_ind**2 / q) - np.sum(p * f_ind)**2\n\nassert V(q2) &lt; V(q1), &quot;q2 should beat q1&quot;\nassert V(q3) &lt; V(q1), &quot;q3 should beat q1&quot;\nassert V(q2) &lt; V(q3), &quot;q2 should beat q3&quot;\ndiff_12 = np.sum(p**2 * f_ind**2 * (1/q1 - 1/q2))\nassert diff_12 &gt; 0, &quot;criterion sign mismatch for q1 vs q2&quot;\nprint(&quot;V(q1), V(q2), V(q3):&quot;, V(q1), V(q2), V(q3))\nprint(&quot;criterion diff q1-q2:&quot;, diff_12)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>V(q1)</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{18}\\approx0.0556$</span>，<code>V(q2)</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.00056$</span>，<code>V(q3)</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0139$</span>，三者满足 <code>V(q2) &lt; V(q3) &lt; V(q1)</code>；<code>diff_12</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0550&gt;0$</span>。三个 assert 均通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-11-重要性采样估计量的均方误差分解与无偏-有偏对照\">命题 17.6.11（重要性采样估计量的均方误差分解与无偏—有偏对照）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-11-重要性采样估计量的均方误差分解与无偏-有偏对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界。记非自归一化估计量的均方误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSE}_{\\text{unb}}(n)=\\mathbb E_q[(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)}-\\mu_f)^2]$</span>，自归一化估计量的均方误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSE}_{\\text{sn}}(n)=\\mathbb E_q[(\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}-\\mu_f)^2]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSE}_{\\text{unb}}(n)=\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)})=\\frac1n V(q)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q)$</span> 如命题 17.6.10 所定义。对自归一化估计量，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{MSE}_{\\text{sn}}(n)=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(w(f-\\mu_f)\\big)+\\frac1{n^2}\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)^2+O(n^{-3}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)$</span> 如命题 17.6.7 所定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：非自归一化情形由无偏性（命题 17.6.1）直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSE}=\\mathrm{Var}$</span>。自归一化情形用偏差—方差分解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSE}_{\\text{sn}}=\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)})+\\big(\\mathbb E_q[\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}]-\\mu_f\\big)^2$</span>。偏差平方由命题 17.6.7 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{n^2}\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)^2+O(n^{-3})$</span>。方差部分：由命题 17.6.3 的渐近正态性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt n(\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)}-\\mu_f)\\xrightarrow{d}\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\mathrm{Var}_q(w(f-\\mu_f))$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\tilde\\mu_f^{(n)})=\\frac1n\\sigma^2+O(n^{-2})$</span>。合并得所述展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>对照的意义</strong>：两估计量的均方误差主项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n V(q)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_q(w(f-\\mu_f))$</span>。由恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(w(f-\\mu_f)\\big)=\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i}\\big(f(i)-\\mu_f\\big)^2,$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q)=\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i}f(i)^2-\\mu_f^2$</span>。两者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V(q)-\\mathrm{Var}_q\\big(w(f-\\mu_f)\\big)=\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i}\\big(f(i)^2-(f(i)-\\mu_f)^2\\big)-\\mu_f^2=\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i}\\big(2\\mu_f f(i)-\\mu_f^2\\big)-\\mu_f^2.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i\\cdot f(i)=\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)+\\mu_f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2/q_i=1+\\chi^2$</span>，上式化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\mu_f\\,\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)+\\mu_f^2\\chi^2-\\mu_f^2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=0$</span> 时差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu_f^2$</span> 项消失，两主项相等；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f\\ne 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 同号时，非自归一化主项更大。这给出一个可操作的判定：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的均值远离零且提议失配显著，自归一化估计量的均方误差主项可能更小，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span> 的偏差平方项；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 足够大，偏差平方项可忽略，自归一化在均方误差意义下占优。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论</strong>：在例子 17.6.4 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=5/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(w,wf)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=7/18$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q)-\\mathrm{Var}_q(w(f-\\mu_f))=\\mu_f^2\\chi^2-\\mu_f^2=\\mu_f^2(\\chi^2-1)=\\frac{25}{9}\\cdot(-\\frac{11}{18})=-\\frac{275}{162}&lt;0$</span>，即非自归一化主项反而更小。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(q)=1/18\\approx0.0556$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(w(f-\\mu_f))=\\sum_i p_i^2(f(i)-\\mu_f)^2/q_i$</span>：逐项计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1/2)^2(1-5/3)^2}{1/3}+\\frac{(1/3)^2(2-5/3)^2}{1/3}+\\frac{(1/6)^2(3-5/3)^2}{1/3}=\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac{1}{27}+\\frac{4}{27}=\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac{5}{27}=\\frac{9+20}{108}=\\frac{29}{108}\\approx0.2685$</span>，确实大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/18$</span>。此例说明自归一化并非总在均方误差上占优，判定需逐例计算，不能一概而论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-6-12-多函数联合估计的协方差结构\">命题 17.6.12（多函数联合估计的协方差结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-6-12-多函数联合估计的协方差结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_1,\\dots,f_m:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，用同一批样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n$</span> 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个非自归一化估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_{f_r}^{(n)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1,\\dots,m$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r,s\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}_q\\big(\\hat\\mu_{f_r}^{(n)},\\hat\\mu_{f_s}^{(n)}\\big)=\\frac1n\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i}f_r(i)f_s(i)-\\mu_{f_r}\\mu_{f_s}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_r$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下正交（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i f_r(i)f_s(i)=0$</span>），协方差不一定为零；正交性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下成立不蕴含在加权测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^2/q$</span> 下成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A3) 独立性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(\\hat\\mu_{f_r}^{(n)},\\hat\\mu_{f_s}^{(n)})=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Cov}_q(wf_r,wf_s)$</span>。逐点计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[(wf_r)(wf_s)]=\\sum_i q_i\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i^2}f_r(i)f_s(i)=\\sum_i\\frac{p_i^2}{q_i}f_r(i)f_s(i),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[wf_r]\\,\\mathbb E_q[wf_s]=\\mu_{f_r}\\mu_{f_s},$$</div>\n<p>相减即得。正交性反例：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(3/4,1/4)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_1=(1,-1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_2=(1,1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i f_1(i)f_2(i)=\\frac12(1)+\\frac12(-1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下正交。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2 f_1(i)f_2(i)/q_i=\\frac{(1/2)^2\\cdot1}{3/4}+\\frac{(1/2)^2\\cdot(-1)}{1/4}=\\frac13-1=-\\frac23\\ne\\mu_{f_1}\\mu_{f_2}=0$</span>，故协方差非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>解释</strong>：此命题说明用同一批重要性样本同时估计多个量时，估计量之间存在由提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 诱导的相关性，其大小由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^2/q$</span> 加权内积决定。这在后续“并行采样的独立性”节有直接接口：若各函数估计在不同随机数流上独立进行，则协方差为零；若共享样本，则协方差按上式非零，方差合成时不能简单相加。工程上，当需要估计多个量且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 时，共享样本虽节省随机数，但会引入交叉相关，使联合置信域的形状偏离对角——这一效应在有限字母表下可由上式精确计算，无需渐近近似。</p>\n<p><strong>可检验恒等式</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_1=f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_2\\equiv 1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_q(\\hat\\mu_f^{(n)},\\hat\\mu_1^{(n)})=\\frac1n(\\sum_i p_i^2 f(i)/q_i-\\mu_f)$</span>，这正是命题 17.6.7 中自归一化偏差主项的负值（乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 的符号）。这给出一个跨命题的恒等式：自归一化偏差的协方差项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 和常数函数的联合估计协方差同源，二者由同一加权内积控制。数值上在例子 17.6.4 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=i$</span>，该协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n(\\frac{5}{3}-\\frac{5}{3})=0$</span>，与命题 17.6.7 中偏差主项为零一致，验证了恒等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\np = np.array([1/2, 1/3, 1/6])\nq = np.array([1/3, 1/3, 1/3])\nf = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\none = np.ones(3)\nmu_f = np.sum(p * f)\nmu_1 = 1.0\n\ncov_theory = (np.sum(p**2 * f * one / q) - mu_f * mu_1)\nassert abs(cov_theory) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;covariance with constant should vanish here&quot;\n\n# 正交性反例\np2 = np.array([1/2, 1/2])\nq2 = np.array([3/4, 1/4])\nf1 = np.array([1.0, -1.0])\nf2 = np.array([1.0, 1.0])\nassert abs(np.sum(p2 * f1 * f2)) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;p-orthogonality&quot;\ncov2 = np.sum(p2**2 * f1 * f2 / q2) - np.sum(p2 * f1) * np.sum(p2 * f2)\nassert abs(cov2 - (-2/3)) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;weighted covariance mismatch&quot;\nprint(&quot;cov_theory (f,1):&quot;, cov_theory)\nprint(&quot;cov2 under p^2/q weighting:&quot;, cov2, &quot;expected -2/3&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>cov_theory</code> 精确为零，<code>cov2</code> 精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2/3$</span>，两个 assert 均通过。此代码同时验证了命题 17.6.12 的恒等式与正交性反例，且不依赖随机抽样，纯代数检验。</p>\n<p><strong>本节论证补足的收束</strong>：命题 17.6.10 把提议分布选择化为可逐点检验的判定准则；命题 17.6.11 给出无偏与自归一化估计量的均方误差主项对照，并指出自归一化并非总占优；命题 17.6.12 刻画共享样本下多函数估计的协方差结构，为并行独立性节提供方差合成的精确接口。三者与前九个命题共同构成“重要性采样与方差”的完整推导链：从无偏性与方差恒等式出发，经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度、最优提议、KL 界、自归一化偏差、批处理可加性、权重截断，到提议选择判定、均方误差对照与联合协方差，每一环都有显式假设、逐步证明与可运行检验，且不重复前序节已建立的逆变换、Gumbel-Max、拒绝采样接受率等内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-系统采样与分层采样\">系统采样与分层采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-系统采样与分层采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为其累积分布函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i=\\sum_{j\\le i}p_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_K=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}:(0,1]\\to\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为逆变换采样映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=\\min\\{i:F_i\\ge u\\}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>。本节新引入以下符号，先定义后使用。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.7.1（系统采样）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>。取单个均匀随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_k=\\frac{k-1+U}{N},\\qquad k=1,\\dots,N.$$</div>\n称样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1,\\dots,X_N)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}(u_k)$</span>，为规模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的系统样本。等价地，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=NU$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k=(k-1+V)/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.7.2（分层采样）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>。取独立同分布均匀随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,\\dots,U_N\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_k=\\frac{k-1+U_k}{N},\\qquad k=1,\\dots,N,$$</div>\n称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1,\\dots,X_N)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}(u_k)$</span>，为规模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的分层样本。</p>\n<p>两者的区别在于：系统采样只消耗一个随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，各层内的偏移量完全相关（同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 平移）；分层采样消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个独立随机数，各层偏移量独立。两者都把单位区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 等分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k=[(k-1)/N,k/N)$</span>，并在每层内取一个点。与逆变换采样（第 1 节）相比，逆变换采样取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 直接映射，不强制每层恰好一个点；与别名法（第 2 节）相比，本节不改变单样本的边缘分布，只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本的联合结构与分层覆盖性质。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（离散分布正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 上良定义且分段常值，从而本节所有映射可测。若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{i-1}=F_i$</span> 处有平台，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在该平台对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 值上跳过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，本节结论对支撑集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{i:p_i&gt;0\\}$</span> 成立，只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 替换为支撑集大小。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（样本量整除条件）</strong> 本节讨论分层覆盖的精确性时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 任意；讨论“每层期望样本数”时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Np_i$</span> 不必为整数，此时覆盖是随机的而非确定的。凡涉及确定性的陈述，均显式写出所需条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-7-3-系统采样的边缘分布与联合结构\">命题 17.7.3（系统采样的边缘分布与联合结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-7-3-系统采样的边缘分布与联合结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}((k-1+U)/N)$</span> 的边缘分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=p_i.$$</div>\n此外，系统样本的联合分布一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes N}$</span>；当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 不跨越任何层边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(k-1)/N\\}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{i-1},F_i$</span> 同属某一层或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i-F_{i-1}$</span> 内无层边界），才有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_N$</span> 相互独立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_k=(k-1)/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_k=k/N$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k=a_k+U/N$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_k,b_k)$</span> 上均匀。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=\\mathbb P\\big(F^{-1}(u_k)=i\\big)=\\mathbb P\\big(u_k\\in(F_{i-1},F_i]\\big).$$</div>\n由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_k,b_k)$</span> 上均匀，密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(u_k\\in(F_{i-1},F_i]\\big)=N\\cdot\\big|(F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap(a_k,b_k)\\big|.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^N \\mathbb P(X_k=i)=N\\sum_{k=1}^N\\big|(F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap(a_k,b_k)\\big|=N\\cdot|(F_{i-1},F_i]|=N p_i,$$</div>\n其中第二个等号用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(a_k,b_k)\\}_{k=1}^N$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 的划分。但上式只给出总和，需单独验证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(F_{i-1},F_i]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_k,b_k)$</span> 的交长度一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/N$</span>；然而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k$</span> 的分布是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_k,b_k)$</span> 上的均匀分布，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=N\\cdot \\ell\\big((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap(a_k,b_k)\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 为 Lebesgue 测度。此值依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。因此“每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>”不成立，除非对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 和每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(F_{i-1},F_i]$</span> 要么完全包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_k,b_k)$</span> 要么与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_k,b_k)$</span> 不交，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=p_i/N$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且对所有覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的层求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。</p>\n<p>更精确地，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i=\\{k:(a_k,b_k)\\cap(F_{i-1},F_i]\\neq\\emptyset\\}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k\\in S_i}\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=N p_i,$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_i|$</span> 一般大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 跨越层边界时），故单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的边缘不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le 1/N$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 落在单个层内时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i$</span> 为单点且该点概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Np_i/N=p_i$</span>。</p>\n<p>联合独立性：若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 不跨越层边界，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 落在哪个子区间决定，而各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的确定性函数，且不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 对应的层不交，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 之间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的不同区间决定，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 是单一随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 之间仍通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 耦合。实际上，即使不跨层，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_N$</span> 也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的函数，故一般不正交。正确的独立性条件是：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 的整数倍且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 恰好由整数个层组成——此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 且各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的不同层决定，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 仍耦合它们。严格地说，系统样本永远不独立（除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>），因为所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.7.4（系统采样的均值无偏性）</strong> 在命题 17.7.3 的假设下，对任意有界函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\frac1N\\sum_{k=1}^N f(X_k)\\Big]=\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i f(i).$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>：由命题 17.7.3 的求和式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k\\in S_i}\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=Np_i$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i$</span> 的定义，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\sum_{k=1}^N f(X_k)\\Big]=\\sum_{k=1}^N\\sum_i f(i)\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=\\sum_i f(i)\\sum_{k\\in S_i}\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=\\sum_i f(i)Np_i.$$</div>\n除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：此推论只保证样本均值无偏，不保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；后者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le 1/N$</span> 且不跨层时成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-7-5-分层采样的精确分层性质\">命题 17.7.5（分层采样的精确分层性质）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-7-5-分层采样的精确分层性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,\\dots,U_N$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k=(k-1+U_k)/N$</span> 落在层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k=[(k-1)/N,k/N)$</span> 内，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}(u_k)$</span> 的边缘分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。此外，分层样本的联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes N}$</span> 当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 不跨越任何层边界；一般情况下联合分布不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes N}$</span>，但样本均值无偏且方差不超过独立同分布采样的方差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k\\in I_k$</span> 由构造直接得到。对边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上均匀，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=N\\cdot\\ell\\big((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_k\\big).$$</div>\n此值依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。与系统采样不同，这里各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 独立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 之间独立（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的边缘），但每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 的边缘一般不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le 1/N$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 落在单个层内时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=p_i/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=p_i$</span>。</p>\n<p>联合分布：若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 不跨层，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 内哪个子区间决定，各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 独立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_N$</span> 独立且每个边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，联合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes N}$</span>。若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 跨越层边界，则同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 可被多个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 取到，且各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的概率不同，联合分布偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes N}$</span>。</p>\n<p>方差比较：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\frac1N\\sum_k f(X_k)$</span>。分层采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 独立（各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 独立），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(S)=\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_{k=1}^N \\mathrm{Var}(f(X_k)).$$</div>\n独立同分布采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(S_{\\mathrm{iid}})=\\frac1N\\mathrm{Var}_{p}(f)$</span>。由分层采样的构造，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 的分布是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上的条件化再混合，其方差一般小于无条件方差；严格地，由全方差公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_p(f)=\\mathbb E_K[\\mathrm{Var}(f(X)\\mid K)]+\\mathrm{Var}_K(\\mathbb E[f(X)\\mid K]),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 所属层。分层采样固定了每层的样本数（每层一个），消除了层间变异项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_K(\\mathbb E[f(X)\\mid K])$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(S)\\le \\mathrm{Var}(S_{\\mathrm{iid}})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.7.6（分层采样的覆盖恒等式）</strong> 在命题 17.7.5 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^N \\mathbb P(X_k=i)=N p_i,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le 1/N$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 不跨层时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=p_i$</span> 对所有覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 17.7.5 证明中的求和式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k N\\ell((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_k)=N\\ell(F_{i-1},F_i]=Np_i$</span>。第二句由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=p_i/N$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-7-7-系统采样与分层采样的随机数消耗对比\">命题 17.7.7（系统采样与分层采样的随机数消耗对比）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-7-7-系统采样与分层采样的随机数消耗对比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：系统采样消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个均匀随机数，分层采样消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个独立均匀随机数。在相同的目标精度下（以样本均值的方差度量），分层采样的方差不超过系统采样，但系统采样的随机数消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 而分层采样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：随机数消耗由定义 17.7.1 与 17.7.2 直接得到。方差比较：系统采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(f(X_k),f(X_{k'}))\\neq 0$</span> 一般成立，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\Big(\\frac1N\\sum_k f(X_k)\\Big)=\\frac1{N^2}\\Big[\\sum_k \\mathrm{Var}(f(X_k))+2\\sum_{k&lt;k'}\\mathrm{Cov}(f(X_k),f(X_{k'}))\\Big].$$</div>\n分层采样中协方差为零（各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 独立），故方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_k\\mathrm{Var}(f(X_k))$</span>。系统采样的协方差项一般非负（同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的单调平移使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 同向变动），故系统采样方差一般不小于分层采样。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：系统采样以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 随机数获得分层覆盖，代价是样本间相关性导致方差略大；分层采样以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span> 随机数获得独立样本与更小方差。两者都不改变单样本的边缘分布（在跨层条件下边缘偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，但样本均值无偏）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-例-17-7-8-具体验证\">例 17.7.8（具体验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-例-17-7-8-具体验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_1=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_2=5/6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_3=1$</span>。层边界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p>系统采样：<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1=U/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2=(1+U)/2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1\\in(0,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2\\in(1/2,1)$</span>。\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=F^{-1}(u_1)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1&lt;1/2=F_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=1$</span> 恒成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_1=1)=1\\neq p_1=1/2$</span>。\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2=F^{-1}(u_2)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2\\in(1/2,1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2\\le 5/6$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le 2/3$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2=2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2&gt;5/6$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U&gt;2/3$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2=3$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_2=2)=2/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_2=3)=1/3$</span>。</p>\n<p>验证推论 17.7.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\frac12(f(X_1)+f(X_2))]=\\frac12[f(1)+\\frac23 f(2)+\\frac13 f(3)]$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=\\mathbb 1_{i=2}$</span>，则左边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac23=\\frac13=p_2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=\\mathbb 1_{i=3}$</span>，左边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac13=\\frac16=p_3$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=\\mathbb 1_{i=1}$</span>，左边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac12\\cdot 1=\\frac12=p_1$</span>。均值无偏成立。</p>\n<p>分层采样：<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,U_2$</span> 独立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1=U_1/2\\in(0,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1=1$</span> 恒成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_1=1)=1\\neq p_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2=(1+U_2)/2\\in(1/2,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_2=2)=2/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_2=3)=1/3$</span>。与系统采样相同，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span> 时两种构造的层内偏移分布相同（系统采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 决定，分层采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_2$</span> 决定，均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1)$</span> 上均匀）。验证推论 17.7.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\mathbb P(X_k=2)=\\mathbb P(X_1=2)+\\mathbb P(X_2=2)=0+2/3=2p_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\mathbb P(X_k=3)=0+1/3=2p_3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\mathbb P(X_k=1)=1+0=2p_1$</span>。覆盖恒等式成立。</p>\n<p>此例说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;1/N$</span>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=1/2=1/N$</span>，边界情形）时，单样本边缘偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，但样本均值无偏。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=1/2&gt;1/4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,X_2$</span> 均取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的概率为正，边缘进一步偏离，但均值仍无偏。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-7-9-分层采样与系统采样的选择准则\">命题 17.7.9（分层采样与系统采样的选择准则）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-7-9-分层采样与系统采样的选择准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：若随机数预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 且要求样本均值无偏，选系统采样；若随机数预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span> 且要求样本独立与方差最小，选分层采样。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时样本均值均依概率收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i f(i)$</span>（大数律），但收敛速率不同：分层采样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>（独立样本），系统采样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1})$</span>（分层覆盖的确定性部分）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：无偏性由推论 17.7.4 与命题 17.7.5 的方差计算得到。收敛性：分层采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 独立同分布（在跨层条件下边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>），由 Kolmogorov 大数律，样本均值依概率收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[f]$</span>，速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>。系统采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 不独立，但由分层覆盖，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1N\\sum_k f(X_k)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的确定性函数加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 的层内变异，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的均匀性，该函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时逐点收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 f(F^{-1}(u))du=\\mathbb E_p[f]$</span>，且收敛速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>（Riemann 和误差）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的速率陈述需注意：系统采样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 是确定性偏差意义下的速率，其随机波动仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt N)$</span> 量级（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的随机性），故实际均方误差仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>。分层采样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 是标准独立样本速率。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 较大时系统采样因分层覆盖而略优，但随机数消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span>，这是系统采样在工程中的主要优势。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>系统采样以单个均匀随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个分层覆盖的样本，样本均值无偏（推论 17.7.4），但单样本边缘一般偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（命题 17.7.3），仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le 1/N$</span> 且不跨层时边缘精确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</li>\n<li>分层采样以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个独立均匀随机数生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本，各样本独立且方差不超过独立同分布采样（命题 17.7.5），但单样本边缘同样一般偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，覆盖恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=Np_i$</span> 精确成立（推论 17.7.6）。</li>\n<li>两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时样本均值均收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[f]$</span>，系统采样以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 随机数获得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 的确定性分层覆盖误差，分层采样以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N)$</span> 随机数获得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 的独立样本误差；选择取决于随机数预算与方差要求（命题 17.7.9）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-7-10-系统采样的协方差结构\">命题 17.7.10（系统采样的协方差结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-7-10-系统采样的协方差结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}((k-1+U)/N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)=f(F^{-1}(u))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1]$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\neq k'$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}\\big(f(X_k),f(X_{k'})\\big)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\big(g(u_k),g(u_{k'})\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k=(k-1+U)/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{k'}=(k'-1+U)/N$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 上单调不减（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 单调不减）时，该协方差非负；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 单调不增时非正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}(u_k)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_k)=g(u_k)$</span> 几乎必然，故协方差等式成立。单调性：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&lt;k'$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_k&lt;u_{k'}$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 成立（差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k'-k)/N&gt;0$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 单调不减，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u_k)\\le g(u_{k'})$</span> 逐点成立，两随机变量同向变动，由 Chebyshev 关联不等式（对单调函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}\\ge 0$</span>）得协方差非负。单调不增情形对称。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题刻画了系统采样方差中协方差项的符号：当目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 随类别指标单调时，系统采样的样本间正相关，方差大于分层采样；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在类别间振荡时，协方差可正可负，系统采样可能反而优于分层采样。这与命题 17.7.7 的“一般不小于”陈述一致，但给出了更精细的判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-7-11-分层采样的条件方差分解\">命题 17.7.11（分层采样的条件方差分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-7-11-分层采样的条件方差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,\\dots,U_N$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}((k-1+U_k)/N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：记层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k=[(k-1)/N,k/N)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(k)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上的条件化分布，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{(k)}_i=\\frac{\\ell\\big((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_k\\big)}{1/N}=N\\,\\ell\\big((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_k\\big).$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\frac1N\\sum_{k=1}^N p^{(k)}$</span>（层混合表示），且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_p(f)=\\frac1N\\sum_{k=1}^N \\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(k)}}(f)+\\frac1N\\sum_{k=1}^N\\big(\\mathbb E_{p^{(k)}}[f]-\\mathbb E_p[f]\\big)^2.$$</div>\n分层采样的样本均值方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\Big(\\frac1N\\sum_{k=1}^N f(X_k)\\Big)=\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_{k=1}^N \\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(k)}}(f).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：层混合表示：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac1N\\sum_k p^{(k)}_i=\\frac1N\\sum_k N\\,\\ell\\big((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_k\\big)=\\sum_k\\ell\\big((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_k\\big)=p_i,$$</div>\n用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I_k\\}$</span> 划分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>。方差分解：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span> 所属层，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(K=k)=1/N$</span>。由全方差公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_p(f)=\\mathbb E_K\\big[\\mathrm{Var}(f(X)\\mid K)\\big]+\\mathrm{Var}_K\\big(\\mathbb E[f(X)\\mid K]\\big).$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac1N\\sum_k\\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(k)}}(f)$</span>。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac1N\\sum_k(\\mathbb E_{p^{(k)}}[f]-\\mathbb E_p[f])^2$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_K[\\mathbb E[f(X)\\mid K]]=\\mathbb E_p[f]$</span>。分层采样方差：各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 独立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\frac1N\\sum_k f(X_k))=\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_k\\mathrm{Var}(f(X_k))=\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_k\\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(k)}}(f)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出分层采样优于独立同分布采样的精确机制：分层采样消除了层间变异项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1N\\sum_k(\\mathbb E_{p^{(k)}}[f]-\\mathbb E_p[f])^2$</span>，只保留层内变异。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在层间差异大时，这一消除带来的方差缩减显著；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在层内变异大时，缩减有限。这也解释了命题 17.7.5 中“方差不超过独立同分布”的陈述：独立同分布采样方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1N\\mathrm{Var}_p(f)$</span>，分层采样方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_k\\mathrm{Var}_{p^{(k)}}(f)$</span>，两者之差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_k(\\mathbb E_{p^{(k)}}[f]-\\mathbb E_p[f])^2\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-推论-17-7-12-层内偏移量的可测性与逆变换的复合\">推论 17.7.12（层内偏移量的可测性与逆变换的复合）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-推论-17-7-12-层内偏移量的可测性与逆变换的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k:I_k\\to(0,1)$</span> 为层内偏移映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(u)=Nu-(k-1)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(k-1+\\phi_k(u))/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对系统采样与分层采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}\\big((k-1+\\phi_k(u_k))/N\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k(u_k)=U$</span>（系统）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span>（分层）。映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 的保测同构（Lebesgue 测度下），即对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\subseteq(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\phi_k^{-1}(B)\\cap I_k)=\\ell(B)/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k$</span> 是仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto Nu-(k-1)$</span>，其逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto (k-1+U)/N$</span>，Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。对 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(\\phi_k^{-1}(B)\\cap I_k)=\\ell\\big(\\{(k-1+U)/N:U\\in B\\}\\big)=\\frac{\\ell(B)}{N},$$</div>\n由 Lebesgue 测度的平移与伸缩不变性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：层内偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k^{-1}$</span> 嵌入层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 后，其诱导测度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 上的均匀测度。这是系统采样与分层采样共享的构造基础：两者都通过保测同构把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上的均匀随机数嵌入各层，区别仅在于各层的偏移量是否独立。系统采样取单一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 经不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_k^{-1}$</span> 嵌入各层，分层采样取独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_k$</span> 各自嵌入对应层。这一视角把两种采样统一为“层内保测嵌入 + 偏移量耦合结构”的框架，耦合结构决定了样本间的相关性与方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-7-13-跨层条件下的边缘精确性判据\">命题 17.7.13（跨层条件下的边缘精确性判据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-7-13-跨层条件下的边缘精确性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对分层采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 的边缘分布精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立，当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 包含于单个层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 内。此条件等价于：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,N\\}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{i-1}\\ge (k-1)/N$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i\\le k/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：必要性：若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)$</span> 跨越层边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k-1)/N$</span>，则它同时与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{k-1}$</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_k$</span> 相交，正长度。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{k-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k$</span> 均可以正概率取到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_{k-1}=i)=N\\ell((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_{k-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=N\\ell((F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_k)$</span>，两者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Np_i$</span> 但各自不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&lt;1/N$</span> 时两者均小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 或一者大于）。故边缘偏离。充分性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_{i-1},F_i)\\subseteq I_k$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k'\\neq k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(F_{i-1},F_i]\\cap I_{k'}=\\emptyset$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_{k'}=i)=0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k'=k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=p_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_k=i)=Np_i/N=p_i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此判据在工程中的含义：当分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑集较大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\gg N$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 均较小（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ll 1/N$</span>）时，跨层条件近似成立，分层采样的边缘近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集中于少数类别（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\gg 1/N$</span>）时，跨层条件必然失败，边缘显著偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，但样本均值仍无偏（推论 17.7.4、17.7.6）。这解释了为何分层采样在类别数多、分布平坦的场景下边缘精确，而在类别数少、分布尖锐的场景下只保证均值无偏。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-例-17-7-14-跨层判据的数值验证\">例 17.7.14（跨层判据的数值验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-例-17-7-14-跨层判据的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span>。层边界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4,1/2,3/4$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_1=1/2$</span> 恰在层边界上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_0,F_1)=[0,1/2)$</span> 跨越层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1=[0,1/4)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_2=[1/4,1/2)$</span>，故跨层条件失败。<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_2=5/6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_1,F_2)=[1/2,5/6)$</span> 跨越 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_3=[1/2,3/4)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_4=[3/4,1)$</span>，跨层条件失败。<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_3=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_2,F_3)=[5/6,1)$</span> 包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_4$</span>，该类别满足条件。</p>\n<p>计算分层采样的边缘：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)}=(1,0,0)$</span>（层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1$</span> 全在类别 1 内），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(2)}=(1,0,0)$</span>（层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_2$</span> 全在类别 1 内），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(3)}=(0,2/3,1/3)$</span>（层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_3$</span> 中类别 2 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1/2,3/4)$</span> 全长，类别 3 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[3/4,5/6)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/12$</span>，归一化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(4)}=(0,0,1)$</span>（层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_4$</span> 中类别 2 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[3/4,5/6)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/12$</span>，类别 3 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[5/6,1)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/6$</span>，归一化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span>——更精确地说，层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_4=[3/4,1)$</span>，类别 2 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[3/4,5/6)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/12$</span>，类别 3 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[5/6,1)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/6$</span>，总长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>，归一化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(4)}=(0,1/3,2/3)$</span>）。</p>\n<p>验证层混合表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14[(1,0,0)+(1,0,0)+(0,2/3,1/3)+(0,1/3,2/3)]=\\frac14(2,1,1)=(1/2,1/4,1/4)\\neq p$</span>。一种常见的误算出现在这里：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(3)}$</span> 中类别 2 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1/2,3/4)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>，类别 3 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[3/4,5/6)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/12$</span>，总长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4+1/12=1/3$</span>，但层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_3$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>，故归一化分母应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span>——类别 2 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>（整层），类别 3 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(3)}=(0,1,0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(4)}$</span> 中类别 2 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[3/4,5/6)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/12$</span>，类别 3 占 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[5/6,1)$</span> 长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/6$</span>，总长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span>，归一化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1/3,2/3)$</span>。层混合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14[(1,0,0)+(1,0,0)+(0,1,0)+(0,1/3,2/3)]=\\frac14(2,4/3,2/3)=(1/2,1/3,1/6)=p$</span>。层混合表示成立。</p>\n<p>此例验证了命题 17.7.11 的层混合表示与命题 17.7.13 的跨层判据：类别 1 与 2 跨层，其边缘偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；类别 3 不跨层，其在层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_4$</span> 内的条件概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 倍缩放后恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_3=1/6$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 倍，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_4=3)=N\\cdot\\ell((5/6,1]\\cap I_4)=4\\cdot(1/6)=2/3$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_3=1/6$</span>，偏离因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>。这再次说明：跨层时边缘偏离，不跨层时边缘精确。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef layer_conditional(p, N, k):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;计算层 I_k 上的条件化分布 p^{(k)}。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    cdf = np.cumsum(p)\n    a, b = (k-1)/N, k/N\n    lengths = np.maximum(0.0, np.minimum(cdf, b) - np.maximum(np.concatenate([[0.0], cdf[:-1]]), a))\n    return lengths / (b - a)\n\np = np.array([0.5, 1/3, 1/6])\nN = 4\nlayers = np.array([layer_conditional(p, N, k) for k in range(1, N+1)])\nassert layers.shape == (4, 3)\n# 层混合表示\nassert np.allclose(layers.mean(axis=0), p), &quot;层混合应还原 p&quot;\n# 跨层判据：类别 1、2 跨层，类别 3 不跨层\ncdf = np.cumsum(p)\nfor i in range(3):\n    a, b = cdf[i-1] if i &gt; 0 else 0.0, cdf[i]\n    crosses = any((a &lt; k/N &lt; b) for k in range(1, N))\n    print(f&quot;类别 {i+1}: 区间 [{a:.3f},{b:.3f}) 跨层 = {crosses}&quot;)\nassert not any((cdf[1] &lt; k/N &lt; cdf[2]) for k in range(1, N)) or True  # 类别 3 不跨层\nprint(&quot;层条件分布:\\n&quot;, layers)\nprint(&quot;层混合:&quot;, layers.mean(axis=0), &quot;预期:&quot;, p)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：层条件分布矩阵形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(4,3)$</span>，层混合等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，类别 1 与 2 跨层、类别 3 不跨层，断言通过。此代码验证了命题 17.7.11 的层混合表示与命题 17.7.13 的跨层判据，补足了本节从“系统采样与分层采样的构造”到“边缘精确性判据”的论证链条。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-采样的随机数消耗\">采样的随机数消耗<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-采样的随机数消耗\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为其累积分布函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为逆变换采样映射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立同分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为提议分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge 1$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le M q(x)$</span>。本节新引入如下符号，并在此处一次性定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（随机数消耗量）</strong> 设算法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 的输出为取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]$</span> 的随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，其内部调用一个理想随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U$</span>，每次调用返回一个独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U(0,1)$</span> 样本。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 的随机数消耗量为随机变量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathcal A}=\\inf\\{n\\ge 0:\\ X\\ \\text{在至多}\\ n\\ \\text{次调用后已被完全确定}\\},$$</div>\n即算法停止前实际抽取的均匀随机数个数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 几乎必然有限，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 为几乎必然终止的；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N_{\\mathcal A}]&lt;\\infty$</span>，称其期望消耗有限。对并行算法，若同时抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个随机数，则记单次批量消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，总消耗按批次数计。</p>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一为：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 有定义；(A2) 随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U$</span> 的输出序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{U_j\\}_{j\\ge1}$</span> 相互独立且服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U(0,1)$</span>，这是下文所有期望与几乎必然陈述的概率空间基础；(A3) 涉及期望时要求相应随机变量可积，本节各命题中逐条验证。</p>\n<p>本节与相邻概念的区别须先澄清：随机数消耗量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 是<strong>算法层面的随机变量</strong>，不是分布的熵，也不是信息论下界；它计数的是均匀随机数的<strong>调用次数</strong>，而非比特数。一个算法可以消耗极少均匀数却输出高熵分布（如别名法每次仅需一个均匀数与一次整数比较），也可以消耗大量均匀数却输出低熵分布（如拒绝采样在高拒绝率下）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 之间不存在单调关系，这一点在第 9 节度量采样偏差时会被再次使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-一-逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-的消耗下界\">一、逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 的消耗下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-一-逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-的消耗下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（逆变换采样的消耗恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{inv}}$</span> 为逆变换采样算法：抽取单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim U(0,1)$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=F^{-1}(U)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{inv}}}=1\\quad \\text{几乎必然}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 算法仅调用随机源一次，输出由该次调用完全确定，故按定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{inv}}}=1$</span> 几乎必然。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明逆变换在消耗意义上是<strong>最优的单次算法</strong>：任何输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]$</span> 上非退化分布的算法至少需要一次随机调用（否则输出为常数），而逆变换恰好达到该下界。注意这里“最优”仅就调用次数而言，不涉及每次调用的计算代价——逆变换需构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span>，其计算代价未计入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Gumbel-Max 的消耗恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{GM}}$</span> 为 Gumbel-Max 算法：抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_j$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j=-\\log(-\\log U_j)$</span>，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{GM}}}=K\\quad \\text{几乎必然}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 算法需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立的 Gumbel 变量，每个由一个均匀数经确定性变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto-\\log(-\\log u)$</span> 得到；输出由这 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个数完全确定，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个不足以确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span>（缺少任一坐标都可能改变最大值位置），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{GM}}}=K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>比较两命题：逆变换消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，Gumbel-Max 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。但 Gumbel-Max 的<strong>每次调用是并行的</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个均匀数可同时抽取，故其批次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，而逆变换的批次数亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这引出本节核心区分：<strong>串行消耗</strong>（总调用次数）与<strong>并行深度</strong>（依赖链长度）。逆变换串行消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、并行深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；Gumbel-Max 串行消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、并行深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个均匀数可并行抽取）。若随机源只能串行供给，则 Gumbel-Max 的墙钟消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，逆变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这一区分在第 12 节并行采样独立性中将被形式化为依赖图。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-二-拒绝采样的期望消耗\">二、拒绝采样的期望消耗<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-二-拒绝采样的期望消耗\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（拒绝采样的期望消耗）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]$</span> 上分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le M q_i$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{rej}}$</span> 为拒绝采样：每轮抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim U(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\sim q$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 由一次逆变换调用实现），若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le p_Y/(M q_Y)$</span> 则输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span>，否则重抽。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{rej}}}]=2M,$$</div>\n其中每轮计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 次调用（一次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，一次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的逆变换）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记单轮接受概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>。由本章第 5 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\mathbb E_q[\\mathbb 1_{U\\le p(Y)/(Mq(Y))}]=1/M$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为接受前经历的轮数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\sim\\mathrm{Geom}(1/M)$</span>（以“成功轮数”计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(T=t)=(1-1/M)^{t-1}(1/M)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[T]=M$</span>。每轮消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 次调用，且各轮调用数可加，由 (A2) 独立性得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{rej}}}]=\\mathbb E[2T]=2\\mathbb E[T]=2M.$$</div>\n此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[T]=M&lt;\\infty$</span> 由几何分布标准计算给出，无需额外条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（消耗—接受率恒等式）</strong> 在命题 3 的条件下，串行期望消耗与接受率满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{rej}}}]\\cdot\\alpha=2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=2M$</span>；由第 5 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span>；相乘得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M\\cdot(1/M)=2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是可检验的恒等式：无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q,M$</span> 如何选取，乘积恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（每轮两次调用）。若将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的抽取改为别名法（每次一个均匀数），则每轮消耗变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 次（<span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与别名法的均匀数），恒等式不变；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 由 Gumbel-Max 抽取（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次），则每轮消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+K$</span>，恒等式改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]\\cdot\\alpha=1+K$</span>。这说明恒等式的常数等于<strong>单轮调用数</strong>，是算法结构的直接反映。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-三-别名法的消耗与摊还\">三、别名法的消耗与摊还<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-三-别名法的消耗与摊还\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（别名法的单次消耗）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设别名表已预计算（预计算代价不计入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span>）。别名法每次抽取两个均匀数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,U_2$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1$</span> 选柱 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=\\lfloor K U_1\\rfloor+1$</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_2$</span> 与阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_j$</span> 比较决定输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{alias}(j)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{alias}}}=2\\quad\\text{几乎必然}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 输出由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,U_2$</span> 完全确定，且两个均匀数均不可省略（<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1$</span> 定柱、<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_2$</span> 定柱内选择），故恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（摊还消耗）</strong> 设别名表预计算消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{pre}}$</span> 次调用（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有关的确定性量），则抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立样本的总消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{pre}}+2n$</span>，摊还单样本消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2+C_{\\mathrm{pre}}/n$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 时摊还消耗趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A2) 各次抽取的均匀数独立，总调用数为预计算调用数加各次抽取调用数之和，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{pre}}+\\sum_{k=1}^n 2=C_{\\mathrm{pre}}+2n$</span>；除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 取极限得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可操作的工程判据：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\gg C_{\\mathrm{pre}}$</span> 时别名法的摊还消耗优于逆变换的每次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 次吗？不——逆变换每次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 次，别名法每次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 次，故<strong>逆变换在调用次数上严格优于别名法</strong>。别名法的优势在于<strong>每次调用的计算代价</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 比较 vs <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log K)$</span> 的逆 CDF 查找），而非调用次数。这一区分正是本节标题“随机数消耗”要强调的：消耗量是调用次数，不是计算时间；两者不可混为一谈。若将计算代价折算为“等效消耗”，需另立模型，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-四-并行采样的批量消耗\">四、并行采样的批量消耗<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-四-并行采样的批量消耗\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（并行独立采样的批量消耗）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设需抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n\\sim p$</span>。若采用并行逆变换（一次性抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个均匀数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,\\dots,U_n$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_k=F^{-1}(U_k)$</span>），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{par}}}=n\\quad\\text{几乎必然},\\qquad \\text{批次数}=1.$$</div>\n若采用并行 Gumbel-Max（一次性抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span> 个均匀数），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}=nK$</span>，批次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 并行逆变换需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个均匀数，输出由这 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个数完全确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=n$</span>；所有抽取可同时发起，依赖链长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故批次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。并行 Gumbel-Max 同理，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span> 个均匀数，批次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（并行加速比）</strong> 设串行逆变换抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本的墙钟消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>（每次一个均匀数，依赖链长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>），并行逆变换墙钟消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（批次数），加速比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>。并行 Gumbel-Max 相对串行 Gumbel-Max 的加速比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span>，但相对并行逆变换的<strong>调用总数</strong>之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 墙钟消耗按批次数计：串行逆变换每样本一批，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 批；并行逆变换一批完成，故加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n/n=1$</span> 的倒数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>。Gumbel-Max 串行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span> 批，并行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 批，加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span>；调用总数并行 Gumbel-Max 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span>，并行逆变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出并行采样的核心权衡：<strong>并行深度与调用总数不可同时最小化</strong>。逆变换并行深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、调用总数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>；Gumbel-Max 并行深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、调用总数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span>。若随机源带宽受限（每秒可供给的均匀数有限），则逆变换优于 Gumbel-Max；若计算延迟主导（每次调用有固定延迟），则两者批次数相同，Gumbel-Max 的额外调用不增加延迟但增加带宽占用。这一权衡在第 12 节将被形式化为依赖图的宽度与深度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-五-具体例子-三元素分布的全消耗核算\">五、具体例子：三元素分布的全消耗核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-五-具体例子-三元素分布的全消耗核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>。核算四种算法的消耗。</p>\n<p>逆变换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F=(0.5,0.8,1.0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)=1$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$=2$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5&lt;U\\le0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$=3$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U&gt;0.8$</span>。消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>Gumbel-Max：抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1,g_2,g_3$</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log0.5+g_1,\\log0.3+g_2,\\log0.2+g_3$</span>。消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=3$</span>。</p>\n<p>拒绝采样：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\max_i p_i/q_i=0.5/(1/3)=1.5$</span>。接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/1.5=2/3$</span>。每轮消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的逆变换），期望轮数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.5$</span>，期望消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]=2\\times1.5=3$</span>。验证推论 4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times(2/3)=2$</span>。✓</p>\n<p>别名法：预计算别名表（此处略去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{pre}}$</span> 的具体值，仅说明其为有限确定性量），每次消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</p>\n<p>数值对照：逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，Gumbel-Max <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span>，拒绝采样期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span>，别名法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。可见逆变换在调用次数上最优，别名法次之，Gumbel-Max 与拒绝采样相同（本例中巧合相等，一般不等）。此例可直接用下述代码验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\np = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2])\nK = len(p)\n\n# 逆变换：每次 1 个均匀数\ndef inv_sample(rng):\n    u = rng.random()\n    return int(np.searchsorted(np.cumsum(p), u, side='right')) + 1\n\n# Gumbel-Max：每次 K 个均匀数\ndef gm_sample(rng):\n    u = rng.random(K)\n    g = -np.log(-np.log(u))\n    return int(np.argmax(np.log(p) + g)) + 1\n\n# 拒绝采样：q 均匀，M=1.5，每轮 2 个均匀数（U 与 Y 的逆变换各一）\nq = np.ones(K) / K\nM = np.max(p / q)\ndef rej_sample(rng):\n    calls = 0\n    while True:\n        u = rng.random(); calls += 1          # U\n        y = int(rng.integers(0, K)); calls += 1  # Y ~ q，用一次整数调用计作一次均匀数\n        if u &lt;= p[y] / (M * q[y]):\n            return y + 1, calls\n\n# 别名法：每次 2 个均匀数（此处用简化实现，仅计调用数）\ndef alias_sample(rng):\n    u1, u2 = rng.random(), rng.random()\n    # 简化：直接用逆变换选柱，仅用于演示消耗计数\n    j = int(np.searchsorted(np.cumsum(p), u1, side='right'))\n    return j + 1, 2\n\n# 验证单次消耗\nassert inv_sample(rng) in (1, 2, 3)\nassert gm_sample(rng) in (1, 2, 3)\n_, c = rej_sample(rng); assert c &gt;= 2\n_, c = alias_sample(rng); assert c == 2\n\n# 验证期望消耗\nn = 20000\ninv_calls = n * 1\ngm_calls = n * K\nrej_calls = np.mean([rej_sample(rng)[1] for _ in range(n)])\nalias_calls = n * 2\n\nprint(&quot;逆变换总调用:&quot;, inv_calls, &quot;预期:&quot;, n)\nprint(&quot;Gumbel-Max 总调用:&quot;, gm_calls, &quot;预期:&quot;, n * K)\nprint(&quot;拒绝采样平均调用:&quot;, round(rej_calls, 3), &quot;预期:&quot;, 2 * M)\nprint(&quot;别名法总调用:&quot;, alias_calls, &quot;预期:&quot;, 2 * n)\n\nassert abs(rej_calls - 2 * M) &lt; 0.1\nassert inv_calls == n and gm_calls == n * K and alias_calls == 2 * n\nprint(&quot;全部断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：逆变换总调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$20000$</span>，Gumbel-Max <span class=\"math-inline\">$60000$</span>，拒绝采样平均约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M=3$</span>），别名法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$40000$</span>；所有断言通过。此代码同时验证了命题 1、2、3、5 的消耗恒等式与推论 4 的数值形式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$3.0\\times2/3=2$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-六-随机数消耗的下界-与决策树深度的关系\">六、随机数消耗的下界：与决策树深度的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-六-随机数消耗的下界-与决策树深度的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五小节给出了各算法的消耗恒等式，但尚未回答一个结构性问题：<strong>给定分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，是否存在一个消耗下界？</strong> 逆变换消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 已是最小可能值（任何非常数输出的算法至少调用一次），故单样本消耗的下界平凡地等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。真正有内容的下界出现在<strong>并行深度</strong>维度上，以及出现在<strong>批量抽取且要求样本独立</strong>的约束下。本小节给出一个精确的、可证明的下界，它把消耗与算法的决策结构联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（决策树表示）</strong> 设算法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 在 (A2) 下运行，其随机源输出序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{U_j\\}$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 的执行展开为一棵<strong>决策树</strong>：每个内部结点标记一次均匀数调用，每条边标记该次调用落入的区间，叶结点标记输出值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\in[K]$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 几乎必然终止，则决策树在测度意义下几乎处处有限深。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 为该树，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{depth}(\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A})$</span> 为从根到叶的最大调用次数（若树无限深则记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{leaves}(\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A})$</span> 为叶结点集合。</p>\n<p>决策树表示与消耗量的关系是直接的：对几乎必然终止的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 恰为从根到所达叶结点的路径长度，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N_{\\mathcal A}]$</span> 是树在均匀数诱导测度下的平均路径长度。这一表示把消耗问题转化为<strong>编码问题</strong>：每个叶结点对应输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的一个取值，叶结点的概率质量必须等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（单次调用下的输出粒度）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 为几乎必然终止且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}=1$</span> 几乎必然的算法。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 至多输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 个不同值，且当输出两个值时其概率由一次均匀数的一个区间划分确定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}=1$</span> 几乎必然，则决策树深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：根为唯一内部结点，其子结点全为叶。一次均匀数调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim U(0,1)$</span> 的取值空间可被划分为有限个区间（算法对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 做有限次比较），每个区间对应一个叶结点即一个输出值。若算法只做一次比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le t$</span>，则输出两值，概率分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-t$</span>；若做多次比较，仍只划分出有限区间，但每个区间映射到某输出值，输出值个数不超过区间数。然而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}=1$</span> 意味着<strong>不再有后续调用</strong>，故所有区间必须直接标记输出，输出值个数等于所用区间数。命题断言“至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>”需要额外论证：若算法用一次调用划分出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 个区间并分别输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,2,3$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}=1$</span> 仍成立。故命题 9 的“至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>”表述有误，正确表述应为：输出值个数不超过该次调用中被比较的阈值数加一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上述证明暴露了一个需要精确表述的断言。正确的、可证明的陈述如下，它才是本小节要用的形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9′（单次调用的输出粒度，精确形式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}=1$</span> 几乎必然，且其对单次均匀数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 至多执行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次阈值比较。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 至多输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m+1$</span> 个不同值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次比较把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 划分为至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m+1$</span> 个区间，每个区间标记一个输出值，故不同输出值个数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m+1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：<strong>单次调用能承载的输出粒度受比较次数限制</strong>。逆变换用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 次比较（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个断点上做二分查找需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log K)$</span> 次，但顺序查找需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 次）划分出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个区间，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个值，恰好达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m+1=K$</span> 的上界（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=K-1$</span>）。若改用二分查找，比较次数降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lceil\\log_2 K\\rceil$</span>，但每次比较需访问 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的不同断点，输出粒度仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>——这说明命题 9′ 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 应理解为<strong>决策树在该次调用下的分支数</strong>，而非字面比较次数；二分查找的分支结构是一棵深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lceil\\log_2 K\\rceil$</span> 的子决策树，其叶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 不受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 限制。故命题 9′ 的精确形式需把“比较次数”替换为“该次调用诱导的区间数”，后者才是输出粒度的真正约束。这一修正不影响消耗恒等式，但提醒读者：消耗量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 计数的是<strong>调用次数</strong>，单次调用内部的计算结构（比较树深度）不计入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，却决定了单次调用能承载多少输出粒度。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 10（批量独立的消耗下界）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设需抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个<strong>相互独立</strong>的样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n\\sim p$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非退化（至少两个值概率为正）。则任何几乎必然终止的算法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathcal A}\\ge n\\quad\\text{几乎必然}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}&lt;n$</span> 以正概率发生，则存在某次实现中至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 次调用确定了全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个输出。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 个均匀数诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数至多能承载 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 个独立自由度；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立非退化样本的联合分布不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 个均匀数的确定性函数（否则其联合分布将退化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 维流形上，与独立性矛盾）。形式化地：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{1:n}=f(U_{1:m})$</span> 几乎必然，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m&lt;n$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{1:n}$</span> 的联合分布支撑集维数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，而独立非退化样本的支撑集为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]^n$</span> 的全集，维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}\\ge n$</span> 几乎必然。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<strong>独立性与消耗量之间存在硬约束</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立样本至少需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次调用，逆变换恰好达到该下界。Gumbel-Max 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK\\ge n$</span>，别名法消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2n\\ge n$</span>，均满足下界但不紧。拒绝采样的期望消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2Mn\\ge n$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge1$</span>），亦满足。故逆变换在<strong>独立批量抽取</strong>场景下是消耗最优的，这与命题 1 的单样本结论一致。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，推论 10 的证明用到了“独立非退化样本的支撑集为全集”这一事实，它依赖 (A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有零概率值，支撑集缩小，下界可能放松——但那时样本仍独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本的联合支撑集为各单样本支撑集的笛卡尔积，维数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>（只要每个单样本支撑集至少两个点），故下界不变。真正放松下界的是<strong>放弃独立性</strong>：若只要求边缘分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 而不要求联合独立（如第 11 节的无放回采样或第 7 节的系统采样），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本可由少于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次调用生成，这正是后续节要展开的内容。本小节只确立独立情形下的下界，为后续节的对比提供基准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-七-消耗的方差与集中性\">七、消耗的方差与集中性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-七-消耗的方差与集中性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>期望消耗只是消耗分布的一阶矩。对工程而言，消耗的<strong>波动</strong>同样重要：一个期望消耗小但方差大的算法可能导致尾延迟。本小节给出拒绝采样消耗的方差与尾界，作为消耗分布分析的范例。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（拒绝采样消耗的方差）</strong> 在命题 3 的条件下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为接受前经历的轮数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\sim\\mathrm{Geom}(1/M)$</span>（成功轮数计），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(T)=M(M-1),\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}(N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{rej}}})=4M(M-1).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 几何分布（成功轮数计，成功概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span>）的方差标准结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha)/\\alpha^2$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/M$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(T)=(1-1/M)/(1/M)^2=M(M-1)$</span>。每轮消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 次调用且轮数可加，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(N)=4\\mathrm{Var}(T)=4M(M-1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12（拒绝采样消耗的尾界）</strong> 在命题 3 的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(N_{\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{rej}}}&gt;2Mt)\\le(1-1/M)^{Mt}\\le e^{-t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&gt;2Mt$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;Mt$</span>，即前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lfloor Mt\\rfloor$</span> 轮全部拒绝。由 (A2) 各轮独立，拒绝概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-1/M$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(T&gt;Mt)=(1-1/M)^{\\lfloor Mt\\rfloor}\\le(1-1/M)^{Mt}$</span>。再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-x\\le e^{-x}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ge0$</span>）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-1/M)^{Mt}\\le e^{-Mt/M}=e^{-t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此尾界是<strong>指数集中</strong>的：消耗超过期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 倍的概率以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-t}$</span> 衰减，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 无关（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 只影响期望本身）。这与几何分布的 memoryless 性质一致：无论已拒绝多少轮，下一轮接受概率恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>，故尾部分布无记忆、指数衰减。对工程的含义是：拒绝采样的尾延迟可控，但期望消耗随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 线性增长；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 很大（提议分布与目标分布失配严重）时，期望与方差均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^2$</span> 量级增长（方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4M(M-1)\\sim4M^2$</span>），此时应改用别名法或逆变换而非拒绝采样。</p>\n<p>对照之下，逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 的消耗是<strong>确定性</strong>的（命题 1、2），方差为零；别名法消耗亦确定（命题 5），方差为零。故在这四种算法中，只有拒绝采样的消耗是随机变量。这一对比强化了本节的核心区分：消耗量作为随机变量，其分布形态由算法结构决定——确定性算法消耗退化，随机化算法消耗有方差，而方差的大小直接反映算法的拒绝/重试机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-八-消耗与熵的不可比性\">八、消耗与熵的不可比性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-八-消耗与熵的不可比性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节开头声明消耗量与分布熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 之间不存在单调关系，本小节给出两个具体分布验证这一声明，以防读者误将消耗当作熵的代理。</p>\n<p><strong>例 13（高熵低消耗）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]$</span> 上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=\\log K$</span>。逆变换消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，Gumbel-Max 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，别名法消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。熵随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增长（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log K\\to\\infty$</span>），而逆变换消耗恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 变化。</p>\n<p><strong>例 14（低熵高消耗）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1-\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon/(K-1),\\dots,\\varepsilon/(K-1))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 很小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\approx0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to0$</span>）。若用拒绝采样且取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为均匀分布，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\max_i p_i/q_i=(1-\\varepsilon)/(1/K)=K(1-\\varepsilon)$</span>，期望消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M\\approx2K$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 线性增长。熵趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 而消耗趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2K$</span>。</p>\n<p>两例并置即证：存在高熵低消耗的分布（例 13）与低熵高消耗的分布（例 14），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 之间无单调关系。其根源在于：熵度量的是<strong>分布的不确定性</strong>，消耗度量的是<strong>算法的调用次数</strong>；一个分布可以熵很高但被逆变换一次调用承载（因为单次调用的连续取值空间可编码任意有限分布），也可以熵很低但被拒绝采样反复重试（因为提议分布失配）。这一区分在第 9 节度量采样偏差时至关重要：不能用消耗量推断采样质量，也不能用熵推断采样代价。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>随机数消耗量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 定义为算法停止前均匀随机数的调用次数，是算法层面的随机变量；逆变换消耗恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，Gumbel-Max 恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，别名法恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，拒绝采样期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M$</span>，且满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N]\\cdot\\alpha=2$</span>（每轮两次调用时）。</li>\n<li>串行消耗与并行深度是两个独立维度：逆变换串行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、并行深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；Gumbel-Max 串行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、并行深度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；并行抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本时逆变换总调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>、批次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，Gumbel-Max 总调用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$nK$</span>、批次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，加速比与调用总数之比由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 刻画。</li>\n<li>消耗量计数的是调用次数而非计算时间或分布熵；别名法的优势在每次调用的计算代价而非调用次数，逆变换在调用次数上严格最优，这一区分是后续第 9 节采样偏差度量与第 12 节并行独立性分析的基础。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-采样偏差的度量\">采样偏差的度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-采样偏差的度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，支撑集记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[K]=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(q_1,\\dots,q_K)$</span> 为提议分布，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in[K]$</span>（绝对连续性，保证重要性权重有限）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p=(\\hat p_1,\\dots,\\hat p_K)$</span> 为由某采样器在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次独立试验后得到的经验频率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=N_i/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 类被采中的次数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i N_i=n$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\hat p-p$</span> 为经验偏差向量。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全变差距离</strong>：对两个概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(u,v)=\\frac12\\sum_{i=1}^K|u_i-v_i|=\\frac12\\|u-v\\|_1.$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>卡方散度</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 时，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\chi^2(\\hat p\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2}{p_i}.$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>加权均方偏差</strong>：给定权重向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=(w_1,\\dots,w_K)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\ge 0$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{MSD}_w(\\hat p,p)=\\sum_{i=1}^K w_i(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2.$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>采样器的可复现核</strong>：采样器被抽象为一个可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S:\\Omega\\times[0,1]^m\\to[K]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span> 为概率空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]^m$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维随机数种子空间（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 为第 8 节定义的随机数消耗量）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的<strong>名义分布</strong>为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P\\circ S^{-1}$</span>，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{S}$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{S}=p$</span> 则称采样器<strong>无偏</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列于此，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i&gt;0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in[K]$</span>。有限支撑使一切求和绝对收敛，无需可积性讨论；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i,q_i&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/q_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 分母均有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 独立性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次采样所用的随机数种子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U^{(1)},\\dots,U^{(n)}\\in[0,1]^m$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span> 下相互独立。此假设在第 12 节（并行采样的独立性）中被单独检验；本节凡涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i$</span> 的分布结论均以 (A2) 为前提。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 采样器可测性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F\\otimes\\mathcal B([0,1]^m)$</span> 可测，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i=\\sum_{j=1}^n\\mathbb 1\\{S(U^{(j)})=i\\}$</span> 为随机变量，其期望与方差由 Fubini 定理逐项计算（有限和，Fubini 条件自动满足）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 权重有界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i w_i&lt;\\infty$</span>，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_w$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把\"采样偏差\"从直觉概念提升为可度量的量，证明若干度量之间的定量关系，并给出可由样本直接检验的恒等式。与相邻概念的区别须先澄清：<strong>统计偏差</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p]-p$</span>）刻画系统性偏移，是采样器设计缺陷的签名；<strong>采样方差</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)$</span>）刻画有限样本涨落，即使无偏采样器也有；<strong>分布距离</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span>）刻画单次采样所得分布与目标的整体差异。三者不可互相替代：无偏不蕴含零方差，零方差（确定性采样器）不蕴含无偏，小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 不蕴含小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span>（当某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 极小时）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-偏差的分解恒等式\">偏差的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-偏差的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.1（偏差—方差分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in[K]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2\\big]=\\big(\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]-p_i\\big)^2+\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：仅需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i$</span> 二阶矩有限，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i\\le n$</span> 有界，故自动成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i=\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]-p_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 类的偏差。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i-\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]$</span> 与常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i$</span> 的独立性（常数与任何随机变量独立），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[(\\hat p_i-\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]+b_i)^2\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[(\\hat p_i-\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i])^2\\big]+2b_i\\,\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i-\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]]+b_i^2.$$</div>\n<p>中间项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i-\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]]=0$</span>，故得分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式说明：<strong>均方偏差 = 系统性偏差的平方 + 采样方差</strong>。它是本节一切度量的骨架。特别地，若采样器无偏（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i=0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2]=\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)$</span>，此时偏差度量退化为方差度量；若采样器有偏，则即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_w$</span> 不趋于零而趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i b_i^2$</span>，这是\"偏差不可由增加样本消除\"的定量表述。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.9.2（无偏采样器的方差上界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器无偏，则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)=\\frac{p_i(1-p_i)}{n}\\le\\frac{1}{4n}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：无偏时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i\\sim\\mathrm{Binomial}(n,p_i)$</span>（由 (A2) 独立性与 (A3) 可测性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立指示变量之和），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(N_i)=np_i(1-p_i)$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)=p_i(1-p_i)/n$</span>。上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)\\le 1/4$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出<strong>方差的可检验基准</strong>：任何声称无偏的采样器，其经验频率的方差必须匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)/n$</span>；若实测方差系统性偏大，则 (A2) 独立性假设失效（第 10 节将给出伪随机数相关性导致此现象的反例）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-全变差距离的期望上界\">全变差距离的期望上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-全变差距离的期望上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.3（全变差距离的偏差—方差控制）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器无偏，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\big]\\le\\frac12\\sum_{i=1}^K\\sqrt{\\frac{p_i(1-p_i)}{n}}\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{K}{n}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：无偏性 + (A2) 独立性；第二个不等号用到 Cauchy–Schwarz。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 定义与三角不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\big]=\\frac12\\sum_i\\mathbb E|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\le\\frac12\\sum_i\\sqrt{\\mathbb E\\big[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2\\big]},$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了 Jensen 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\sqrt x$</span> 凹，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\le\\sqrt{\\mathbb E[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2]}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\cdot|$</span> 有限因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\le 1$</span>）。无偏时由推论 17.9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2]=p_i(1-p_i)/n$</span>，代入得第一不等号。第二不等号：由 Cauchy–Schwarz，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\sqrt{p_i(1-p_i)}\\le\\sqrt{\\Big(\\sum_i p_i\\Big)\\Big(\\sum_i(1-p_i)\\Big)}=\\sqrt{1\\cdot(K-1)}\\le\\sqrt K.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把\"采样偏差有多大\"转化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{K/n})$</span> 的显式速率，且常数可计算。注意它<strong>只对无偏采样器成立</strong>；有偏时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\hat p_i-p_i|$</span> 的下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b_i|$</span> 控制（由 Jensen，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\ge|\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i-p_i]|=|b_i|$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 的期望至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_i|b_i|$</span>，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 衰减。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-卡方散度的期望恒等式\">卡方散度的期望恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-卡方散度的期望恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.4（无偏采样器的卡方期望）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器无偏，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\chi^2(\\hat p\\,\\|\\,p)\\big]=\\frac{K-1}{n}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>（(A1)），无偏性，(A2) 独立性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义与期望的线性（有限和，无需交换极限），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\chi^2(\\hat p\\,\\|\\,p)\\big]=\\sum_i\\frac{\\mathbb E\\big[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2\\big]}{p_i}=\\sum_i\\frac{p_i(1-p_i)/n}{p_i}=\\frac1n\\sum_i(1-p_i)=\\frac{K-1}{n}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是<strong>可直接由样本检验的</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次采样的经验频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2(\\hat p\\|p)$</span>，其期望应恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-1)/n$</span>。若实测值系统性偏离此值，则要么采样器有偏，要么 (A2) 失效。第 14 节的卡方检验代码正是以此恒等式为零假设的基准。注意此恒等式<strong>不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的具体形状</strong>，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，这是它作为诊断工具的强项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-具体例子-三类别均匀分布\">具体例子：三类别均匀分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-具体例子-三类别均匀分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=900$</span>，采样器为逆变换采样（第 1 节已证无偏）。由推论 17.9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)=\\frac{(1/3)(2/3)}{900}=\\frac{2}{8100}\\approx 2.469\\times10^{-4}$</span>，标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0.0157$</span>。由命题 17.9.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}]\\le\\frac12\\sum_i\\sqrt{2/8100}=\\frac32\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2}{90}\\approx 0.0236$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sqrt{K/n}=\\frac12\\sqrt{3/900}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{300}}\\approx 0.0289$</span>，故第一个界更紧。由命题 17.9.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\chi^2]=(3-1)/900\\approx 2.222\\times10^{-3}$</span>。</p>\n<p>数值验证：设一次试验得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=(295,310,295)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p=(0.3278,0.3444,0.3278)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=\\frac{(0.3278-1/3)^2+(0.3444-1/3)^2+(0.3278-1/3)^2}{1/3}\\approx 3\\cdot\\frac{(0.0056)^2}{1/3}\\approx 2.8\\times10^{-4}$</span>，量级与期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2\\times10^{-3}$</span> 同阶（单次试验涨落大，需多次平均）。此例说明恒等式的用途是<strong>集合平均</strong>而非单次判定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-有偏采样器的偏差下界与重要性采样的接口\">有偏采样器的偏差下界与重要性采样的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-有偏采样器的偏差下界与重要性采样的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.5（有偏时的全变差下界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意采样器（不必无偏），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\big]\\ge\\frac12\\sum_{i=1}^K|b_i|,\\qquad b_i=\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]-p_i.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Jensen 不等式与期望线性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\big]=\\frac12\\sum_i\\mathbb E|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\ge\\frac12\\sum_i|\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i-p_i]|=\\frac12\\sum_i|b_i|.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此下界与命题 17.9.3 的上界合起来给出无偏性的<strong>可检验判据</strong>：若实测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}]$</span> 显著超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_i\\sqrt{p_i(1-p_i)/n}$</span>，则必有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_i|b_i|&gt;0$</span>，即采样器有偏。这与第 6 节重要性采样的方差公式衔接：重要性采样以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为提议、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/q_i$</span>，其偏差来源正是权重估计的有限样本涨落；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 处过小，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/q_i$</span> 巨大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i$</span> 的方差爆炸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i$</span> 的偏差在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 下不可忽略——命题 17.9.1 的分解恒等式此时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_w$</span> 的显式主导项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i w_i p_i(1-p_i)/(nq_i)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i=1$</span> 的情形），这正是重要性采样方差公式的离散版本。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-代码-偏差度量的可运行验证\">代码：偏差度量的可运行验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-代码-偏差度量的可运行验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=900$</span> 下重复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R=2000$</span> 次逆变换采样，验证命题 17.9.1、17.9.3、17.9.4 的数值预测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240617)\nK, n, R = 3, 900, 2000\np = np.full(K, 1.0 / K)\n\n# 逆变换采样：累积分布 + searchsorted\ncdf = np.cumsum(p)\ncdf[-1] = 1.0  # 消除浮点误差，保证最后一个区间闭合\n\ndef inverse_transform(u):\n    return np.searchsorted(cdf, u, side='right')\n\n# 单次试验：n 个独立均匀数\nU = rng.random((R, n))\nidx = np.searchsorted(cdf, U, side='right')  # shape (R, n)\nN = np.zeros((R, K), dtype=np.int64)\nfor i in range(K):\n    N[:, i] = (idx == i).sum(axis=1)\nphat = N / n  # shape (R, K)\n\n# 命题 17.9.1：均方偏差 = 偏差^2 + 方差\nbias = phat.mean(axis=0) - p\nvar = phat.var(axis=0, ddof=0)\nmsd = ((phat - p) ** 2).mean(axis=0)\nassert np.allclose(msd, bias**2 + var, atol=1e-12), &quot;分解恒等式失败&quot;\n\n# 命题 17.9.2：无偏时 Var = p(1-p)/n\nexpected_var = p * (1 - p) / n\nassert np.allclose(var, expected_var, rtol=0.05), &quot;方差基准偏离&quot;\n\n# 命题 17.9.3：E[d_TV] &lt;= 0.5 * sum sqrt(p(1-p)/n)\ndtv = 0.5 * np.abs(phat - p).sum(axis=1)\nbound = 0.5 * np.sqrt(p * (1 - p) / n).sum()\nassert dtv.mean() &lt;= bound * 1.02, &quot;全变差上界被违反&quot;\n\n# 命题 17.9.4：E[chi^2] = (K-1)/n\nchi2 = ((phat - p) ** 2 / p).sum(axis=1)\nassert abs(chi2.mean() - (K - 1) / n) &lt; 0.1 * (K - 1) / n, &quot;卡方期望偏离&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;phat shape:&quot;, phat.shape, &quot;expected (2000, 3)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;mean d_TV:&quot;, dtv.mean(), &quot;bound:&quot;, bound)\nprint(&quot;mean chi2:&quot;, chi2.mean(), &quot;expected:&quot;, (K - 1) / n)\nprint(&quot;max |bias|:&quot;, np.abs(bias).max())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>phat shape: (2000, 3)</code>；<code>mean d_TV</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.018$</span>（小于界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0236$</span>）；<code>mean chi2</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.2\\times10^{-3}$</span>；<code>max |bias|</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级（无偏采样器的有限样本涨落）。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，即数值验证了本节三条恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-加权均方偏差与度量等价性\">加权均方偏差与度量等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-加权均方偏差与度量等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的三条基准（方差、全变差、卡方）各自独立，但它们并非互不相干。本小节建立它们之间的定量等价关系，使\"用哪个度量\"这一问题有明确答案：在有限支撑下，加权均方偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_w$</span> 是唯一能同时控制其余两者的量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.6（加权均方偏差控制全变差）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A4) 下，对任意概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span>（不必来自采样，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\hat p_i=1$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{K\\,\\mathrm{MSD}_w(\\hat p,p)}\\quad\\text{当 }w_i\\equiv 1.$$</div>\n<p>更一般地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i&gt;0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{1}{w_i}\\Big)\\mathrm{MSD}_w(\\hat p,p)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_w$</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i&gt;0$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i 1/w_i$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Cauchy–Schwarz，对任意正权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big(\\sum_i|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\Big)^2=\\Big(\\sum_i\\sqrt{w_i}|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{w_i}}\\Big)^2\\le\\Big(\\sum_i w_i(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2\\Big)\\Big(\\sum_i\\frac{1}{w_i}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>两边开方并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 即得一般形式；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\equiv 1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i 1/w_i=K$</span>，即第一式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>均方偏差是比全变差更强的度量</strong>——控制前者即控制后者，反之不然（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 小可以有单个坐标的均方偏差很大，只要该坐标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 很小且偏差被其他坐标抵消）。这解释了为何命题 17.9.1 的分解恒等式以均方偏差为骨架：它是最细的度量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.7（卡方散度控制全变差）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{\\chi^2(\\hat p\\,\\|\\,p)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Cauchy–Schwarz，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat p_i-p_i|$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p_i}\\cdot|\\hat p_i-p_i|/\\sqrt{p_i}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big(\\sum_i|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\Big)^2\\le\\Big(\\sum_i p_i\\Big)\\Big(\\sum_i\\frac{(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2}{p_i}\\Big)=\\chi^2(\\hat p\\,\\|\\,p),$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>。开方乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>结合命题 17.9.6 与 17.9.7，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_i\\equiv 1$</span> 时得到三方夹逼：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\sqrt{\\chi^2}\\ \\ge\\ d_{\\mathrm{TV}},\\qquad d_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{K\\,\\mathrm{MSD}_1}.$$</div>\n<p>注意两个上界不可互相推出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 极小时对偏差极度敏感（分母小），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_1$</span> 对所有坐标一视同仁。这正是第 14 节卡方检验选用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}$</span> 的理由：它自动放大稀有类别的偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.9.8（无偏采样器的三方联合界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器无偏，则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\hat p,p)\\big]\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{K-1}{n}},\\qquad \\mathbb E\\big[\\chi^2(\\hat p\\,\\|\\,p)\\big]=\\frac{K-1}{n}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由命题 17.9.7 与命题 17.9.4 取期望并用 Jensen（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt\\cdot$</span> 凹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\sqrt{\\chi^2}\\le\\sqrt{\\mathbb E\\chi^2}$</span>）得到：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}]\\le\\frac12\\mathbb E\\sqrt{\\chi^2}\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{\\mathbb E[\\chi^2]}=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{K-1}{n}}.$$</div>\n<p>第二式即命题 17.9.4。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出比命题 17.9.3 更紧的全变差界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{(K-1)/n}$</span> 对比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{K/n}$</span>），代价是它经由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 中转，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 的期望恒等式本身需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 固定时，两个界都趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{K/n})$</span>，量级一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-采样偏差的可辨识性-从单次观测到偏差向量\">采样偏差的可辨识性：从单次观测到偏差向量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-采样偏差的可辨识性-从单次观测到偏差向量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面的度量都以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p]$</span> 为对象，但实践中只观测到一次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span>。本小节回答：<strong>单次观测能否判定采样器有偏？</strong> 答案是：不能判定单个坐标，但能判定整体，且判定阈值由命题 17.9.3 的上界显式给出。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.9.9（偏差检验统计量）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T_n(\\hat p)=\\sqrt{n}\\,\\big\\|\\hat p-p\\big\\|_2=\\sqrt{n\\,\\mathrm{MSD}_1(\\hat p,p)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n$</span> 在无偏假设下的分布上界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器无偏，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(T_n(\\hat p)\\ge t\\big)\\le\\frac{K-1}{t^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：无偏性 + (A2) 独立性；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>（(A1)）保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\chi^2]$</span> 恒等式可用。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Markov 不等式与命题 17.9.4，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(T_n^2\\ge t^2\\big)=\\mathbb P\\big(n\\,\\mathrm{MSD}_1(\\hat p,p)\\ge t^2\\big)\\le\\frac{\\mathbb E[n\\,\\mathrm{MSD}_1(\\hat p,p)]}{t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>而无偏时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[n\\,\\mathrm{MSD}_1]=\\sum_i n\\cdot p_i(1-p_i)/n=\\sum_i(1-p_i)=K-1$</span>（由推论 17.9.2 逐项求和）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(T_n\\ge t)\\le(K-1)/t^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它给出<strong>单次观测即可拒绝无偏假设的阈值</strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\sqrt{(K-1)/\\alpha}$</span>，则无偏采样器满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n\\ge t$</span> 的概率不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>。若实测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n$</span> 超过此阈值，则以置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha$</span> 拒绝\"采样器无偏\"。这与第 14 节的卡方检验同源——事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 只差权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n^2=n\\sum_i(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\chi^2=\\sum_i n(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2/p_i$</span>。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 均匀时成比例，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 悬殊时给出不同的检验功效。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 17.9.11（偏差的可检测下界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若采样器有偏且偏差向量满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|b\\|_2=\\beta&gt;0$</span>，则当</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$n&gt;\\frac{K-1}{\\beta^2/4}$$</div>\n<p>时，以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n\\ge\\sqrt{K-1}$</span>，从而拒绝无偏假设。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p-p=( \\hat p-\\mathbb E\\hat p)+b$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p-p\\|_2\\ge\\|b\\|_2-\\|\\hat p-\\mathbb E\\hat p\\|_2$</span>。后者在无偏假设下的二阶矩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-1)/n$</span>（命题 17.9.10 证明中已算），由 Markov，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p-\\mathbb E\\hat p\\|_2\\ge\\beta/2$</span> 的概率不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4(K-1)/(n\\beta^2)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n&gt;(K-1)/(\\beta^2/4)$</span> 时此概率小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，故以至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p-p\\|_2\\ge\\beta/2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n\\ge\\sqrt{n}\\beta/2\\ge\\sqrt{K-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出<strong>样本量的设计准则</strong>：要检测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的偏差，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=\\Theta(K/\\beta^2)$</span> 次采样。这与命题 17.9.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{K/n})$</span> 上界互为对偶：前者说\"无偏时偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{K/n}$</span>\"，后者说\"有偏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\gtrsim K/\\beta^2$</span> 才能看见\"。两者共同刻画了采样偏差的<strong>统计分辨率极限</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-具体例子-稀有类别下的度量分歧\">具体例子：稀有类别下的度量分歧<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-具体例子-稀有类别下的度量分歧\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.97,0.01,0.01,0.01)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=10000$</span>，采样器无偏。由推论 17.9.2，稀有类别的标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.01\\cdot 0.99/10000}\\approx 9.95\\times10^{-4}$</span>，相对标准差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10\\%$</span>；而主类别的相对标准差仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.97\\cdot0.03/10000}/0.97\\approx 0.17\\%$</span>。由命题 17.9.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\chi^2]=3/10000=3\\times10^{-4}$</span>。若某次观测得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p=(0.9705,0.0095,0.0100,0.0100)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_1=\\frac{1}{4}\\big[(0.0005)^2+3(0.0005)^2\\big]\\approx 2.5\\times10^{-7}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}=0.001$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=\\frac{(0.0005)^2}{0.97}+3\\cdot\\frac{(0.0005)^2}{0.01}\\approx 7.5\\times10^{-5}$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 被稀有类别主导（三项各贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.5\\times10^{-5}$</span>，主类别仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2.6\\times10^{-7}$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_1$</span> 四项等权。这验证了命题 17.9.7 的夹逼：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}=0.001\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{7.5\\times10^{-5}}\\approx 0.0043$</span>，界成立但不紧——因为偏差集中在稀有类别，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 的转换损失了因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{K}$</span>。</p>\n<p>此例的教训是：<strong>度量选择必须匹配诊断目标</strong>。若要检测稀有类别的采样错误（如 Gumbel-Max 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 极小时的数值下溢），用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span>；若要检测整体分布偏移（如逆变换的累积误差），用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_1$</span>。第 14 节的卡方检验代码正是针对前者设计的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-与随机数消耗的接口\">与随机数消耗的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-与随机数消耗的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节定义了采样器的随机数消耗量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。本小节说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 如何进入偏差度量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17.9.12（随机数消耗与偏差的下界）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下，设采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S:\\Omega\\times[0,1]^m\\to[K]$</span> 的种子空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 维。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 无偏，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^m\\ge K$</span> 的必要条件（在种子为均匀离散化的情形下）；更一般地，若种子空间被离散化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个等概率原子，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(p^S,p)\\ge\\frac{1}{2}\\min_{i}\\Big|p_i-\\frac{M_i}{M}\\Big|$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_i$</span> 为映射到类别 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的原子数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i M_i=M$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^S_i=M_i/M$</span> 只能取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span> 的整数倍，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|p^S_i-p_i|$</span> 的下界由最近的可达值给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 是各坐标绝对差之和的一半，故不小于单个坐标绝对差的一半。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>离散化的随机数种子本身引入不可消除的偏差</strong>，其量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2M)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2^{32}$</span>（常见 PRNG 的周期）时偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span>，可忽略；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 很小（如并行采样中为节省随机数而复用种子）时，此偏差可能主导命题 17.9.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{K/n})$</span> 项。这正是第 10 节反例（伪随机数相关性导致偏差）的定量入口：相关性使有效 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 远小于名义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^m$</span>，从而放大此下界。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>采样偏差的度量必须区分三个层次：系统性偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_i=\\mathbb E[\\hat p_i]-p_i$</span>、采样方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)$</span>、分布距离（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span>）；命题 17.9.1 的分解恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\hat p_i-p_i)^2]=b_i^2+\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)$</span> 是三者关系的骨架，偏差不可由增加样本消除，方差可。</li>\n<li>无偏采样器满足三条可检验的定量基准：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)=p_i(1-p_i)/n$</span>（推论 17.9.2）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}]\\le\\frac12\\sum_i\\sqrt{p_i(1-p_i)/n}$</span>（命题 17.9.3）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\chi^2(\\hat p\\|p)]=(K-1)/n$</span>（命题 17.9.4）；后者不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的形状，是最强的诊断工具。</li>\n<li>有偏采样器的全变差距离有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_i|b_i|$</span>（命题 17.9.5），与无偏上界合并给出无偏性的可检验判据；重要性采样的偏差来源（提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 处过小导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/q_i$</span> 方差爆炸）正是此下界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 选择不当时的具体化，与第 6 节的方差公式衔接。</li>\n<li>无偏采样器满足三条可检验的定量基准：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)=p_i(1-p_i)/n$</span>（推论 17.9.2）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[d_{\\mathrm{TV}}]\\le\\frac12\\sum_i\\sqrt{p_i(1-p_i)/n}$</span>（命题 17.9.3）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\chi^2(\\hat p\\|p)]=(K-1)/n$</span>（命题 17.9.4）；后者不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的形状，是最强的诊断工具。命题 17.9.6–17.9.8 进一步建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSD}_w$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 三者的夹逼关系，说明均方偏差是最细的度量、卡方对稀有类别最敏感。</li>\n<li>有偏采样器的全变差距离有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_i|b_i|$</span>（命题 17.9.5），与无偏上界合并给出无偏性的可检验判据；命题 17.9.10–17.9.11 把此判据转化为单次观测的检验统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_n$</span> 与样本量设计准则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=\\Theta(K/\\beta^2)$</span>；命题 17.9.12 说明离散化种子引入的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2M)$</span> 偏差下界，与第 8 节的随机数消耗、第 10 节的伪随机数相关性反例衔接。重要性采样的偏差来源（提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 处过小导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/q_i$</span> 方差爆炸）正是此下界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 选择不当时的具体化，与第 6 节的方差公式衔接。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-反例-伪随机数相关性导致偏差\">反例：伪随机数相关性导致偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-反例-伪随机数相关性导致偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为其累积分布函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为逆变换采样映射（第 1 节）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立同分布，Gumbel-Max 采样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>（第 3 节）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 为理想均匀随机源。本节新引入如下符号并在此定义，后文不再重复：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}_{n\\ge 1}\\subset[0,1)$</span>：实际可获得的伪随机数序列，由确定性递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{n+1}=T(u_n)$</span> 生成，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T:[0,1)\\to[0,1)$</span> 为可测映射（典型情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为线性同余或移位寄存器递推）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N:=\\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^N\\delta_{u_n}$</span>：前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个伪随机数的经验测度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>：理想均匀测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}_N$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1,\\dots,u_N$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_i:=\\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^N\\mathbb 1\\{F^{-1}(u_n)\\in A_i\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个原子对应的区间，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i=(F_{i-1},F_i]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i=\\sum_{j\\le i}p_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_0=0$</span>。这是用伪随机数做逆变换采样得到的经验频率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设（H1）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为确定性映射，故整个序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}$</span> 由单个种子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1$</span> 决定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_1,\\dots,u_N)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1)^N$</span> 上不构成乘积测度下的独立样本。</p>\n<p><strong>假设（H2）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的轨道在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1)$</span> 上稠密（如许多线性同余生成器在模数取素数时满足），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N\\to\\mu$</span> 弱收敛。这是“看似正确”的常见辩护。</p>\n<p>本节的中心论点是：<strong>（H2）不能推出逆变换采样与 Gumbel-Max 采样的分布正确性</strong>，因为这两个采样器依赖的是有限维联合分布（单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的边际、或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个 Gumbel 的联合），而弱收敛只控制一维边际的极限，不控制有限样本下的相关性结构。下面给出三个层次的反例：逐条拆掉独立性假设、给出定量偏差估计、指出正确表述所需的补充条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-反例一-逆变换采样在相关伪随机数下的系统偏差\">反例一：逆变换采样在相关伪随机数下的系统偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-反例一-逆变换采样在相关伪随机数下的系统偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（逆变换采样的相关性偏差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=\\mathbb 1\\{u&gt;1/2\\}+1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\le 1/2$</span> 取原子 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;1/2$</span> 取原子 2）。设伪随机序列由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{n+1}=T(u_n)$</span> 生成，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 取如下分段线性映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T(u)=\\begin{cases}2u, &amp; 0\\le u&lt;1/2,\\\\ 2u-1, &amp; 1/2\\le u&lt;1.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为二进制移位映射（Bernoulli 移位）。取种子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1=1/3$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span> 的二进制展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.010101\\ldots_2$</span>，移位映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 恰好左移一位并丢弃整数位，故轨道为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_1=0.010101\\ldots_2,\\quad u_2=0.101010\\ldots_2,\\quad u_3=0.010101\\ldots_2,\\ \\ldots$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span> 之间严格二周期振荡。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p^{(N)}_1=\\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^N\\mathbb 1\\{u_n\\le 1/2\\}=\\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^N\\mathbb 1\\{n\\text{ 为奇数}\\}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 为偶数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_1=1/2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 为奇数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_1=(N+1)/(2N)=1/2+1/(2N)$</span>。特别地，对任意奇数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2N)&gt;0$</span>，且不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而消失到零以外的任何结构——事实上偏差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 振荡，永不精确为零。更关键的是，<strong>样本之间完全负相关</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1\\{u_n\\le 1/2\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1\\{u_{n+1}\\le 1/2\\}$</span> 恒为互补指示，相关系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>。若下游任务需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个独立样本（例如并行采样，见第 12 节），则用此序列生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个样本的联合分布集中在两个点上，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes M}$</span> 的支撑（<span class=\"math-inline\">$2^M$</span> 个点）相差极大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设</strong>：若把（H1）中的“确定性递推”换成“<span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_n)$</span> 为 i.i.d. <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>”，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_1$</span> 的偏差为零且方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1(1-p_1)/N$</span>。命题 1 表明，<strong>逆变换采样定理（第 1 节）的结论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span> 严格依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 这一分布假设，而非仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}$</span> 的一维边际弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span></strong>。事实上本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>（轨道稠密），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_1$</span> 不收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>（沿奇数子列收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，沿偶数子列恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，但有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 偏差非零且样本相关）。弱收敛只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm d\\mu_N\\to\\int f\\,\\mathrm d\\mu$</span> 对连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 成立，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1\\{u\\le 1/2\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1/2$</span> 处不连续；更本质的是，弱收敛是<strong>边际</strong>陈述，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_n,u_{n+1})$</span> 的联合分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-反例二-Gumbel-Max-在相关-Gumbel-变量下的偏差\">反例二：Gumbel-Max 在相关 Gumbel 变量下的偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-反例二-Gumbel-Max-在相关-Gumbel-变量下的偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Gumbel-Max 的相关性偏差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1,g_2$</span> 由同一伪随机源经逆变换生成：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>（理想），令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1=G^{-1}(u)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_2=G^{-1}(1-u)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 为 Gumbel 分布的分位函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}(v)=-\\log(-\\log v)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(g_1,g_2)$</span> 的联合分布不是两个独立 Gumbel 的乘积测度，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)=1\\big)=\\frac12,$$</div>\n<p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\text{选中 1 与选中 2 的指示变量相关})=1$</span>，即两次采样（若复用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>）完全反相关。更定量地，若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^{(m)}$</span> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(g_1^{(m)},g_2^{(m)})$</span>，则每对内部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_1^{(m)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_2^{(m)}$</span> 的协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(g_1,g_2)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\big(G^{-1}(u),G^{-1}(1-u)\\big)&lt;0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 严格单调递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto 1-u$</span> 严格单调递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}(u)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}(1-u)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的函数一增一减，由 Chebyshev 协方差不等式（对单调反向函数）得协方差非正；严格性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 严格单调且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto 1-u$</span> 非退化保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设</strong>：Gumbel-Max 定理（第 3 节）的证明关键步骤是：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(\\log p_i+g_i&gt;\\log p_j+g_j,\\ \\forall j\\ne i\\big)=\\int_{\\mathbb R}\\prod_{j\\ne i}F_{\\mathrm{Gumbel}}(\\log p_i-\\log p_j+t)\\,\\mathrm dF_{\\mathrm{Gumbel}}(t)=p_i,$$</div>\n<p>其中第二个等号用了<strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j$</span> 相互独立</strong>从而联合分布为乘积测度、可交换积分次序（Fubini，被积函数非负可测）。命题 2 表明，一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j$</span> 不独立，该乘积分解失效，即使每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_j$</span> 的一维边际仍是标准 Gumbel，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的分布也不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。这是“边际正确 + 联合错误”的典型失效模式，与命题 1 同构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-反例三-定量偏差估计与正确表述的补充条件\">反例三：定量偏差估计与正确表述的补充条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-反例三-定量偏差估计与正确表述的补充条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（相关性偏差的定量上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}$</span> 为任意伪随机序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_i$</span> 如符号表定义。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\hat p^{(N)}_i-p_i\\big|\\le \\mathrm{TV}\\big(\\mu_N,\\mu\\big)+\\sup_{u\\in[0,1]}\\big|\\mathbb 1\\{F^{-1}(u)\\in A_i\\}-\\mathbb 1\\{u\\in A_i\\}\\big|.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i$</span> 的边界处不连续（离散分布必然如此），第二项不消失，第一项（弱收敛速率）也不控制相关性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_i-p_i=\\int\\mathbb 1\\{F^{-1}(u)\\in A_i\\}\\,\\mathrm d\\mu_N(u)-\\int\\mathbb 1\\{u\\in A_i\\}\\,\\mathrm d\\mu(u)$</span>。插入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\int\\mathbb 1\\{u\\in A_i\\}\\,\\mathrm d\\mu_N(u)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p^{(N)}_i-p_i=\\int\\big(\\mathbb 1\\{F^{-1}(u)\\in A_i\\}-\\mathbb 1\\{u\\in A_i\\}\\big)\\,\\mathrm d\\mu_N(u)+\\Big(\\int\\mathbb 1\\{u\\in A_i\\}\\,\\mathrm d\\mu_N-\\int\\mathbb 1\\{u\\in A_i\\}\\,\\mathrm d\\mu\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>第一项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_u|\\cdot|$</span> 控制（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N$</span> 为概率测度），第二项被全变差距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(\\mu_N,\\mu)=\\sup_{B\\text{ 可测}}|\\mu_N(B)-\\mu(B)|$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述所需的补充条件</strong>：逆变换采样与 Gumbel-Max 采样的正确性需要<strong>有限维联合分布</strong>的正确性，而非一维边际的弱收敛。具体地：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>逆变换采样要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_1,\\dots,u_M)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1)^M$</span> 上服从乘积测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{\\otimes M}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为下游所需的样本数），这等价于要求伪随机源通过统计独立性检验（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 维均匀性检验），而非仅通过一维均匀性检验。</li>\n<li>Gumbel-Max 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(g_1,\\dots,g_K)$</span> 相互独立，这要求生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个 Gumbel 变量时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个<strong>独立</strong>的均匀随机数（或经可证明保持独立性的变换），不得复用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 做反演。</li>\n<li>若伪随机源仅满足弱收敛（H2），则只能保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时<strong>边际</strong>频率的极限正确，不能保证有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下的偏差、方差、以及多变量联合分布的正确性。工程上的补救是：使用通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 维均匀性检验的生成器（如 PCG、Philox 等具有可证明多维等分布性质的构造），并在并行采样时为每个流分配独立种子（见第 12 节）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>边界情形</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 退化（某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1$</span>），则逆变换采样恒取该原子，任何伪随机数都给出正确结果，相关性偏差为零。这说明偏差的严重程度与分布的支撑大小正相关：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 越大，对联合独立性的要求越高。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>逆变换采样定理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span> 与 Gumbel-Max 定理的证明都依赖<strong>有限维联合分布</strong>的正确性：前者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，后者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 相互独立。一维边际的弱收敛（H2）不能替代这两条假设，命题 1 与命题 2 分别给出了逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 在相关伪随机数下的失效构造。</li>\n<li>偏差的定量上界由命题 3 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\hat p^{(N)}_i-p_i\\big|\\le \\mathrm{TV}(\\mu_N,\\mu)+\\sup_u|\\mathbb 1\\{F^{-1}(u)\\in A_i\\}-\\mathbb 1\\{u\\in A_i\\}|$</span>。离散分布下第二项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在原子边界不连续而不消失，故仅靠弱收敛不能控制采样偏差。</li>\n<li>正确表述需补充的条件是：伪随机源须通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 维均匀性检验（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 为下游所需样本数），Gumbel-Max 须用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立均匀随机数生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个 Gumbel 变量，并行采样须为每个流分配独立种子（衔接第 12 节）。退化分布（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1$</span>）是偏差为零的边界情形。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-反例四-线性同余生成器的低位相关性如何污染别名法\">反例四：线性同余生成器的低位相关性如何污染别名法<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-反例四-线性同余生成器的低位相关性如何污染别名法\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与命题 2 处理的是逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 两条路径。别名法（第 2 节）虽在算法结构上不同于逆变换，却同样依赖单个均匀随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的<strong>位级</strong>均匀性，因此对伪随机源的低位相关性更为敏感。下面给出一个可精确计算的边界情形。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（别名法的低位相关性偏差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/4,1/4,1/4,1/4)$</span>。别名法对等概率分布退化为：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=\\lfloor 4u\\rfloor+1$</span>，即用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的最高两位二进制位选原子。设伪随机源为线性同余生成器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{n+1}=(a u_n+c)\\bmod m$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2^{32}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1103515245$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=12345$</span>（典型 ANSI C 参数），种子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1=1$</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_n\\leftarrow u_n/m\\in[0,1)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p^{(N)}_i=\\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^N\\mathbb 1\\{\\lfloor 4u_n\\rfloor=i-1\\}$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span> 的偏差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_n$</span> 的最高两位的联合分布决定，而该联合分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 较小时并不等于乘积测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：线性同余递推模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{32}$</span> 的轨道是确定的周期序列，周期至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{32}$</span>。对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ll 2^{32}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}_{n=1}^N$</span> 是轨道的一段前缀，其经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>。关键在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lfloor 4u_n\\rfloor$</span> 只读取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_n$</span> 的最高两位，而 LCG 的高位与低位的统计性质差异极大——低位周期短、相关性结构强，高位相对较好，但<strong>没有任何 LCG 参数能保证任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下最高两位的经验频率精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span></strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span> 并显式计算前四个值即可看到偏差：由递推，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2=(1103515245+12345)\\bmod 2^{32}=1103527590$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_3=(1103515245\\cdot 1103527590+12345)\\bmod 2^{32}$</span>，数值计算给出前四个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_n/m$</span> 的最高两位并非均匀覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,1,2,3\\}$</span> 各一次。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设</strong>：若把 LCG 换成理想 i.i.d. 均匀源，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p^{(N)}_i]=1/4$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_i-1/4$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/4)(3/4)/N$</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 收敛。命题 4 表明，别名法（以及任何按位读取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的采样器）的正确性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的<strong>位级联合分布</strong>，而非仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的一维边际。这与命题 1 的结论同构，但失效机制不同：命题 1 是样本间的时序相关，命题 4 是单个样本内部的位间相关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-5-相关性偏差的可加分解\">命题 5：相关性偏差的可加分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-5-相关性偏差的可加分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前三个反例分别展示了时序相关（命题 1）、变量间相关（命题 2）、位间相关（命题 4）三种失效模式。它们可以被统一为一个可加分解，这为工程上的诊断提供了定量工具。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（偏差的方差分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_i$</span> 为任意采样器（逆变换、别名法或 Gumbel-Max）在伪随机序列下的经验频率，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 为目标概率。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}$</span> 为严平稳遍历序列（LCG 满足此条，因其轨道为确定性周期序列，在周期内遍历），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\hat p^{(N)}_i\\big)=\\frac{\\sigma_i^2}{N}\\Big(1+2\\sum_{k=1}^{N-1}\\Big(1-\\frac{k}{N}\\Big)\\rho_i(k)\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_i^2=p_i(1-p_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i(k)=\\mathrm{Corr}\\big(\\mathbb 1\\{X_1\\in A_i\\},\\mathbb 1\\{X_{1+k}\\in A_i\\}\\big)$</span> 为滞后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的自相关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n=F^{-1}(u_n)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：这是严平稳序列样本均值方差的经典分解。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{(N)}_i-p_i=\\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^N(\\mathbb 1\\{X_n\\in A_i\\}-p_i)$</span>，展开平方期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\hat p^{(N)}_i\\big)=\\frac1{N^2}\\sum_{n,m=1}^N\\mathrm{Cov}\\big(\\mathbb 1\\{X_n\\in A_i\\},\\mathbb 1\\{X_m\\in A_i\\}\\big).$$</div>\n<p>由严平稳性，协方差只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|n-m|$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=|n-m|$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|n-m|=k$</span> 的有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n,m)$</span> 个数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(N-k)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}=\\sigma_i^2\\rho_i(k)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（偏差不可由边际修正）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i(k)$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 衰减（如命题 1 的二周期轨道，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i(1)=-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i(2)=1$</span>，周期为 2），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p^{(N)}_i)$</span> 不按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 衰减。具体地，对命题 1 的轨道，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i(k)=(-1)^k$</span>，代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\hat p^{(N)}_i\\big)=\\frac{\\sigma_i^2}{N}\\Big(1+2\\sum_{k=1}^{N-1}\\Big(1-\\frac{k}{N}\\Big)(-1)^k\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>对偶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，括号内和式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（可逐项验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=1}^{N-1}(1-k/N)(-1)^k=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 偶），故方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_i^2/N$</span>，与 i.i.d. 情形相同；但对奇数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，和式非零，方差偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_i^2/N$</span>。这说明<strong>方差本身也依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的奇偶性</strong>，是相关性污染的直接体现。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述所需的补充条件（加强版）</strong>：命题 5 表明，采样偏差的正确控制需要三条独立条件同时成立：(a) 一维边际正确（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p^{(N)}_i]=p_i$</span>）；(b) 自相关 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i(k)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 足够快衰减（保证方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 收敛）；(c) 有限维联合分布正确（保证下游多变量任务，如并行采样与无放回采样，不失效）。命题 1 违反 (b)，命题 2 违反 (c)，命题 4 违反 (a) 的位级版本。工程上的诊断应分别检验这三条，而非只做一维卡方检验（衔接第 14 节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-边界情形-相关性偏差何时为零\">边界情形：相关性偏差何时为零<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-边界情形-相关性偏差何时为零\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个精确的边界刻画，说明在什么条件下伪随机数相关性<strong>不</strong>导致偏差。这既是对前四个反例的对照，也为第 12 节并行采样的独立性条件提供理论接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（零偏差的充分条件）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：设采样器为逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span>，目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。若伪随机序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{u_n\\}$</span> 满足：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\le K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_{n_1},\\dots,u_{n_M})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1)^M$</span> 上服从乘积测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{\\otimes M}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 维均匀性），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p^{(N)}_i]=p_i$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p^{(N)}_i)=p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 维均匀性蕴含一维均匀性，故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u_n)\\sim p$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p^{(N)}_i]=p_i$</span>。对方差，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\mathbb 1\\{X_n\\in A_i\\},\\mathbb 1\\{X_m\\in A_i\\})=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ne m$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2$</span> 维均匀性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_n,u_m)$</span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^{\\otimes 2}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 为可测映射，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_n,X_m)=(F^{-1}(u_n),F^{-1}(u_m))$</span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes 2}$</span>，两个指示变量独立，协方差为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界情形的精确刻画</strong>：命题 6 的条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\le K$</span> 是必要的，不能放宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span>。命题 1 的轨道满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span> 维均匀性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>），但违反 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2$</span> 维均匀性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$(u_n,u_{n+1})$</span> 集中在两个点上），故方差偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span>。命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(g_1,g_2)$</span> 由单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 反演得到，违反 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2$</span> 维均匀性，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的分布虽边际正确但联合错误。命题 4 的 LCG 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 较小时违反最高两位的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2$</span> 维均匀性。三条反例统一在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge 2$</span> 维均匀性失效”这一框架下。<strong>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span>（退化分布）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\le K$</span> 只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=1$</span>，命题 6 退化为“一维均匀性即足够”，与本节小结第 3 条的边界情形一致。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-无放回采样\">无放回采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-无放回采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_n)$</span> 为有限支撑上的概率向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^n p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立，其 CDF 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_G(x)=e^{-e^{-x}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。本节新引入如下符号，先给出定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（无放回采样）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 上的概率向量。一个<strong>无放回采样序列</strong>是随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le k\\le n$</span>，取值于有序无重复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>-元组集合\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Omega_{n,k}=\\{(i_1,\\dots,i_k): i_j\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\},\\ i_j\\neq i_\\ell\\ (j\\neq\\ell)\\},$$</div>\n满足对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i_1,\\dots,i_k)\\in\\Omega_{n,k}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I_1=i_1,\\dots,I_k=i_k)=\\prod_{j=1}^{k}\\frac{p_{i_j}}{1-\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{j-1}p_{i_\\ell}}.\n\\tag{11.1}$$</div>\n右端分母在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span> 时约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。该分布称为<strong>逐次条件化分布</strong>（successive conditioning distribution），记作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seq}(p,k)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：有放回采样（本章第 1–3 节处理的 i.i.d. 采样）的样本空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,n\\}^k$</span>，允许重复，联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_j p_{i_j}$</span>；无放回采样的样本空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_{n,k}$</span>，联合分布按式 (11.1) 逐次条件化。二者的边缘分布不同：无放回时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_2$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I_2=i)=p_i(1-\\frac{p_i}{1-p_{I_1}})$</span> 的平均，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。另一个相邻概念是<strong>子集采样</strong>：只关心无序子集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{I_1,\\dots,I_k\\}$</span> 的分布，其概率为式 (11.1) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k!$</span> 个排列求和。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条列出并在用到时指明。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$n&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立。此假设保证式 (11.1) 的每个分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;j}p_{i_\\ell}\\ge p_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}=\\min_i p_i$</span>，从而联合概率有定义且非零。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可测性</strong>：随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_j$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 且 Borel 可测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 且 Borel 可测。有限支撑情形下离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数自动满足，无需额外验证。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 独立性</strong>：构造无放回序列时使用的随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{U_j\\}_{j=1}^k$</span> 相互独立且各自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>。此假设在算法正确性证明中不可省，反例节将说明相关性如何破坏式 (11.1)。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 可积性</strong>：本节出现的期望均为有限和，自动可积，无需 Dominated Convergence；唯一涉及极限的是命题 11.3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\to n$</span> 的退化情形，此时用有限性直接计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-11-1-逐次逆变换构造及其正确性\">11.1 逐次逆变换构造及其正确性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-11-1-逐次逆变换构造及其正确性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11.1（逐次逆变换构造）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。<strong>陈述</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,\\dots,U_k$</span> 独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_1=\\min\\{i: U_1\\le \\textstyle\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{i}p_\\ell\\},\n\\qquad\nI_j=\\min\\{i: U_j\\le \\textstyle\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{i}\\frac{p_\\ell}{1-\\sum_{m=1}^{j-1}p_{I_m}}\\},\n\\quad j\\ge 2,\n\\tag{11.2}$$</div>\n其中求和按固定指标顺序 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,n$</span> 进行，分母中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_m$</span> 由前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j-1$</span> 步已确定。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)\\sim\\mathrm{Seq}(p,k)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 作归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时，式 (11.2) 即本章第 1 节的逆变换采样，由逆变换定理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I_1=i)=p_i$</span>。</p>\n<p>设前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j-1$</span> 步的联合分布由式 (11.1) 给出。在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1=i_1,\\dots,I_{j-1}=i_{j-1}$</span> 的条件下，剩余质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{i_m}$</span> 按比例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\ell/(1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{i_m})$</span> 分配给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\notin\\{i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1}\\}$</span>，对已用指标分配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。式 (11.2) 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 步是在这 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个累积概率上做逆变换，由逆变换定理，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I_j=i\\mid I_1=i_1,\\dots,I_{j-1}=i_{j-1})=\\frac{p_i}{1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{i_m}}\\quad (i\\notin\\{i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1}\\}),$$</div>\n且对已用指标概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。乘以条件概率的链式法则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I_1=i_1,\\dots,I_j=i_j)=\\mathbb P(I_1=i_1,\\dots,I_{j-1}=i_{j-1})\\cdot\\mathbb P(I_j=i_j\\mid I_1=i_1,\\dots,I_{j-1}=i_{j-1}),$$</div>\n即得式 (11.1) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 成立。归纳完成。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.2（边缘分布与包含概率）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 11.1。<strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in\\{1,\\dots,k\\}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(i\\in\\{I_1,\\dots,I_j\\})=1-\\prod_{m=0}^{j-1}\\Bigl(1-\\frac{p_i}{1-\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{m}p_{I_\\ell}^{(\\mathrm{cond})}}\\Bigr),\n\\tag{11.3}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{I_\\ell}^{(\\mathrm{cond})}$</span> 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 步条件分布下已选指标的质量；特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=n$</span> 时包含概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I_1,\\dots,I_n\\}=\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 几乎必然。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 未被前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 步选中的事件等价于每一步都在条件分布下避开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>。由命题 11.1 的构造，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 步避开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的条件概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_i/(1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;m}p_{I_\\ell})$</span>，各步条件独立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_m$</span> 独立），故未包含概率为乘积，取补即得式 (11.3)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=n$</span> 时剩余质量趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，乘积中至少一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（当仅剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 时），故包含概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 11.1（具体验证）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>。按式 (11.1) 计算全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times 2=6$</span> 个有序二元组的概率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,2)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{1/3}{1-1/2}=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac23=\\frac13$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,3)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{1/6}{1/2}=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac13=\\frac16$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(2,1)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac13\\cdot\\frac{1/2}{1-1/3}=\\frac13\\cdot\\frac34=\\frac14$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(2,3)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac13\\cdot\\frac{1/6}{2/3}=\\frac13\\cdot\\frac14=\\frac1{12}$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(3,1)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac16\\cdot\\frac{1/2}{1-1/6}=\\frac16\\cdot\\frac35=\\frac1{10}$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(3,2)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac16\\cdot\\frac{1/3}{5/6}=\\frac16\\cdot\\frac25=\\frac1{15}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>校验总和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac13+\\frac16+\\frac14+\\frac1{12}+\\frac1{10}+\\frac1{15}=\\frac{20+10+15+5+6+4}{60}=\\frac{60}{60}=1$</span>。与式 (11.1) 一致，验证了命题 11.1 的构造在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span> 时的正确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-11-2-Gumbel-Max-的无放回推广\">11.2 Gumbel-Max 的无放回推广<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-11-2-Gumbel-Max-的无放回推广\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节给出无放回采样的第二种等价构造，它把第 3 节的 Gumbel-Max 定理逐次使用，并给出一个可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.3（逐次 Gumbel-Max 构造）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{g_i^{(j)}\\}_{i=1}^n$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,k$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 也独立。<strong>陈述</strong>：定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_j=\\arg\\max_{i\\notin\\{I_1,\\dots,I_{j-1}\\}}\\bigl(\\log p_i+g_i^{(j)}\\bigr),\\quad j=1,\\dots,k,\n\\tag{11.4}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 在并列时按最小指标取。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)\\sim\\mathrm{Seq}(p,k)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i^{(1)})$</span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1=i_1$</span> 后，式 (11.4) 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 步在剩余指标集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,n\\}\\setminus\\{i_1\\}$</span> 上做 Gumbel-Max，其隐含概率向量为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_i=\\frac{p_i}{\\sum_{\\ell\\neq i_1}p_\\ell}=\\frac{p_i}{1-p_{i_1}},\\quad i\\neq i_1.$$</div>\n由 Gumbel-Max 定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I_2=i\\mid I_1=i_1)=\\tilde p_i=p_i/(1-p_{i_1})$</span>，与式 (11.1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=2$</span> 项一致。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ge 2$</span> 重复同一论证：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 步的隐含概率向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/(1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{I_m})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 取遍剩余指标。由链式法则即得式 (11.1)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.4（无放回 Gumbel-Max 的排序恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 11.3。<strong>陈述</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i+g_i^{(1)}$</span> 降序排列的指标置换（并列按最小指标），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个分量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)$</span> 同分布；且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{I_1,\\dots,I_k\\}=S\\bigr)=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(S)}\\prod_{j=1}^{k}\\frac{p_{\\sigma(j)}}{1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;j}p_{\\sigma(\\ell)}},\n\\tag{11.5}$$</div>\n右端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k!$</span> 个排列求和。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：式 (11.4) 的第一步与排序 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的首位一致；归纳地，给定前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j-1$</span> 个已选指标，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 步在剩余集上取 Gumbel-Max，恰为排序 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 位。故前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 位与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)$</span> 同分布。对固定子集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>，事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I_1,\\dots,I_k\\}=S$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k!$</span> 个互斥有序事件之并，每个有序事件概率由式 (11.1) 给出，求和即式 (11.5)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 11.1（与有放回 Gumbel-Max 的差别）</strong>：有放回时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 单次即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，重复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 次需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 组独立 Gumbel；无放回时式 (11.4) 同样需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 组独立 Gumbel，但每组的可行指标集随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 收缩。二者随机数消耗相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$nk$</span> 个 Gumbel），但无放回的样本空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_{n,k}$</span>，其大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n!/(n-k)!$</span>，而有放回为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^k$</span>。这一差别在第 8 节“采样的随机数消耗”中已从信息量角度讨论，本节只强调构造上的等价性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-11-3-系统采样的无放回解释\">11.3 系统采样的无放回解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-11-3-系统采样的无放回解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节已建立系统采样：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\min\\{i: U\\le\\sum_{\\ell\\le i}p_\\ell\\}$</span>，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U+m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=0,\\dots,k-1$</span>，重复逆变换。系统采样通常用于<strong>有放回</strong>的等概率抽样；本节指出它在无放回情形下的一个精确接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.5（系统采样在均匀分布下的循环结构）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1/n$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立。<strong>陈述</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_m=\\Bigl\\lfloor n\\bigl(U+\\tfrac{m}{n}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\rfloor+1,\\quad m=0,\\dots,k-1,\n\\tag{11.6}$$</div>\n并约定指标按模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 取入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_m\\equiv I_0+m\\pmod n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_0$</span> 均匀于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le n$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_0,\\dots,I_{k-1})$</span> 互异，但其联合分布是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个循环移位上的均匀分布（每个概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span>），<strong>不是</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_{n,k}$</span> 上的均匀无放回分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lfloor n(U+m/n)\\rfloor=\\lfloor nU\\rfloor+m$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_m=\\lfloor nU\\rfloor+1+m$</span>，模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_0+m$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$nU$</span> 均匀于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,n)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lfloor nU\\rfloor$</span> 均匀于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,\\dots,n-1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_0$</span> 均匀。<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\le n$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0,\\dots,k-1$</span> 模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 互异，样本互异。对任意有序元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i_0,\\dots,i_{k-1})$</span>，事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I_m=i_m,\\forall m\\}$</span> 当且仅当该元组是某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i_0$</span> 的循环移位且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\in[(i_0-1)/n,i_0/n)$</span>，概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span>；其余元组概率为零。而均匀无放回分布给每个有序元组概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/[n(n-1)\\cdots(n-k+1)]$</span>，二者不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 11.2</strong>：命题 11.5 的说明系统采样<strong>不能</strong>直接用于无放回均匀采样；无放回均匀采样需用命题 11.1 的逐次逆变换（此时每步条件分布为剩余指标上的均匀），或命题 11.3 的逐次 Gumbel-Max。这一接口在第 15 节“与截断采样章的接口”中还会以截断分布的形式出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-11-4-无放回采样的期望与方差恒等式\">11.4 无放回采样的期望与方差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-11-4-无放回采样的期望与方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11.6（指示变量的协方差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3)。<strong>陈述</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)\\sim\\mathrm{Seq}(p,k)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in\\{1,\\dots,k\\}$</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{j,i}=\\mathbb 1_{I_j=i}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[X_{j,i}]=\\mathbb P(I_j=i)=p_i\\Bigl(1-\\sum_{m=1}^{j-1}\\mathbb E\\Bigl[\\frac{\\mathbb 1_{I_m=i}}{1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;m}p_{I_\\ell}}\\Bigr]\\Bigr),\n\\tag{11.8}$$</div>\n且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq i'$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(X_{j,i},X_{j,i'})=-\\mathbb E[X_{j,i}]\\mathbb E[X_{j,i'}]\\le 0.\n\\tag{11.9}$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>：式 (11.8) 由全期望公式与式 (11.1) 的条件概率直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I_j=i)=\\mathbb E[\\mathbb P(I_j=i\\mid I_1,\\dots,I_{j-1})]=\\mathbb E[p_i\\mathbb 1_{i\\notin\\{I_1,\\dots,I_{j-1}\\}}/(1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;j}p_{I_\\ell})]$</span>，展开即式 (11.8)。式 (11.9) 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{j,i}X_{j,i'}=0$</span>（同一位置不能同时取两个不同指标），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_{j,i}X_{j,i'}]=0$</span>，协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E[X_{j,i}]\\mathbb E[X_{j,i'}]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 的退化）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 11.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span>。<strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j=1}^{n}X_{j,i}=1$</span> 几乎必然，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\mathbb E[X_{j,i}]=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\mathrm{Cov}(X_{j,i},X_{j,i'})=-\\mathbb E[X_{1,i}]\\mathbb E[X_{1,i'}]$</span> 的一般形式不再成立，需用多项分布协方差公式。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I_1,\\dots,I_n\\}=\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>（推论 11.2），故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 恰出现一次。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 11.2（数值验证）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>。由例 11.1 的六项概率计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_{1,1}]=\\mathbb P(I_1=1)=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[X_{2,1}]=\\mathbb P(I_2=1)=1/4+1/10=7/20$</span>。式 (11.8) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1(1-\\mathbb E[\\mathbb 1_{I_1=1}/(1-p_{I_1})])=1/2\\cdot(1-\\mathbb P(I_1=1)/(1-1/2))=1/2\\cdot(1-1)=0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7/20$</span> 不符，说明式 (11.8) 的右端展开有误：分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;m}p_{I_\\ell}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1=1$</span> 时分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_1\\neq 1$</span> 时分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_{I_1}$</span>，需分情形计算。正确计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I_2=1)=\\mathbb P(I_1=2)\\cdot\\frac{p_1}{1-p_2}+\\mathbb P(I_1=3)\\cdot\\frac{p_1}{1-p_3}=\\frac13\\cdot\\frac{1/2}{2/3}+\\frac16\\cdot\\frac{1/2}{5/6}=\\frac14+\\frac1{10}=\\frac7{20}$</span>，与例 11.1 一致。式 (11.8) 应理解为条件期望的展开，其右端需保留条件结构，不能简单写成边缘期望的乘积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 11.3</strong>：式 (11.8) 的正确闭合形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I_j=i)=\\sum_{(i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1})\\in\\Omega_{n,j-1}}\\Bigl(\\prod_{m=1}^{j-1}\\frac{p_{i_m}}{1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;m}p_{i_\\ell}}\\Bigr)\\cdot\\frac{p_i\\mathbb 1_{i\\notin\\{i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1}\\}}}{1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{i_m}},\n\\tag{11.10}$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j-1$</span> 个有序无重复元组求和。这是有限和，无需交换极限。式 (11.10) 是式 (11.8) 的显式展开，二者等价。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-11-5-代码验证-逐次逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-的无放回等价性\">11.5 代码验证：逐次逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 的无放回等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-11-5-代码验证-逐次逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-的无放回等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现命题 11.1 与命题 11.3 两种构造，并在小规模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n,k$</span> 上做卡方检验，验证二者同分布且与式 (11.1) 一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom itertools import permutations\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240517)\n\ndef seq_inverse(p, k, rng):\n    n = len(p)\n    chosen = []\n    avail = np.ones(n, dtype=bool)\n    for _ in range(k):\n        w = np.where(avail, p, 0.0)\n        w = w / w.sum()\n        u = rng.random()\n        c = np.cumsum(w)\n        i = int(np.searchsorted(c, u, side='right'))\n        i = min(i, n - 1)\n        assert avail[i], &quot;selected an already used index&quot;\n        chosen.append(i)\n        avail[i] = False\n    return tuple(chosen)\n\ndef seq_gumbel(p, k, rng):\n    n = len(p)\n    chosen = []\n    avail = np.ones(n, dtype=bool)\n    logp = np.log(p)\n    for _ in range(k):\n        g = rng.gumbel(size=n)\n        score = np.where(avail, logp + g, -np.inf)\n        i = int(np.argmax(score))\n        assert avail[i]\n        chosen.append(i)\n        avail[i] = False\n    return tuple(chosen)\n\ndef exact_prob(p, seq):\n    prob = 1.0\n    used_mass = 0.0\n    for i in seq:\n        prob *= p[i] / (1.0 - used_mass)\n        used_mass += p[i]\n    return prob\n\np = np.array([0.5, 1/3, 1/6])\nn, k = 3, 2\nsupport = list(permutations(range(n), k))\nexact = {s: exact_prob(p, s) for s in support}\nassert abs(sum(exact.values()) - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\nN = 200000\nc1 = Counter(seq_inverse(p, k, rng) for _ in range(N))\nc2 = Counter(seq_gumbel(p, k, rng) for _ in range(N))\n\ndef chi2(counter, exact, N):\n    stat = 0.0\n    for s, pr in exact.items():\n        obs = counter.get(s, 0)\n        exp = N * pr\n        stat += (obs - exp) ** 2 / exp\n    return stat\n\nchi1 = chi2(c1, exact, N)\nchi2v = chi2(c2, exact, N)\n# 自由度 = 6 - 1 = 5，卡方 0.99 分位数约 15.09\nassert chi1 &lt; 20.0, chi1\nassert chi2v &lt; 20.0, chi2v\nprint(&quot;support size:&quot;, len(support))\nprint(&quot;exact probs:&quot;, {s: round(v, 4) for s, v in exact.items()})\nprint(&quot;chi2 inverse:&quot;, round(chi1, 3), &quot;chi2 gumbel:&quot;, round(chi2v, 3))\nprint(&quot;expected: both &lt; 20.0 at N=200000, df=5&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>support size: 6</code>；<code>exact probs</code> 与例 11.1 的六项一致（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3333,0.1667,0.25,0.0833,0.1,0.0667$</span>）；两个卡方统计量均小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$20$</span>（自由度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.99$</span> 分位数约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$15.09$</span>，留有余量）。<code>assert</code> 全部通过，说明两种构造同分布且与式 (11.1) 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>无放回采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seq}(p,k)$</span> 由式 (11.1) 的逐次条件化分布定义，其样本空间为有序无重复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>-元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_{n,k}$</span>；逐次逆变换构造（命题 11.1）与逐次 Gumbel-Max 构造（命题 11.3）均精确产生该分布，证明用链式法则与 Gumbel-Max 定理逐次应用。</li>\n<li>无放回 Gumbel-Max 的排序恒等式（推论 11.4）给出子集概率的显式有限和（式 (11.5)），并说明有放回与无放回在随机数消耗相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$nk$</span> 个 Gumbel）而样本空间大小不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n^k$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n!/(n-k)!$</span>）。</li>\n<li>系统采样在均匀情形下产生循环移位样本而非无放回均匀样本（命题 11.5 的修正），故无放回均匀采样必须用逐次逆变换或逐次 Gumbel-Max；指示变量的协方差恒等式（命题 11.6）给出边缘概率的显式有限和（式 (11.10)），代码验证两种构造同分布并通过卡方检验。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-11-6-无放回采样的方差缩减恒等式与-Horvitz-Thompson-估计\">11.6 无放回采样的方差缩减恒等式与 Horvitz–Thompson 估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-11-6-无放回采样的方差缩减恒等式与-Horvitz-Thompson-估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的协方差恒等式（命题 11.6）刻画了指示变量之间的负相关。本节把它推进为一个可检验的方差恒等式，并给出无放回采样在估计量上的直接后果。这一小节只使用已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)\\sim\\mathrm{Seq}(p,k)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{j,i}=\\mathbb 1_{I_j=i}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（包含指示与样本均值）</strong>：对固定指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，定义<strong>包含指示</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\sum_{j=1}^{k}X_{j,i}\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{I_1,\\dots,I_k\\}$</span>。定义<strong>样本均值泛函</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu=\\frac1k\\sum_{j=1}^{k}f(I_j)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为任意实值函数（有限支撑，自动可积）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.8（包含概率的显式公式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3)。<strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)=\\sum_{j=1}^{k}\\mathbb P(I_j=i)=\\sum_{j=1}^{k}\\ \\sum_{(i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1})\\in\\Omega_{n,j-1}}\\Bigl(\\prod_{m=1}^{j-1}\\frac{p_{i_m}}{1-\\sum_{\\ell&lt;m}p_{i_\\ell}}\\Bigr)\\frac{p_i\\,\\mathbb 1_{i\\notin\\{i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1}\\}}}{1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{i_m}},\n\\tag{11.11}$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\sum_j X_{j,i}$</span>，由期望线性性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)=\\sum_j\\mathbb P(I_j=i)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Z_i]=\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)$</span>）。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(I_j=i)$</span> 由式 (11.10) 给出，代入即得式 (11.11)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 时由推论 11.2 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{I_1,\\dots,I_n\\}=\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 几乎必然，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=1$</span> 几乎必然。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 11.4（与有放回的对比）</strong>：有放回时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i\\sim\\mathrm{Binomial}(k,p_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Z_i]=kp_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(Z_i)=kp_i(1-p_i)$</span>。无放回时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(Z_i)=\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)(1-\\mathbb P(Z_i=1))$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 时无放回方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，有放回方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$np_i(1-p_i)&gt;0$</span>。这正是无放回采样方差缩减的来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.9（样本均值的方差恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为实值函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i f(i)=0$</span>（中心化，不失一般性）。<strong>陈述</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_p^2=\\sum_i p_i f(i)^2$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu)=\\frac{\\sigma_p^2}{k}\\Bigl(1-\\frac{k-1}{n-1}\\Bigr)+\\frac{1}{k^2}\\sum_{i\\neq i'}f(i)f(i')\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(Z_i,Z_{i'}),\n\\tag{11.12}$$</div>\n其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(Z_i,Z_{i'})=\\mathbb P(Z_i=1,Z_{i'}=1)-\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)\\mathbb P(Z_{i'}=1),\n\\tag{11.13}$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_i=1,Z_{i'}=1)=\\sum_{j\\neq j'}\\mathbb P(I_j=i,I_{j'}=i')$</span> 由式 (11.1) 的二维边缘给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu=\\frac1k\\sum_j f(I_j)=\\frac1k\\sum_i f(i)Z_i$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu)=\\frac{1}{k^2}\\sum_{i,i'}f(i)f(i')\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(Z_i,Z_{i'}).$$</div>\n把求和拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=i'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq i'$</span> 两部分。对角项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(Z_i,Z_i)=\\mathrm{Var}(Z_i)=\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)(1-\\mathbb P(Z_i=1))$</span>。非对角项由式 (11.13) 给出。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)$</span> 用式 (11.11) 代入，即得式 (11.12)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.10（有限总体修正因子的精确形式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 11.9，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1/n$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（均匀总体）。<strong>陈述</strong>：此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{k}\\cdot\\frac{n-k}{n-1},\\qquad \\sigma^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n f(i)^2,\n\\tag{11.14}$$</div>\n即经典的有限总体修正因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n-k)/(n-1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：均匀情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)=k/n$</span>（由对称性，每个指标被选中的概率相同，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)=k$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq i'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(Z_i=1,Z_{i'}=1)=\\frac{k(k-1)}{n(n-1)}$</span>（有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,i')$</span> 同时被选中的概率，由式 (11.7) 的对称性）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(Z_i,Z_{i'})=\\frac{k(k-1)}{n(n-1)}-\\frac{k^2}{n^2}=\\frac{k(k-n)}{n^2(n-1)}.$$</div>\n对角项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(Z_i)=\\frac{k}{n}(1-\\frac{k}{n})=\\frac{k(n-k)}{n^2}$</span>。代入式 (11.12)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu)=\\frac{1}{k^2}\\Bigl[n\\cdot\\frac{k(n-k)}{n^2}\\sigma^2+\\sum_{i\\neq i'}f(i)f(i')\\frac{k(k-n)}{n^2(n-1)}\\Bigr].$$</div>\n利用中心化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i f(i)=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\neq i'}f(i)f(i')=-n\\sigma^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i,i'}f(i)f(i')=0$</span>）。代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu)=\\frac{1}{k^2}\\Bigl[\\frac{k(n-k)}{n}\\sigma^2-n\\sigma^2\\cdot\\frac{k(k-n)}{n^2(n-1)}\\Bigr]=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{k}\\cdot\\frac{n-k}{n-1}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 11.3（数值验证）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(i)=i-\\mathbb E_p[i]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[i]=\\frac12\\cdot1+\\frac13\\cdot2+\\frac16\\cdot3=\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{5}{3}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=( -2/3,1/3,4/3)$</span>。中心化成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i f(i)=\\frac12(-\\frac23)+\\frac13\\cdot\\frac13+\\frac16\\cdot\\frac43=-\\frac13+\\frac19+\\frac29=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_p^2=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac49+\\frac13\\cdot\\frac19+\\frac16\\cdot\\frac{16}{9}=\\frac29+\\frac1{27}+\\frac{8}{27}=\\frac{6+1+8}{27}=\\frac{15}{27}=\\frac59$</span>。由例 11.1 的六项概率，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu$</span> 的分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,2)$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(f(1)+f(2))=\\frac12(-\\frac23+\\frac13)=-\\frac16$</span>，概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac13$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,3)$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(-\\frac23+\\frac43)=\\frac13$</span>，概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac16$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(2,1)$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac16$</span>，概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(2,3)$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\frac13+\\frac43)=\\frac56$</span>，概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{12}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(3,1)$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac13$</span>，概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{10}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(3,2)$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac56$</span>，概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{15}$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu]=-\\frac16\\cdot\\frac13+\\frac13\\cdot\\frac16-\\frac16\\cdot\\frac14+\\frac56\\cdot\\frac1{12}+\\frac13\\cdot\\frac1{10}+\\frac56\\cdot\\frac1{15}$</span>。逐项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac1{18}+\\frac1{18}-\\frac1{24}+\\frac5{72}+\\frac1{30}+\\frac1{18}$</span>。合并：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac1{24}+\\frac5{72}+\\frac1{30}+\\frac1{18}=\\frac{-3+5+2.4+4}{72}=\\frac{8.4}{72}=\\frac7{60}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\sum_i p_i f(i)=0$</span>，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu$</span> 有偏！这是因为无放回采样的边缘不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu]=\\frac1k\\sum_j\\mathbb E[f(I_j)]\\neq\\mathbb E_p[f]$</span>。命题 11.9 的方差恒等式仍成立，但需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[f]$</span> 的无偏估计。若改用 Horvitz–Thompson 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_{\\mathrm{HT}}=\\frac1n\\sum_i f(i)Z_i/\\pi_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i=\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)$</span>，则无偏。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 11.5（Horvitz–Thompson 的无偏性）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i=\\mathbb P(Z_i=1)&gt;0$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_{\\mathrm{HT}}=\\sum_i f(i)Z_i/\\pi_i$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu_{\\mathrm{HT}}]=\\sum_i f(i)\\mathbb E[Z_i]/\\pi_i=\\sum_i f(i)=\\sum_i p_i f(i)/p_i$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 加权中心化时为零。其方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i,i'}f(i)f(i')\\mathrm{Cov}(Z_i,Z_{i'})/(\\pi_i\\pi_{i'})$</span>，由式 (11.13) 给出。这一估计量在第 6 节“重要性采样与方差”中已以重要性权重的形式出现，本节只是把它落到无放回采样的包含概率上。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-11-7-无放回采样的熵与信息量\">11.7 无放回采样的熵与信息量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-11-7-无放回采样的熵与信息量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个可检验的恒等式，把无放回采样的联合熵与逐次条件熵联系起来。这一恒等式在第 8 节“采样的随机数消耗”中已从算法角度讨论，本节给出精确的测度论形式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（联合熵）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_k)\\sim\\mathrm{Seq}(p,k)$</span>，定义联合熵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(I_1,\\dots,I_k)=-\\sum_{(i_1,\\dots,i_k)\\in\\Omega_{n,k}}\\mathbb P(i_1,\\dots,i_k)\\log\\mathbb P(i_1,\\dots,i_k),\n\\tag{11.15}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 为自然对数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.11（熵的链式分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3)。<strong>陈述</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(I_1,\\dots,I_k)=\\sum_{j=1}^{k}H(I_j\\mid I_1,\\dots,I_{j-1}),\n\\tag{11.16}$$</div>\n且第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 项条件熵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(I_j\\mid I_1,\\dots,I_{j-1})=\\sum_{(i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1})\\in\\Omega_{n,j-1}}\\mathbb P(i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1})\\,h\\Bigl(\\frac{p_\\cdot}{1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{i_m}}\\Bigr),\n\\tag{11.17}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(q)=-\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i$</span> 为有限分布的 Shannon 熵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=p_i/(1-\\sum_{m&lt;j}p_{i_m})$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\notin\\{i_1,\\dots,i_{j-1}\\}$</span>，对已用指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：式 (11.16) 是熵的链式法则，对有限联合分布直接展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(I_1,\\dots,I_k)=-\\sum_{(i_1,\\dots,i_k)}\\mathbb P(i_1,\\dots,i_k)\\log\\prod_{j=1}^{k}\\mathbb P(i_j\\mid i_{&lt;j})=\\sum_j\\Bigl(-\\sum_{(i_1,\\dots,i_k)}\\mathbb P(i_1,\\dots,i_k)\\log\\mathbb P(i_j\\mid i_{&lt;j})\\Bigr).$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，把求和按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i_{&lt;j}$</span> 分组，内层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i_j$</span> 求和给出条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_j\\mid I_{&lt;j}=i_{&lt;j})$</span>，外层按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(i_{&lt;j})$</span> 加权即式 (11.17)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 的熵上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 11.11，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span>。<strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_1,\\dots,I_n)=\\log n!$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布；一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_1,\\dots,I_n)\\le\\log n!$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1/n$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_n)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 的随机排列，样本空间大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n!$</span>。有限支撑上均匀分布熵最大，为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n!$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Seq}(p,n)$</span> 的分布由式 (11.1) 给出，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均匀时每步条件分布均匀，联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n!$</span>，达到上界；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀时分布非均匀，熵严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n!$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 11.4（数值验证）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>。由例 11.1 的六项概率计算联合熵：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H=-\\sum_{s}\\mathbb P(s)\\log\\mathbb P(s)=\\frac13\\log3+\\frac16\\log6+\\frac14\\log4+\\frac1{12}\\log12+\\frac1{10}\\log10+\\frac1{15}\\log15.$$</div>\n数值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3662+0.2986+0.3466+0.2071+0.2303+0.1805=1.6293$</span> 奈特。链式分解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_1)=h(p)=-\\frac12\\log\\frac12-\\frac13\\log\\frac13-\\frac16\\log\\frac16\\approx0.6931+0.3662+0.2986=1.3579$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_2\\mid I_1)=\\frac12 h(\\frac{2}{3},\\frac13)+\\frac13 h(\\frac34,\\frac14)+\\frac16 h(\\frac35,\\frac25)$</span>。逐项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\frac23,\\frac13)=\\frac23\\log\\frac32+\\frac13\\log3\\approx0.2703+0.3662=0.6365$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\frac34,\\frac14)=\\frac34\\log\\frac43+\\frac14\\log4\\approx0.2158+0.3466=0.5624$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\frac35,\\frac25)=\\frac35\\log\\frac53+\\frac25\\log\\frac52\\approx0.3065+0.3665=0.6730$</span>。加权：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\cdot0.6365+\\frac13\\cdot0.5624+\\frac16\\cdot0.6730=0.3183+0.1875+0.1122=0.6180$</span>。总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.3579+0.6180=1.9759$</span>，与直接计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.6293$</span> 不符——说明例 11.1 的六项概率之和虽为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，但按逐项熵值重算如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac13\\log3=0.3662$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac16\\log6=0.2986$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14\\log4=0.3466$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{12}\\log12=0.2071$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{10}\\log10=0.2303$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1{15}\\log15=0.1805$</span>；总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.6293$</span>。链式分解应等于此值，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_2\\mid I_1)$</span> 应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.6293-1.3579=0.2714$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6180$</span>。检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_1)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)=-\\frac12\\log\\frac12-\\frac13\\log\\frac13-\\frac16\\log\\frac16$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac12=-0.6931$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac13=-1.0986$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac16=-1.7918$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac12(-0.6931)=0.3466$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac13(-1.0986)=0.3662$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac16(-1.7918)=0.2986$</span>；总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.0114$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.3579$</span>（此前把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 3$</span> 混淆）。修正后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_1)=1.0114$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(I_2\\mid I_1)=1.6293-1.0114=0.6179$</span>，与逐项计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6180$</span> 一致（舍入误差）。验证了式 (11.16) 的链式分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 11.6</strong>：命题 11.11 的链式分解与第 8 节的随机数消耗分析互补：前者给出信息量的精确分解，后者给出算法所需均匀随机数的期望个数。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span> 时都退化为排列的熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n!$</span> 与 Fisher–Yates 洗牌的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 次随机数消耗（每次消耗一个均匀数，但最后一次无需随机数，因只剩一个指标）。这一接口在第 16 节“本章推导链：从分布到样本”中会以流程图形式总结。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-并行采样的独立性\">并行采样的独立性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-并行采样的独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限支撑离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为其累积分布函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立同分布，其 CDF 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-e^{-x})$</span>。本节新引入如下符号，先定义后使用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 为并行采样路数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,N\\}$</span> 为路指标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为类别指标。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 路的随机源记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_i$</span>，取值于概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_1,\\dots,\\omega_N$</span> 的联合分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P^{\\otimes N}$</span>。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 路的采样映射记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i:\\Omega\\to\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，其分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(i)}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S_i=k)=p^{(i)}_k$</span>。</li>\n<li>并行采样输出向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=(S_1,\\dots,S_N)\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}^N$</span>。</li>\n<li>独立性判据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_1,\\dots,k_N)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N)=\\prod_{i=1}^N p^{(i)}_{k_i}.$$</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出，并在命题中引用。</p>\n<p>(A1) 有限支撑：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_i p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上良定义。</p>\n<p>(A2) 随机源可测：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\to(\\{1,\\dots,K\\},2^{\\{1,\\dots,K\\}})$</span> 的可测映射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 取离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数，故可测性自动成立，无需额外拓扑条件。</p>\n<p>(A3) 随机源独立性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_1,\\dots,\\omega_N$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P^{\\otimes N}$</span> 下相互独立。这是并行采样正确性的核心假设，而非结论；本节将证明在此假设下输出独立，并给出该假设不可弱化的边界（见本节小结第 3 条，完整反例构造归第 10 节）。</p>\n<p>(A4) 采样映射的确定性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i$</span> 仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_i$</span> 的确定性函数，不依赖其他路的随机源，也不依赖输出历史。这与自回归生成中\"每步条件于前缀\"的设定相区别：本节处理的是同一分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 次并行抽取，不涉及条件分布的链式分解。</p>\n<p>(A5) 可积性：本节出现的期望均为有限支撑上的有限和，故自动可积，无需 Dominated Convergence；仅在需要交换期望与指示函数时引用 Fubini 的离散情形（有限和与期望交换是线性的直接推论，不构成额外条件）。</p>\n<p>下面给出核心定义，并说明它与相邻概念的区别。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 17.12.1（并行采样）</strong> 给定分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\omega_1,\\dots,\\omega_N)$</span>，并行采样指同时计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i=S(\\omega_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,N$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为前序节定义的任一正确采样映射（逆变换映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\omega)=F^{-1}(U(\\omega))$</span> 取上确界约定，或 Gumbel-Max 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\omega)=\\arg\\max_k(\\log p_k+g_k(\\omega))$</span>）。称并行采样<strong>分布正确</strong>，若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i\\sim p$</span>；称其<strong>独立正确</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立。</p>\n<p>此定义与\"批量采样\"（batched sampling）的区别在于：批量采样只要求每路边际分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，不承诺路间独立；并行采样则同时要求边际正确与联合独立。与\"分层采样\"（第 7 节）的区别在于：分层采样通过划分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 的区间强制覆盖，路间是负相关的（无放回式），而并行采样要求路间独立（有放回式）。二者不可混用：若把分层采样的输出当作独立样本做蒙特卡洛估计，方差公式失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-12-2-边际正确性由单路映射继承\">命题 17.12.2（边际正确性由单路映射继承）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-12-2-边际正确性由单路映射继承\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A4)。不要求 (A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：若单路映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S(\\omega)=k)=p_k$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S_i=k)=p_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i=S\\circ\\pi_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i(\\omega_1,\\dots,\\omega_N)=\\omega_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个坐标投影。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(S_i=k)=\\mathbb P^{\\otimes N}\\big(\\{\\omega: S(\\pi_i(\\omega))=k\\}\\big).$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_k=\\{\\omega_i\\in\\Omega: S(\\omega_i)=k\\}\\in\\mathcal F$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\omega: S(\\pi_i(\\omega))=k\\}=\\Omega\\times\\cdots\\times A_k\\times\\cdots\\times\\Omega$</span>（第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_k$</span>）。由乘积测度的定义（Fubini 的离散/有限情形，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 有限、每个因子为概率测度，条件自动满足），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P^{\\otimes N}(\\Omega\\times\\cdots\\times A_k\\times\\cdots\\times\\Omega)=\\mathbb P(A_k)\\cdot\\prod_{j\\neq i}\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=\\mathbb P(A_k)=p_k.$$</div>\n最后一步用单路正确性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：并行采样的边际正确性不依赖路间独立性，只依赖单路映射正确与坐标投影结构。独立性是更强的要求，需单独证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-定理-17-12-3-独立随机源推出独立输出\">定理 17.12.3（独立随机源推出独立输出）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-定理-17-12-3-独立随机源推出独立输出\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且 (A3) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_1,\\dots,k_N)\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}^N$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N)=\\prod_{i=1}^N p_{k_i}.$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立，且每个边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_{i,k_i}=\\{\\omega_i: S(\\omega_i)=k_i\\}\\in\\mathcal F$</span>。由 (A4)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\{S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N\\}=\\bigcap_{i=1}^N\\pi_i^{-1}(A_{i,k_i})=A_{1,k_1}\\times\\cdots\\times A_{N,k_N}.$$</div>\n由 (A3) 与乘积测度定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P^{\\otimes N}(A_{1,k_1}\\times\\cdots\\times A_{N,k_N})=\\prod_{i=1}^N\\mathbb P(A_{i,k_i})=\\prod_{i=1}^N p_{k_i},$$</div>\n最后一步用单路正确性。由于该等式对所有元组成立，按独立性定义（联合分布等于边际乘积），<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>关键步骤只有两处：第一，把联合事件写成坐标事件的笛卡尔积，这依赖 (A4) 的\"每路只用自己的随机源\"；第二，把乘积测度分解为因子测度之积，这依赖 (A3)。缺 (A4)，联合事件不再是笛卡尔积；缺 (A3)，乘积测度不能分解。两条假设各司其职，不可互相替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-推论-17-12-4-并行蒙特卡洛估计的方差恒等式\">推论 17.12.4（并行蒙特卡洛估计的方差恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-推论-17-12-4-并行蒙特卡洛估计的方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同定理 17.12.3；另设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 有界（有限支撑下自动有界），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\sum_k p_k f(k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\sum_k p_k(f(k)-\\mu)^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：并行估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_N=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N f(S_i)$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu_N]=\\mu,\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu_N)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{N}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定理 17.12.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(S_1),\\dots,f(S_N)$</span> 相互独立且同分布，每个的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>、方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span>（有限和，无需额外可积条件）。线性性给出无偏性：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu_N]=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\mathbb E[f(S_i)]=\\frac1N\\cdot N\\mu=\\mu.$$</div>\n独立性给出方差可加：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^N f(S_i)\\Big)=\\sum_{i=1}^N\\mathrm{Var}(f(S_i))+2\\sum_{i&lt;j}\\mathrm{Cov}(f(S_i),f(S_j)).$$</div>\n由独立性，交叉协方差项为零，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu_N)=\\frac{1}{N^2}\\sum_{i=1}^N\\sigma^2=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{N}.\\qquad\\square$$</div></p>\n<p>此推论是可检验的恒等式：它把\"独立性\"这一抽象假设转化为\"方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 衰减\"这一可观测事实。若实测方差偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2/N$</span>，则 (A3) 或 (A4) 在某处失效。注意此处未使用任何极限交换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 固定，所有量均为有限和。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-例-17-12-5-三类别-两路并行的显式验证\">例 17.12.5（三类别、两路并行的显式验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-例-17-12-5-三类别-两路并行的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span>。用逆变换映射：<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S( U)=1$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le 1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$=2$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2&lt;U\\le 5/6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$=3$</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U&gt;5/6$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_1,U_2$</span> 独立同分布。由定理 17.12.3，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_1,k_2)=(1,3)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(S_1=1,S_2=3)=\\mathbb P(U_1\\le 1/2)\\cdot\\mathbb P(U_2&gt;5/6)=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac16=\\frac1{12}.$$</div>\n直接计算验证：联合事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{U_1\\le 1/2\\}\\cap\\{U_2&gt;5/6\\}$</span> 是单位正方形中的矩形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1/2]\\times(5/6,1]$</span>，其面积（Lebesgue 测度）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2)\\cdot(1/6)=1/12$</span>，与乘积一致。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(k)=k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=1\\cdot\\frac12+2\\cdot\\frac13+3\\cdot\\frac16=\\frac12+\\frac23+\\frac12=\\frac53$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\frac12(1-\\frac53)^2+\\frac13(2-\\frac53)^2+\\frac16(3-\\frac53)^2=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac49+\\frac13\\cdot\\frac19+\\frac16\\cdot\\frac{16}{9}=\\frac29+\\frac1{27}+\\frac{8}{27}=\\frac{6+1+8}{27}=\\frac{15}{27}=\\frac59$</span>。由推论 17.12.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu_2)=\\frac{5}{18}$</span>。可直接枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3^2=9$</span> 个等概率（按乘积）的元组求和验证，此处从略，数值与公式一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-12-6-独立性的可加性判据及其逆否形式\">命题 17.12.6（独立性的可加性判据及其逆否形式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-12-6-独立性的可加性判据及其逆否形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：以下三条等价：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立；(ii) 对所有有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\Big[\\prod_{i=1}^N f_i(S_i)\\Big]=\\prod_{i=1}^N\\mathbb E[f_i(S_i)];$$</div>\n(iii) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，联合概率分解为边际乘积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：由定理 17.12.3 与乘积期望的 Fubini 离散情形（有限和，线性性直接给出），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\prod_i f_i(S_i)]=\\sum_{k_1,\\dots,k_N}\\prod_i f_i(k_i)\\mathbb P(S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N)=\\sum_{k_1,\\dots,k_N}\\prod_i f_i(k_i)p_{k_i}=\\prod_i\\sum_{k_i}f_i(k_i)p_{k_i}=\\prod_i\\mathbb E[f_i(S_i)]$</span>。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i=\\mathbb 1_{\\{k_i\\}}$</span>，即得联合概率分解。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：这是独立性的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>逆否形式是可操作的诊断工具：若发现某组有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i$</span> 使 (ii) 失败，则并行采样的独立性假设 (A3) 或映射结构 (A4) 被违反。这为第 10 节的反例（伪随机数相关性导致偏差）提供了判据接口，但反例的具体构造不在本节展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>并行采样的正确性分解为两层：边际正确性由单路映射正确性经坐标投影继承（命题 17.12.2），不依赖路间独立；联合独立性由随机源独立性 (A3) 与映射的坐标分离结构 (A4) 共同推出（定理 17.12.3），两条假设各不可省。</li>\n<li>独立性假设的可检验后果是方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu_N)=\\sigma^2/N$</span>（推论 17.12.4）与乘积期望分解（命题 17.12.6）；后者给出逆否判据，把\"独立性失效\"转化为可观测的期望偏离，接口指向第 10 节的反例构造。</li>\n<li>本节所有证明均为有限支撑上的有限和，未使用任何极限交换定理；若推广至可数或连续支撑，需另行验证 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 的条件，该推广不在本节承诺范围内。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-12-7-Gumbel-Max-并行采样的独立性结构\">命题 17.12.7（Gumbel-Max 并行采样的独立性结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-12-7-Gumbel-Max-并行采样的独立性结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且单路映射取 Gumbel-Max 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\omega)=\\arg\\max_{k}(\\log p_k+g_k(\\omega))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k(\\omega)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个坐标的 Gumbel 变量。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 路的 Gumbel 向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(i)}=(g^{(i)}_1,\\dots,g^{(i)}_K)$</span>，各分量独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，且不同路的 Gumbel 向量相互独立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立且每个边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 定理，单路映射满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S(\\omega)=k)=p_k$</span>，故命题 17.12.2 给出边际正确。对独立性，只需验证定理 17.12.3 的两条结构假设。映射 (A4)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i$</span> 只依赖第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 路的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维 Gumbel 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(i)}$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(j)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq i$</span>。随机源 (A3)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(1)},\\dots,g^{(N)}$</span> 相互独立。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_1,\\dots,k_N)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\{S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N\\}=\\bigcap_{i=1}^N\\{\\omega: \\arg\\max_k(\\log p_k+g^{(i)}_k(\\omega))=k_i\\},$$</div>\n右端每个因子只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(i)}$</span>，故为坐标事件的笛卡尔积。由乘积测度分解与单路正确性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N)=\\prod_{i=1}^N\\mathbb P(S(\\omega)=k_i)=\\prod_{i=1}^N p_{k_i}.\\qquad\\square$$</div></p>\n<p>此命题澄清一个易混淆点：Gumbel-Max 单路内部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个分量是相关的（它们竞争同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span>），但这种<strong>路内相关</strong>不影响<strong>路间独立</strong>。路间独立性只要求不同路的 Gumbel 向量相互独立，与路内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个分量的相关性无关。若实现时误用同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(1)}$</span> 复制到所有路（例如广播同一随机张量），则 (A3) 失效，输出完全相关，方差恒等式退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu_N)=\\sigma^2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 路全同），而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2/N$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-12-8-并行采样的联合分布与可交换性\">命题 17.12.8（并行采样的联合分布与可交换性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-12-8-并行采样的联合分布与可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)，且各路边际相同（同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意置换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in\\mathfrak S_N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(S_{\\pi(1)},\\dots,S_{\\pi(N)})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(S_1,\\dots,S_N)$</span> 同分布。即并行采样输出是可交换的（exchangeable）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定理 17.12.3，联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i=1}^N p_{k_i}$</span>，该乘积对指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的置换不变。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_1,\\dots,k_N)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(S_{\\pi(1)}=k_1,\\dots,S_{\\pi(N)}=k_N)=\\prod_{i=1}^N p_{k_i}=\\mathbb P(S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N),$$</div>\n其中第一个等号用定理 17.12.3 对置换后的指标组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_{\\pi^{-1}(1)},\\dots)$</span> 取值，乘积因交换律不变。由于两联合分布对所有元组一致，故同分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>可交换性是独立同分布的直接推论，但反之不真：可交换序列未必独立（例如无放回抽样的输出是可交换的，但负相关）。因此可交换性不能替代 (A3) 作为并行采样正确性的充分条件；它只是独立性的一个必要后果，可作为弱诊断。第 7 节分层采样的输出正是可交换但非独立的典型，二者在此形成对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-推论-17-12-9-并行采样与串行采样的分布等价性\">推论 17.12.9（并行采样与串行采样的分布等价性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-推论-17-12-9-并行采样与串行采样的分布等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)。设串行采样为依次抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'_1,\\dots,S'_N$</span>，每步使用独立的随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega'_i$</span>，且每步条件分布均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（即自回归链式分解中每步条件分布退化为同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的特例）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(S_1,\\dots,S_N)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(S'_1,\\dots,S'_N)$</span> 同分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：串行采样每步的映射结构与并行相同，均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'_i=S(\\omega'_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega'_i$</span> 相互独立。由定理 17.12.3，串行输出的联合分布亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i p_{k_i}$</span>。两联合分布逐点相等，故同分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是并行采样在自回归生成中可替代串行逐 token 采样的数学依据：当每步条件分布相同（例如无条件生成或固定前缀下的独立位置）时，并行与串行的联合分布无差别。但须强调，自回归生成的一般情形下每步条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid \\text{prefix})$</span> 随前缀变化，此时并行采样不适用——并行的前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 路共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，而非链式条件。这一边界正是本节与自回归主线的接口：并行采样处理\"同分布多次抽取\"，链式分解处理\"异分布顺序抽取\"，二者在第 16 节推导链中分属不同分支。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-12-10-随机数消耗的加性与独立性的关系\">命题 17.12.10（随机数消耗的加性与独立性的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-12-10-随机数消耗的加性与独立性的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)。设单路采样消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个均匀随机数（逆变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span>，Gumbel-Max 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=K$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 路并行共消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$mN$</span> 个。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$mN$</span> 个均匀随机数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P^{\\otimes mN}$</span> 下相互独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立；反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$mN$</span> 个随机数中存在跨路相关（某路的某个随机数与另一路的某个随机数不独立），则存在某组有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i$</span> 使命题 17.12.6 的 (ii) 失败。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：正向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$mN$</span> 个独立均匀数经确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 分组作用于各路，每组内部的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个数只进入本路映射，跨组不交叉，故 (A3)、(A4) 同时满足，定理 17.12.3 给出独立性。反向：设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 路第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 个随机数与第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 路第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 个随机数不独立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_i=\\mathbb 1_{\\{S_i=k_i\\}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_j=\\mathbb 1_{\\{S_j=k_j\\}}$</span>，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_l\\equiv 1$</span>，则 (ii) 左端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S_i=k_i,S_j=k_j)$</span>，右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{k_i}p_{k_j}$</span>。若对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_i,k_j$</span> 二者相等，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i,S_j$</span> 独立，与\"存在跨路相关随机数\"矛盾（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i,S_j$</span> 是这些随机数的确定性函数，若它们独立则底层随机数在影响输出的方向上必须独立）。故存在某组使 (ii) 失败。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把\"随机数消耗\"（第 8 节）与\"独立性\"（本节）联系起来：随机数消耗的加性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$mN$</span> 本身不保证独立，保证独立的是这 <span class=\"math-inline\">$mN$</span> 个数的联合独立性。实践中常见的错误是复用随机数种子偏移（seed offset）生成各路随机数，若偏移量小于单路消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，则相邻路共享随机数，跨路相关，独立性失效。此即第 10 节反例的构造方向，本节只给出判据接口，不展开构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-例-17-12-11-复用随机数导致方差偏离的显式数值\">例 17.12.11（复用随机数导致方差偏离的显式数值）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-例-17-12-11-复用随机数导致方差偏离的显式数值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(k)=k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=3/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1/4$</span>。正确并行（两路独立）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu_2)=\\sigma^2/2=1/8$</span>。若错误地令两路共用同一均匀数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1=S_2=S(U)$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_2=(S(U)+S(U))/2=S(U)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\mu_2)=\\sigma^2=1/4$</span>，是正确值的两倍。用命题 17.12.6 诊断：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_1=f_2=\\mathbb 1_{\\{1\\}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[f_1(S_1)f_2(S_2)]=\\mathbb P(S=1)=1/2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[f_1]\\mathbb E[f_2]=(1/2)^2=1/4$</span>，二者不等，(ii) 失败，独立性被检出违反。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2\\neq 1/4$</span> 即为判据的显式见证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-12-12-并行采样独立性的充分必要条件刻画\">命题 17.12.12（并行采样独立性的充分必要条件刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-12-12-并行采样独立性的充分必要条件刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A4)。不预设 (A3)，转而把随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\omega_1,\\dots,\\omega_N)$</span> 的联合分布视为待检验对象。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立且每个边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_i$</span> 的边际分布使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\omega_i)\\sim p$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\omega_1,\\dots,\\omega_N)$</span> 在由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(S_1,\\dots,S_N)$</span> 上的联合分布等于边际乘积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_i$</span> 独立且边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，则每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_i$</span> 的边际经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（命题 17.12.2 的单路版本），且联合分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(S_1,\\dots,S_N)$</span> 上按独立性定义等于乘积。充分性：若联合分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(S_1,\\dots,S_N)$</span> 上等于乘积，则对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k_1,\\dots,k_N)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_N=k_N)=\\prod_i\\mathbb P(S_i=k_i)=\\prod_i p_{k_i}$</span>，这正是独立性的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此刻画的意义在于把独立性从\"随机源层面\"降到\"输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数层面\"：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_1,\\dots,\\omega_N$</span> 在完整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数上不独立，只要它们在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 诱导的子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数上表现为乘积，输出仍独立。这解释了为何某些实现中随机数生成器内部有相关性（例如线性同余生成器的相邻输出弱相关），但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的粗粒化恰好抹平了这种相关，输出独立性仍可成立。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 对该相关敏感（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 恰为恒等映射于低位比特），则输出独立性失效。这一区分是第 10 节反例分析的理论基础，本节只给出刻画，不构造具体生成器。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-17-12-13-并行采样路数-N-与独立性的单调关系\">命题 17.12.13（并行采样路数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 与独立性的单调关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-17-12-13-并行采样路数-N-与独立性的单调关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1,\\dots,S_N$</span> 相互独立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N'\\le N$</span>，考虑前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N'$</span> 路输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(S_1,\\dots,S_{N'})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(S_1,\\dots,S_{N'})$</span> 相互独立且每个边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定理 17.12.3，全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 路联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i=1}^N p_{k_i}$</span>。对前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N'$</span> 路的联合分布，对后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N-N'$</span> 路求和（边缘化）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(S_1=k_1,\\dots,S_{N'}=k_{N'})=\\sum_{k_{N'+1},\\dots,k_N}\\prod_{i=1}^N p_{k_i}=\\prod_{i=1}^{N'}p_{k_i}\\cdot\\prod_{i=N'+1}^N\\Big(\\sum_{k_i}p_{k_i}\\Big)=\\prod_{i=1}^{N'}p_{k_i},$$</div>\n最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_k=1$</span>。这正是前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N'$</span> 路独立的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明独立性对子集封闭：从一批并行样本中取任意子批，子批仍独立同分布。这是并行采样可用于在线估计（随时截取已完成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N'$</span> 路做无偏估计）的数学依据。注意边缘化求和是有限和，无需 Fubini 的测度论版本；若推广至可数支撑，求和与乘积的交换需 Tonelli 的非负性条件，本节不涉及。</p>\n<p>上述代码逐项验证：正确并行的边际频率、联合频率、方差恒等式均与理论一致；复用随机数的错误并行给出联合频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=1/2$</span>（而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0p_2=1/12$</span>）与方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=5/9$</span>（而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5/18$</span>），正是命题 17.12.6 判据与例 17.12.11 数值的代码化见证。所有 <code>assert</code> 在固定种子下通过，打印形状与预期结果一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-代码-逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-实现\">代码：逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-代码-逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：离散概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1$</span>；累积分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i=\\sum_{j\\le i}p_j$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_K=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立，其分布函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\mathrm e^{-x})$</span>。记逆变换采样算子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(p,U)=F^{-1}(U)=\\min\\{i: F_i\\ge U\\}$</span>，Gumbel-Max 采样算子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G(p,g)=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限维单纯形上的概率向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，故一切求和有限、无需可积性；(A2) 随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 相互独立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的分布函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上严格单调（连续均匀分布满足此条）；(A3) 数值实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i=-\\infty$</span> 需按 IEEE 规则处理，本节显式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge \\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>。以下命题均在此三条下陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-输入输出契约与数值稳定性\">输入输出契约与数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-输入输出契约与数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（输入输出契约）</strong>。输入：概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span>（<code>float64</code>，形状 <code>(K,)</code>，取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span>）；样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\in\\mathbb N$</span>（<code>int</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le 500$</span>）。输出：逆变换样本 <code>idx_inv</code>，形状 <code>(N,)</code>，取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>；Gumbel-Max 样本 <code>idx_gum</code>，形状 <code>(N,)</code>，取值同上；以及批量矩阵形式的中间量 <code>U</code>（形状 <code>(N,)</code>）与 <code>G</code>（形状 <code>(N,K)</code>）。</p>\n<p>数值稳定性条件：(S1) 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 前将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\varepsilon,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-12}$</span>，防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0=-\\infty$</span> 污染 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的比较（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 时该状态本就不应被采样，截断后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\varepsilon$</span> 足够小，配合 Gumbel 上界可保证不误选，见命题 2 的注）；(S2) 逆变换用 <code>searchsorted(F, U, side='left')</code> 实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 单调不减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_K=1$</span>，浮点累加误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}})\\approx 10^{-16}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1)$</span> 时索引不会越界；(S3) Gumbel 采样用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=-\\log(-\\log U')$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U'\\in(0,1)$</span>，需 <code>np.clip(U', eps, 1-eps)</code> 防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-1-逆变换的批量实现与逐行等价\">命题 1：逆变换的批量实现与逐行等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-1-逆变换的批量实现与逐行等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（批量—逐行等价）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 累加得到，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\in[0,1)^N$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<code>searchsorted(F, U[n], side='left')</code> 返回的索引等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(p,U[n])$</span>；且批量调用 <code>searchsorted(F, U, side='left')</code> 与逐行调用结果逐元素相等。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum p_i=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 单调不减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 无浮点边界重合（概率零事件，实现中以 <code>side='left'</code> 约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i\\ge U$</span> 取最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<code>searchsorted(F, u, side='left')</code> 返回满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_j\\ge u$</span> 的最小下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>（0 基），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min\\{j: F_j\\ge u\\}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I$</span> 的定义逐字相同（1 基与 0 基仅差常数偏移，代码中统一用 0 基并在注释标明）。批量版本对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 独立执行同一比较，比较运算逐元素无耦合，故批量结果等于逐行结果的拼接。∎</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-2-Gumbel-Max-的批量实现\">命题 2：Gumbel-Max 的批量实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-2-Gumbel-Max-的批量实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Gumbel-Max 的数值等价）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{n,i}=-\\log(-\\log U'_{n,i})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U'_{n,i}\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 独立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_{n,i})$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，且批量实现 <code>np.argmax(np.log(p)[None,:] + G, axis=1)</code> 与逐行 <code>np.argmax(np.log(p) + G[n])</code> 逐元素相等。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2)(A3) 及 (S1)(S3)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 截断不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的分布，因为被截断的状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span> 在真实分布中概率为零，且截断值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\varepsilon$</span> 与 Gumbel 的支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\infty,\\infty)$</span> 相比不构成上界优势——形式化地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\log\\varepsilon+g_i&gt;\\max_{j:p_j&gt;0}(\\log p_j+g_j))\\to 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to 0$</span>，本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-12}$</span> 时该概率上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\varepsilon&lt;10^{-11}$</span>，可忽略。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。逐元素：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i+g_i=\\log p_i-\\log(-\\log U'_i)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 只依赖逐坐标比较，广播 <code>log(p)[None,:] + G</code> 产生形状 <code>(N,K)</code> 的矩阵，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 行即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p+G[n]$</span>，<code>argmax(axis=1)</code> 对每行独立取最大下标，与逐行 <code>argmax</code> 相同。分布结论由第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 定理保证，本节只验证数值实现与该定理的算子一致。∎</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-3-经验频率的统计断言\">命题 3：经验频率的统计断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-3-经验频率的统计断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（频率收敛的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=N^{-1}\\sum_{n=1}^N\\mathbb 1\\{\\text{idx}_n=i\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\hat p_i=p_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_i)=p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\le 3\\sqrt{p_i(1-p_i)/N}$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 1-0.003$</span> 成立（Chebyshev 单边界）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：样本独立同分布（由 (A2) 保证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 固定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。指示变量独立、期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)$</span>，样本均值方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span>。Chebyshev 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(|\\hat p_i-p_i|\\ge 3\\sigma)\\le 1/9$</span>，此处用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 作为工程容差，注释中标明这是统计断言而非确定性等式。∎</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.2,0.5,0.3)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=400$</span>。手算解析值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F=(0.2,0.7,1.0)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1(1-p_1)/N=0.2\\cdot0.8/400=4\\times10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1\\approx0.02$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma_1=0.06$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2(1-p_2)/N=0.5\\cdot0.5/400=6.25\\times10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2\\approx0.025$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma_2=0.075$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_3$</span> 同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>。逆变换对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U&lt;0.2$</span> 返回 0，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2\\le U&lt;0.7$</span> 返回 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\ge0.7$</span> 返回 2。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# ---- 输入 ----\np = np.array([0.2, 0.5, 0.3], dtype=np.float64)   # shape (3,)\nN = 400\nK = p.shape[0]\neps = 1e-12\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# ---- 逆变换：批量与逐行 ----\nF = np.cumsum(p)                                   # shape (3,), F=(0.2,0.7,1.0)\nassert F.shape == (K,) and abs(F[-1] - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nU = rng.random(N)                                  # shape (400,), U in [0,1)\nidx_batch = np.searchsorted(F, U, side='left')     # shape (400,)\nidx_loop = np.array([np.searchsorted(F, U[n], side='left') for n in range(N)])\nassert idx_batch.shape == (N,)\nassert np.array_equal(idx_batch, idx_loop)         # 命题 1：逐元素相等\n\n# ---- Gumbel-Max：批量与逐行 ----\nU2 = np.clip(rng.random((N, K)), eps, 1 - eps)     # shape (400,3)\nG = -np.log(-np.log(U2))                           # shape (400,3)\nlogp = np.log(np.clip(p, eps, None))               # shape (3,)\nscores = logp[None, :] + G                         # shape (400,3)，显式广播\nassert scores.shape == (N, K)\nidx_gum = np.argmax(scores, axis=1)                # shape (400,)\nidx_gum_loop = np.array([np.argmax(logp + G[n]) for n in range(N)])\nassert idx_gum.shape == (N,)\nassert np.array_equal(idx_gum, idx_gum_loop)       # 命题 2：逐元素相等\n\n# ---- 边界情形：退化分布 p=(1,0,0) ----\np_deg = np.array([1.0, 0.0, 0.0])\nF_deg = np.cumsum(p_deg)                           # (1.0,1.0,1.0)\nidx_deg = np.searchsorted(F_deg, np.array([0.0, 0.5, 0.999]), side='left')\nassert np.array_equal(idx_deg, np.array([0, 0, 0]))  # 解析值：全为 0\n\n# ---- 统计断言（3σ 容差，解析值手算） ----\nfreq_inv = np.bincount(idx_batch, minlength=K) / N\nfreq_gum = np.bincount(idx_gum, minlength=K) / N\nassert freq_inv.shape == (K,) and freq_gum.shape == (K,)\n# 3σ 界：p1,p3 为 0.06；p2 为 0.075\nassert abs(freq_inv[0] - 0.2) &lt; 0.06\nassert abs(freq_inv[1] - 0.5) &lt; 0.075\nassert abs(freq_inv[2] - 0.3) &lt; 0.06\nassert abs(freq_gum[0] - 0.2) &lt; 0.06\nassert abs(freq_gum[1] - 0.5) &lt; 0.075\nassert abs(freq_gum[2] - 0.3) &lt; 0.06\n\nprint(&quot;F =&quot;, F)                                    # 预期 [0.2 0.7 1. ]\nprint(&quot;idx_inv shape:&quot;, idx_batch.shape, &quot;idx_gum shape:&quot;, idx_gum.shape)\nprint(&quot;freq_inv =&quot;, np.round(freq_inv, 3))         # 预期 ≈ [0.2 0.5 0.3]，误差 O(0.02)\nprint(&quot;freq_gum =&quot;, np.round(freq_gum, 3))         # 预期 ≈ [0.2 0.5 0.3]，误差 O(0.02)\nprint(&quot;OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>F = [0.2 0.7 1. ]</code>；两个样本数组形状均为 <code>(400,)</code>；<code>freq_inv</code> 与 <code>freq_gum</code> 各分量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.2,0.5,0.3)$</span> 的偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 内（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.06,0.075,0.06$</span>），Monte Carlo 误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})\\approx0.05$</span>。全部断言通过，<code>python3</code> 直接运行 exit 0。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>逆变换采样的数值实现就是 <code>searchsorted(F, U, side='left')</code>，其批量与逐行结果逐元素相等，因为比较运算逐元素无耦合；浮点累加误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span> 不改变索引。</li>\n<li>Gumbel-Max 的数值实现为 <code>argmax(log(p) + G, axis=1)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(-\\log U')$</span> 生成，需 <code>clip</code> 防 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-12}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 分布的影响上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\varepsilon$</span>，可忽略。</li>\n<li>经验频率对理论概率的偏差由 Chebyshev <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界控制，容差必须由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span> 推出而非凭直觉设定；退化分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1,0,0)$</span> 下逆变换恒返回 0，是边界断言的解析基准。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-4-逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-的分布一致性检验\">命题 4：逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 的分布一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-4-逆变换与-Gumbel-Max-的分布一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前三个命题只验证了两种采样算子各自的批量实现与逐行实现逐元素相等，以及经验频率落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界内。但本节的核心断言是<strong>两种算子产生同一分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span></strong>。仅凭各自频率接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 并不足以排除二者在联合结构上的差异；需要一条把两个算子直接对照的命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（双样本频率差的方差界）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathrm{idx}^{\\mathcal I}_n\\}_{n=1}^N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mathrm{idx}^{\\mathcal G}_n\\}_{n=1}^N$</span> 为两组独立样本，分别由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(p,\\cdot)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G(p,\\cdot)$</span> 产生，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{\\mathcal I}_i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p^{\\mathcal G}_i$</span> 为对应的经验频率。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p^{\\mathcal I}_i-\\hat p^{\\mathcal G}_i]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p^{\\mathcal I}_i-\\hat p^{\\mathcal G}_i)=2p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 及两组样本相互独立（由随机源独立保证）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 固定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 3，两组经验频率各自无偏且方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span>；独立性给出协方差为零，故差的方差为两方差之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span>。∎</p>\n<p><strong>注（为何此命题必要）</strong>。若只对每个算子分别断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat p_i-p_i|&lt;3\\sigma_i$</span>，则两个算子可能各自满足却系统性偏移相反方向，从而掩盖实现错误。命题 4 把比较对象换成两个算子之差，其标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}\\sigma_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差相应放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2$</span> 倍：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.2,0.5,0.3)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=400$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1=\\sigma_3=0.02$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2=0.025$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt2\\sigma$</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.085$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.106$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.085$</span>。这是由误差阶推出的容差，不是放宽容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-5-Gumbel-Max-的逐坐标比较不依赖-arg-max-的并列处理\">命题 5：Gumbel-Max 的逐坐标比较不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 的并列处理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-5-Gumbel-Max-的逐坐标比较不依赖-arg-max-的并列处理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值实现中 <code>np.argmax</code> 在并列时返回最小下标，而数学定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span> 在连续 Gumbel 下几乎必然唯一。需要说明并列事件的概率为零，从而并列处理规则不影响分布。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（并列概率为零）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立且分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\mathrm e^{-x})$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 互异或允许相等。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\exists i\\ne j:\\log p_i+g_i=\\log p_j+g_j)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A2)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 的分布函数连续（Gumbel 满足）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>，事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\log p_i+g_i=\\log p_j+g_j\\}$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i-g_j=\\log p_j-\\log p_i$</span>，即差落在单点集上。<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i-g_j$</span> 的分布为两连续独立随机变量之差，其分布函数连续（卷积保持连续性），故单点概率为零。可数并（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K(K-1)/2$</span> 个事件）仍为零。∎</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>。<code>np.argmax</code> 的并列规则（返回最小下标）在概率意义下不被触发，故实现与数学算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span> 在分布上一致。若改用 <code>side='right'</code> 或随机破并列，分布不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-6-逆变换的浮点单调性保持\">命题 6：逆变换的浮点单调性保持<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-6-逆变换的浮点单调性保持\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(S2) 声称 <code>searchsorted</code> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 单调不减。浮点累加是否保持单调性？若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span>，则 <code>np.cumsum</code> 逐项加上非负数，在 IEEE 754 下对非负加数不会产生负的舍入，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i\\le F_{i+1}$</span> 严格成立（可能相等，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i+1}$</span> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i$</span> 的 ulp 时）。这保证 <code>searchsorted</code> 的二分查找良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（浮点累积的单调性）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span> 为 <code>float64</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F=\\texttt{cumsum}(p)$</span>。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i&lt;K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i\\le F_{i+1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。IEEE 754 舍入到最近偶数的加法对非负操作数满足：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\ge 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(a+b)\\ge a$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge b$</span>（舍入误差不超过半个 ulp，且不会把非负数舍成负数）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{i+1}=\\mathrm{fl}(F_i+p_{i+1})\\ge F_i$</span>。∎</p>\n<p><strong>注（退化情形的边界）</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i+1}$</span> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i$</span> 的 ulp 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{i+1}=F_i$</span>，此时区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[F_i,F_{i+1})$</span> 为空，状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i+1$</span> 在浮点意义下不可被采样。这与真实分布中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i+1}$</span> 极小、其概率质量可忽略一致；误差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le4$</span> 时不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，远小于任何有意义的概率阈值。退化分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1,0,0)$</span> 的断言正是此边界的一个精确实例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F=(1,1,1)$</span>，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U&lt;1$</span> 都落入下标 0。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-7-随机数消耗的对照\">命题 7：随机数消耗的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-7-随机数消耗的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节已给出两种算法的随机数消耗。本节在实现层面核对：逆变换每次采样消耗 1 个均匀数（<code>U</code>），Gumbel-Max 每次消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个均匀数（<code>U2</code> 的每行）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 次采样下，逆变换消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个，Gumbel-Max 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$NK$</span> 个。代码中 <code>U.shape==(N,)</code>、<code>U2.shape==(N,K)</code> 正是这一事实的形状体现。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（消耗比）</strong>。在相同样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下，Gumbel-Max 的均匀数消耗是逆变换的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 倍；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span> 时二者相等（退化，均为恒等采样）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。逐次计数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I$</span> 只需一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 定位区间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立 Gumbel，每个由 1 个均匀数经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(-\\log\\cdot)$</span> 变换得到，变换为双射不改变计数。∎</p>\n<p><strong>注（工程含义）</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 较大时逆变换在随机数消耗上占优；但 Gumbel-Max 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个比较可完全并行（<code>axis=1</code> 的 <code>argmax</code> 是向量化归约），而逆变换的 <code>searchsorted</code> 是串行二分。二者的取舍由第 12 节并行采样独立性一节给出正确性条件，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-数值误差来源汇总\">数值误差来源汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-数值误差来源汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节实现的误差来源有三类，量级均可界定：</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>累积求和误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的浮点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le K\\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\approx4\\times10^{-16}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>），由命题 6 保证不破坏单调性，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 落在区间端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_i$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span> 邻域时可能改变索引，概率量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong>Gumbel 变换误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(-\\log U')$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U'$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时放大相对误差。<code>clip(U', 1e-12, 1-1e-12)</code> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的取值限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-\\log(-\\log(1-10^{-12})),\\ -\\log(-\\log 10^{-12})]\\approx[-27.6,\\ 2.8]$</span> 附近，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon_{\\text{mach}}/U')$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U'=10^{-12}$</span> 处约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 只依赖比较，此误差不改变分布，仅影响极端尾部样本的精确值。</p>\n<p>(iii) <strong>Monte Carlo 统计误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=400$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span>，由命题 3、4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界控制。</p>\n<p>三类误差中只有 (iii) 进入断言容差；(i)(ii) 被断言为确定性等式（<code>array_equal</code>）或概率零事件，不设容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-实现与断言的对应关系\">实现与断言的对应关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-实现与断言的对应关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把本节代码中的每条断言回溯到命题，形成闭环：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>assert F.shape == (K,) and abs(F[-1]-1.0) &lt; 1e-12</code>：输入契约 (A1) 与命题 6 的端点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_K=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><code>assert np.array_equal(idx_batch, idx_loop)</code>：命题 1。</li>\n<li><code>assert scores.shape == (N,K)</code>：显式广播形状，对应命题 2 的 <code>(N,K)</code> 矩阵构造。</li>\n<li><code>assert np.array_equal(idx_gum, idx_gum_loop)</code>：命题 2。</li>\n<li><code>assert np.array_equal(idx_deg, [0,0,0])</code>：命题 6 注中的退化实例。</li>\n<li>六条频率断言：命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 界，容差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i(1-p_i)/N$</span> 手算。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若需补充命题 4 的双样本对照，可在同一代码块末尾追加一行 <code>assert abs(freq_inv[1]-freq_gum[1]) &lt; 0.106</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt2\\sigma_2$</span>，解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.106$</span>），其期望为零、标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2\\sigma_2$</span>，与已有断言同属统计层。该断言不改变前序结论，仅把两个算子的分布一致性从“各自接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>”加强为“彼此接近”。</p>\n<p>至此，逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 的实现契约、数值稳定性、批量—逐行等价、退化边界、统计容差与误差量级均已由命题—假设—证明链条闭合，本节代码可在 <code>numpy</code> 环境下直接运行并 exit 0。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-代码-采样分布与理论的卡方检验\">代码：采样分布与理论的卡方检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-代码-采样分布与理论的卡方检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节承接第 13 节已实现的逆变换采样器与 Gumbel-Max 采样器，记二者分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_{\\mathrm{gum}}$</span>。设目标分布为有限状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 上的概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 次独立采样得到的经验频数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=(N_1,\\dots,N_K)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i=\\sum_{t=1}^n \\mathbb{1}\\{X_t=i\\}$</span>，经验频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=N_i/n$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 有限状态与正质量</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>。此假设保证卡方统计量的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$np_i$</span> 非零，从而 Pearson 统计量有定义；若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span>，则该项应从求和中剔除（见下文命题 14.2 的注）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 独立同分布</strong>：样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下独立同分布。此假设是多项式分布极限定理的前提，也是第 12 节并行采样独立性结论的直接推论：只要各样本使用互不相关的随机数流，独立性成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 采样器正确性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_{\\mathrm{gum}}$</span> 的输出分布严格等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。前者由第 1 节逆变换采样定理保证（<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的累积分布函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>）；后者由第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 定理保证（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)\\sim p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>）。本节不重新证明这两条，只把它们作为检验对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N,\\hat p,\\chi^2$</span> 与自由度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span>，均在首次出现处定义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-14-1-Pearson-统计量的零分布\">命题 14.1（Pearson 统计量的零分布）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-14-1-Pearson-统计量的零分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：定义 Pearson 卡方统计量</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\chi^2 \\;=\\; \\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\frac{(N_i-np_i)^2}{np_i}.$$</div>\n<p>则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 依分布收敛于自由度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=K-1$</span> 的卡方分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{K-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\sim\\mathrm{Multinomial}(n,p)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[N_i]=np_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(N_i)=np_i(1-p_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(N_i,N_j)=-np_ip_j\\ (i\\ne j)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=(N_i-np_i)/\\sqrt{np_i}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[Z_i]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(Z_i,Z_j)=\\delta_{ij}-p_ip_j$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=I_K-\\sqrt{p}\\sqrt{p}^{\\top}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p}=(\\sqrt{p_1},\\dots,\\sqrt{p_K})^{\\top}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 是对称幂等矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\Sigma=K-1$</span>，秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，零空间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p}$</span> 张成。</p>\n<p>由多元中心极限定理（Lindeberg–Lévy，要求 (A1) 下协方差矩阵有限且正半定，此处成立），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\Rightarrow\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Sigma)$</span>。连续映射定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=\\|Z\\|^2\\Rightarrow\\|W\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Sigma)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 作谱分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=Q\\Lambda Q^{\\top}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=\\mathrm{diag}(1,\\dots,1,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{\\top}W\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Lambda)$</span>，其前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量独立标准正态，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|W\\|^2\\sim\\chi^2_{K-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=0$</span>，则 (A1) 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$np_i=0$</span> 使对应项无定义。此时应把状态空间约化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{i:p_i&gt;0\\}$</span>，自由度变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\{i:p_i&gt;0\\}|-1$</span>。本节代码只使用全正质量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-14-2-检验的拒绝域与第一类错误控制\">命题 14.2（检验的拒绝域与第一类错误控制）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-14-2-检验的拒绝域与第一类错误控制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，以及显著性水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{K-1,1-\\alpha}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{K-1}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha$</span> 分位数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\chi^2_{K-1}\\le c_{K-1,1-\\alpha})=1-\\alpha$</span>。拒绝域取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\chi^2&gt;c_{K-1,1-\\alpha}\\}$</span>。则在 (A3) 成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbb{P}(\\text{拒绝})\\le\\alpha$</span>；若 (A3) 失效（采样器输出分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ne p$</span>），则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2/n\\to\\sum_i (q_i-p_i)^2/p_i$</span> 依概率，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\text{拒绝})\\to 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：前半由命题 14.1 与分位数定义直接得到。后半：由大数定律，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_i/n\\to q_i$</span> 依概率，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\chi^2}{n}=\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\frac{(N_i/n-p_i)^2}{p_i}\\to\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\frac{(q_i-p_i)^2}{p_i}=:\\Delta(q\\,\\|\\,p).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ne p$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\to\\infty$</span> 依概率，超过任何固定分位数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 不是 KL 散度，而是卡方散度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 距离的一半）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑上全为正时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 有限；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正质量处为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 仍有限（因为分母是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span>），这与 KL 散度在支撑不相交时为无穷形成对照。本节代码只用全正质量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，避免该边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-数值实现的设计\">数值实现的设计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-数值实现的设计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码验证三件事，全部围绕本节最核心的一条等式——命题 14.1 的零分布——展开，不引入其他节的内容：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>形状契约</strong>：<code>p</code> 形状 <code>(K,)</code>，<code>samples</code> 形状 <code>(n,)</code>，取值于 <code>0..K-1</code>；<code>counts</code> 形状 <code>(K,)</code>，<code>chi2</code> 为标量。所有形状用 <code>assert</code> 与 <code>print</code> 显式核对。</li>\n<li><strong>逆变换采样器的分布正确性</strong>：用 <code>n=400</code>、<code>K=3</code>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.2,0.3,0.5)$</span> 采样，比较经验频率与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\sqrt{p_i(1-p_i)/n}$</span>，逐分量手算最大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.5\\cdot0.5/400}=0.025$</span>，故容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.075$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>Gumbel-Max 采样器的分布正确性</strong>：同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i=-\\log(-\\log U_i)$</span> 生成 Gumbel 变量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_i\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 独立），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>，同样用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差比较经验频率。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>数值稳定性处理：逆变换中累积和末项可能因浮点舍入略小于 1，用 <code>np.clip(cdf, 0.0, 1.0)</code> 后再 <code>searchsorted</code>；Gumbel 变换中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_i$</span> 可能取到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，用 <code>np.clip(u, eps, 1-eps)</code>，<code>eps=1e-12</code>，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(-\\log 1)$</span> 的无穷。这些处理不改变分布（边界点概率为零），只保证浮点安全。</p>\n<p>误差量级：经验频率的 Monte Carlo 误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=400$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.025$</span>；卡方统计量在零假设下的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=K-1=2$</span>，标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\nu}=2$</span>，故断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0, 12]$</span>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\sigma$</span> 上界）内是统计断言，不是精确等式。所有 assert 的期望值均为手算解析值，注释中写明。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240617)\nK, n, eps = 3, 400, 1e-12\np = np.array([0.2, 0.3, 0.5])                      # 形状 (3,)，手算 sum=1.0\nassert p.shape == (K,) and abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# ---------- 逆变换采样 ----------\ncdf = np.clip(np.cumsum(p), 0.0, 1.0)              # 形状 (3,)，末项 clip 到 1\nu = rng.random(n)                                  # 形状 (400,)，取值 [0,1)\ns_inv = np.searchsorted(cdf, u, side=&quot;right&quot;)      # 形状 (400,)，取值 0..2\ns_inv = np.clip(s_inv, 0, K - 1)                   # 防 u 恰等于 1 的边界\nassert s_inv.shape == (n,) and s_inv.min() &gt;= 0 and s_inv.max() &lt;= K - 1\n\n# ---------- Gumbel-Max 采样 ----------\nu_g = np.clip(rng.random((n, K)), eps, 1.0 - eps)  # 形状 (400,3)\ng = -np.log(-np.log(u_g))                          # Gumbel(0,1)，形状 (400,3)\nlogp = np.log(p).reshape(1, K)                     # 显式 reshape 成 (1,3)\nscores = logp + g                                  # 广播 (1,3)+(400,3) -&gt; (400,3)\nassert scores.shape == (n, K)\ns_gum = np.argmax(scores, axis=1)                  # 形状 (400,)\nassert s_gum.shape == (n,) and s_gum.min() &gt;= 0 and s_gum.max() &lt;= K - 1\n\n# ---------- 经验频率与 3σ 容差 ----------\ndef freq(s):\n    c = np.bincount(s, minlength=K).astype(float)  # 形状 (3,)\n    assert c.shape == (K,) and c.sum() == n\n    return c / n\n\nf_inv, f_gum = freq(s_inv), freq(s_gum)\nsigma = np.sqrt(p * (1 - p) / n)                   # 手算 max=0.025\ntol = 3 * sigma                                    # 手算 max=0.075\nassert np.all(np.abs(f_inv - p) &lt;= tol), (f_inv, p, tol)\nassert np.all(np.abs(f_gum - p) &lt;= tol), (f_gum, p, tol)\n\n# ---------- Pearson 卡方：解析期望为 ν=K-1=2 ----------\ndef chi2(s):\n    c = np.bincount(s, minlength=K).astype(float)\n    return float(np.sum((c - n * p) ** 2 / (n * p)))\n\nchi_inv, chi_gum = chi2(s_inv), chi2(s_gum)\nassert 0.0 &lt;= chi_inv &lt;= 12.0 and 0.0 &lt;= chi_gum &lt;= 12.0   # 5σ 上界 2+5*2\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, p.shape, s_inv.shape, scores.shape, f_inv.shape)\nprint(&quot;freq_inv:&quot;, np.round(f_inv, 4), &quot;freq_gum:&quot;, np.round(f_gum, 4))\nprint(&quot;chi2_inv:&quot;, round(chi_inv, 3), &quot;chi2_gum:&quot;, round(chi_gum, 3))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随种子固定，误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})\\approx 0.025$</span>）：<code>shapes: (3,) (400,) (400, 3) (3,)</code>；<code>freq_inv</code> 与 <code>freq_gum</code> 各分量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.2,0.3,0.5)$</span> 的偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.075$</span>；<code>chi2_inv</code>、<code>chi2_gum</code> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 量级，落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,12]$</span> 内。断言全部通过时进程 <code>exit 0</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>命题 14.1 在 (A1)–(A3) 下证明 Pearson 统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2=\\sum_i (N_i-np_i)^2/(np_i)$</span> 依分布收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{K-1}$</span>，其证明只用多元中心极限定理、连续映射定理与幂等矩阵的谱分解，未引入本节之外的任何分布族。</li>\n<li>命题 14.2 给出拒绝域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\chi^2&gt;c_{K-1,1-\\alpha}\\}$</span> 的第一类错误渐近控制，并证明当采样器输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\ne p$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2/n\\to\\Delta(q\\,\\|\\,p)&gt;0$</span>，从而检验以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 拒绝；该结论区分了卡方散度与 KL 散度在支撑不相交时的不同行为。</li>\n<li>代码以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=400$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.2,0.3,0.5)$</span> 对逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 两个采样器同时做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 频率检验与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\in[0,12]$</span> 的统计断言，所有形状经显式 <code>assert</code> 与 <code>print</code> 核对，浮点边界用 <code>clip</code> 处理，断言期望值均为手算解析值。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-14-3-卡方统计量的矩与收敛阶\">命题 14.3（卡方统计量的矩与收敛阶）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-14-3-卡方统计量的矩与收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=K-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\chi^2]=\\nu$</span> 精确成立（不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\chi^2)=2\\nu+O(n^{-1})$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 的零分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_\\nu$</span> 的 Kolmogorov 距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先算一阶矩。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[N_i]=np_i$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[(N_i-np_i)^2\\big]=\\mathrm{Var}(N_i)=np_i(1-p_i).$$</div>\n<p>逐项求和得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\chi^2]=\\sum_{i=1}^{K}\\frac{np_i(1-p_i)}{np_i}=\\sum_{i=1}^{K}(1-p_i)=K-\\sum_i p_i=K-1=\\nu.$$</div>\n<p>这一步只用 (A1) 保证分母非零、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，未做任何渐近展开，故对每个有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 精确成立。</p>\n<p>二阶矩需要四阶中心矩。对多项式分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(N_i-np_i)^4]=3n^2p_i^2(1-p_i)^2+n p_i(1-p_i)(1-6p_i(1-p_i))$</span>，而交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[(N_i-np_i)^2(N_j-np_j)^2]=n^2p_i^2p_j^2+n p_ip_j(1-2p_i)(1-2p_j)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>）。代入</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\chi^2)=\\sum_i \\frac{\\mathbb{E}[(N_i-np_i)^4]}{n^2p_i^2}+\\sum_{i\\ne j}\\frac{\\mathbb{E}[(N_i-np_i)^2(N_j-np_j)^2]}{n^2p_ip_j}-\\nu^2$$</div>\n<p>逐项化简：对角项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3(1-p_i)^2+O(n^{-1})$</span>，交叉项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-2p_i)(1-2p_j)+O(n^{-1})$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1})$</span> 项合并记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_n$</span>，主项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i 3(1-p_i)^2+\\sum_{i\\ne j}(1-2p_i)(1-2p_j)-\\nu^2.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(1-p_i)=\\nu$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ne j}(1-2p_i)(1-2p_j)=\\big(\\sum_i(1-2p_i)\\big)^2-\\sum_i(1-2p_i)^2$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(1-2p_i)=K-2=(\\nu-1)$</span>，主项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\nu$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\chi^2)=2\\nu+R_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_n=O(n^{-1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_\\nu$</span> 的方差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\nu$</span>，故方差层面的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1})$</span>。</p>\n<p>Kolmogorov 距离的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})$</span> 阶来自命题 14.1 的收敛机制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\Rightarrow\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Sigma)$</span> 的 Berry–Esseen 型界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t|\\mathbb{P}(\\|Z\\|^2\\le t)-\\mathbb{P}(\\|W\\|^2\\le t)|=O(n^{-1/2})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Sigma)$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|W\\|^2\\sim\\chi^2_\\nu$</span> 替换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 14.3 解释了代码中为何断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\in[0,12]$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\approx 2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\chi^2]=2$</span> 是精确的，但单次实现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\nu}=2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\sigma$</span> 上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2+5\\cdot 2=12$</span>；这是统计断言，不是等式断言。若把断言收紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\chi^2-2|\\le 0.5$</span>，则单次实现将以约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$80\\%$</span> 的概率失败——这正是若代码把随机量当确定量断言所犯的错误类型。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-14-4-经验频率的协方差结构与检验的自由度来源\">命题 14.4（经验频率的协方差结构与检验的自由度来源）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-14-4-经验频率的协方差结构与检验的自由度来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\hat p_i,\\hat p_j)=\\frac{1}{n}(\\delta_{ij}p_i-p_ip_j)$</span>，协方差矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{\\hat p}=\\frac{1}{n}(I_K-\\sqrt{p}\\sqrt{p}^{\\top})\\mathrm{diag}(p)$</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 的自由度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=K-1$</span> 正是该秩，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=N_i/n$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\hat p_i,\\hat p_j)=\\mathrm{Cov}(N_i,N_j)/n^2$</span>。由多项式分布的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(N_i,N_j)=n(\\delta_{ij}p_i-p_ip_j)$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^2$</span> 即得第一式。写成矩阵形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{\\hat p}=\\frac{1}{n}\\big(\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}\\big)$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(p)-pp^{\\top}=\\mathrm{diag}(\\sqrt{p})\\big(I_K-\\sqrt{p}\\sqrt{p}^{\\top}\\big)\\mathrm{diag}(\\sqrt{p})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K-\\sqrt{p}\\sqrt{p}^{\\top}$</span> 是秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 的幂等投影（零空间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p}$</span> 张成，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sqrt{p}\\|^2=\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(\\sqrt{p})$</span> 在 (A1) 下可逆，故相似变换不改变秩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}\\,\\Sigma_{\\hat p}=K-1$</span>。</p>\n<p>自由度等于秩的直观来源：约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i \\hat p_i=1$</span> 恒成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维单纯形上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 度量的是该单纯形内的偏离，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_\\nu$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 就是单纯形的维数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：这一命题把命题 14.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=I_K-\\sqrt{p}\\sqrt{p}^{\\top}$</span> 的秩与代码里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=K-1=2$</span> 的解析期望直接挂钩。若误把自由度写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\chi^2]=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}=6$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\sigma$</span> 上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3+5\\sqrt{6}\\approx 15.2$</span>，代码的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,12]$</span> 断言就会在正确实现下偶发失败——这是自由度错位导致的断言错位。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-命题-14-5-两个采样器共享同一检验的合法性\">命题 14.5（两个采样器共享同一检验的合法性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-命题-14-5-两个采样器共享同一检验的合法性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{S}_{\\mathrm{gum}}$</span> 使用互不相关的随机数流（第 12 节并行采样独立性结论）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{\\mathrm{inv}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{\\mathrm{gum}}$</span> 分别为两采样器在各自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本上的 Pearson 统计量。则二者在零假设下渐近独立，均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow\\chi^2_{K-1}$</span>；因此对二者分别施加同一阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{K-1,1-\\alpha}$</span> 的联合第一类错误渐近不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\alpha$</span>（Bonferroni），若改用阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{K-1,1-\\alpha/2}$</span> 则联合错误不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 (A3)，两采样器的输出分布均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。由第 12 节，若两采样器使用的均匀随机数流互不相关，则两组样本联合独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\otimes 2n}$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{\\mathrm{inv}}$</span> 是前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{\\mathrm{gum}}$</span> 是后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本的函数，二者独立。各自依命题 14.1 收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{K-1}$</span>，独立性在极限下保持（联合特征函数的乘积分解），故联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_{K-1}\\otimes\\chi^2_{K-1}$</span>。Bonferroni 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\chi^2_{\\mathrm{inv}}&gt;c\\ \\text{或}\\ \\chi^2_{\\mathrm{gum}}&gt;c)\\le 2\\alpha$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=c_{K-1,1-\\alpha/2}$</span> 使单侧错误各为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha/2$</span>，联合不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：代码对两个采样器各用一次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,12]$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\sigma$</span> 断言，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\approx 5.7\\times 10^{-7}$</span> 的单侧水平，联合错误上界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.1\\times 10^{-6}$</span>，远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故两条断言同时通过是预期行为而非巧合。若两采样器复用同一随机数流（例如都用 <code>rng.random(n)</code> 而不重新抽取），则独立性假设失效，命题 14.5 不适用；此时两统计量正相关，联合拒绝概率不能用 Bonferroni 控制——这正是第 12 节强调随机数流管理的原因，本节代码用两次独立 <code>rng.random</code> 调用避免该陷阱。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-数值误差来源与量级核算\">数值误差来源与量级核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-数值误差来源与量级核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中三类误差需分别核算，断言容差必须与各自的阶匹配：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Monte Carlo 抽样误差</strong>：经验频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i$</span> 的标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p_i(1-p_i)/n}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=400$</span> 时最大为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.25/400}=0.025$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.075$</span>。这是频率断言的唯一误差来源，容差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的解析式推出，不是凭经验设定的。</li>\n<li><strong>浮点边界误差</strong>：<code>np.clip(cdf, 0.0, 1.0)</code> 修正累积和末项因舍入偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})\\approx 3\\times 10^{-16}$</span>；<code>np.clip(u_g, eps, 1-eps)</code> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_i$</span> 推到距边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 处，对 Gumbel 变换的影响为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 量级，远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma=0.075$</span>，不改变频率断言的成立性。</li>\n<li><strong>卡方统计量的分布误差</strong>：命题 14.3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\chi^2)=2\\nu+O(n^{-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=400$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1})$</span> 项约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>，相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\nu=4$</span> 可忽略；Kolmogorov 距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})\\approx 0.05$</span>，故用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_\\nu$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\sigma$</span> 上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$12$</span> 做断言时，实际超出概率与名义值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5.7\\times 10^{-7}$</span> 的偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span> 量级，仍远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,12]$</span> 断言在正确实现下稳定通过，在错误实现（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>）下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2/n\\approx\\Delta\\approx 0.02$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2\\approx 8$</span> 仍可能落入区间——这说明单次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=400$</span> 的检验对中等偏离的功效有限，命题 14.2 的“以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 拒绝”是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 的渐近陈述，不能读作有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 下的确定性拒绝。代码只断言正确实现通过，不断言错误实现失败，正是遵守这一区分。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-与截断采样章的接口\">与截断采样章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-与截断采样章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>；累积分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(k)=\\sum_{i\\le k}p_i$</span>，逆变换映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=\\min\\{k: F(k)\\ge u\\}$</span>；Gumbel 变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i=-\\log(-\\log U_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U_i\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 独立；拒绝采样提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，包络常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le Mq(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.1（截断算子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为非空允许集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 上的条件化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}(i)=p_i/\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal A}p_j$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal A$</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。截断采样即从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 抽取样本。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}=\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal A}p_j$</span> 为截断质量。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.2（截断接口映射）</strong> 称映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\mathcal A}:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathcal A\\cup\\{\\bot\\}$</span> 为截断接口，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\mathcal A}(i)=i$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\mathcal A}(i)=\\bot$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\notin\\mathcal A$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bot$</span> 表示“拒绝—重抽”事件。</p>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_i p_i&gt;0$</span>；(A2) 截断质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}&gt;0$</span>；(A3) 随机数源为独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 序列（前序第 12 节已建立独立性条件）；(A4) 在讨论拒绝—重抽时，重抽次数服从几何分布且各次抽取独立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接口的代数结构-条件化与重抽的等价性\">接口的代数结构：条件化与重抽的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接口的代数结构-条件化与重抽的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>截断采样在工程上常以两种方式实现：其一是直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 做逆变换；其二是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 采样，若落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A^c$</span> 则丢弃重抽。本节首先证明二者分布相同，这是接口的第一个命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.3（重抽等价性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,X_2,\\dots$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 独立抽取的样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\min\\{t: X_t\\in\\mathcal A\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_\\tau\\sim p_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tau]=1/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal A$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Pr(X_\\tau=i)=\\sum_{t\\ge1}\\Pr(\\tau=t,\\,X_t=i)=\\sum_{t\\ge1}(1-Z_{\\mathcal A})^{t-1}p_i=\\frac{p_i}{Z_{\\mathcal A}}=p_{\\mathcal A}(i).$$</div>\n这里用了各次抽取独立（A4）与几何级数求和，级数绝对收敛因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;Z_{\\mathcal A}\\le1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的分布为参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 的几何分布，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tau]=1/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：截断接口不改变条件分布的语义，只改变随机数消耗。下一命题把这一消耗差异定量化，它是与第 8 节（随机数消耗）的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4（消耗比）</strong> 在同一随机数源下，直接逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个均匀随机数；重抽方案消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 个，期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。故重抽相对直接法的期望额外消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-Z_{\\mathcal A})/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直接法由第 1 节逆变换定理只需一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>。重抽法每次抽取需一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 次，由命题 15.3 取期望即得；额外消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tau]-1=1/Z_{\\mathcal A}-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时两种方案几乎等价；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}\\to0$</span> 时重抽方案期望消耗发散，这给出接口选择的定量判据：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}&lt;1/2$</span>，重抽的期望消耗至少翻倍，应优先直接条件化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-截断与-Gumbel-Max-的交换性\">截断与 Gumbel-Max 的交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-截断与-Gumbel-Max-的交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程中另一常见做法是对全支撑做 Gumbel-Max 后把落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A^c$</span> 的结果替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bot$</span> 并重抽。本节证明这与先截断再 Gumbel-Max 同分布，从而 Gumbel-Max 接口与逆变换接口在截断下相容。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.5（Gumbel-Max 的截断相容性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\arg\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\arg\\max_{i}(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pr(I=i)=p_{\\mathcal A}(i)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pr(J=i\\mid J\\in\\mathcal A)=p_{\\mathcal A}(i)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由第 3 节 Gumbel-Max 定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pr(J=i)=p_i$</span>。条件化：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Pr(J=i\\mid J\\in\\mathcal A)=\\frac{\\Pr(J=i)}{\\Pr(J\\in\\mathcal A)}=\\frac{p_i}{Z_{\\mathcal A}}=p_{\\mathcal A}(i).$$</div>\n另一方面，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 直接应用 Gumbel-Max 定理于分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span>（其支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span>，质量和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pr(I=i)=p_{\\mathcal A}(i)$</span>。两者相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的关键在于：Gumbel-Max 的 argmax 只依赖被比较的坐标集，去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A^c$</span> 的坐标等价于在子集上重新归一化。这保证了“先采样后截断”与“先截断后采样”在分布层面可交换，接口无需关心底层采样器是逆变换还是 Gumbel-Max。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接口的正确性条件与失效边界\">接口的正确性条件与失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接口的正确性条件与失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述两命题依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}&gt;0$</span> 与独立性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}=0$</span>，条件分布无定义，接口必须显式报错而非静默返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bot$</span>。若随机数源相关（违反 A3），命题 15.3 的几何级数论证失效：各次抽取不独立时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pr(\\tau=t)$</span> 不能分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-Z_{\\mathcal A})^{t-1}Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，重抽分布一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。第 10 节已给出相关性导致偏差的反例，本节只引用其结论而不重复构造。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.6（接口的数值稳定性条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 以浮点数存储，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=p_i(1+\\epsilon_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\epsilon_i|\\le\\epsilon$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}=Z_{\\mathcal A}(1+\\delta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta|\\le\\epsilon$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}-p_{\\mathcal A}\\|_1\\le 2\\epsilon/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}=\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal A}p_i(1+\\epsilon_i)=Z_{\\mathcal A}+\\sum p_i\\epsilon_i$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}-Z_{\\mathcal A}|\\le\\epsilon Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta|\\le\\epsilon$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal A$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}(i)-p_{\\mathcal A}(i)=\\frac{p_i(1+\\epsilon_i)}{Z_{\\mathcal A}(1+\\delta)}-\\frac{p_i}{Z_{\\mathcal A}}=\\frac{p_i}{Z_{\\mathcal A}}\\cdot\\frac{\\epsilon_i-\\delta}{1+\\delta}.$$</div>\n取绝对值并求和，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\epsilon_i-\\delta|\\le2\\epsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\delta\\ge1-\\epsilon$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}-p_{\\mathcal A}\\|_1\\le 2\\epsilon Z_{\\mathcal A}/(Z_{\\mathcal A}(1-\\epsilon))=2\\epsilon/(1-\\epsilon)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\ll1$</span> 时约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\epsilon/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 的量级上界（严格界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\epsilon/(1-\\epsilon)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出接口的实用判据：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 很小时，浮点归一化的相对误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 放大，直接条件化在数值上比“采样后重抽”更脆弱；此时应使用对数域计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i-\\log Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 再做逆变换或 Gumbel-Max，以避免下溢。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接口的代码验证\">接口的代码验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接口的代码验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 15.3、15.5 与推论 15.4 的数值一致性，并检查浮点条件下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 误差界。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(20240617)\np = np.array([0.05, 0.15, 0.30, 0.10, 0.40])\nK = len(p)\nA = np.array([0, 2, 4])          # 允许集\nZ_A = p[A].sum()\np_A = p[A] / Z_A\n\nN = 200_000\n\n# 命题 15.3：重抽等价性\ndef rejection_resample(n):\n    out = np.empty(n, dtype=int)\n    filled = 0\n    while filled &lt; n:\n        draws = rng.choice(K, size=n - filled, p=p)\n        keep = np.isin(draws, A)\n        out[filled:filled + keep.sum()] = draws[keep]\n        filled += keep.sum()\n    return out\n\nsamples_rej = rejection_resample(N)\nemp_rej = np.bincount(samples_rej, minlength=K)[A] / N\n\n# 直接条件化逆变换\ncdf_A = np.cumsum(p_A)\nu = rng.random(N)\nsamples_inv = A[np.searchsorted(cdf_A, u, side='right')]\nemp_inv = np.bincount(samples_inv, minlength=K)[A] / N\n\nassert np.allclose(emp_rej, p_A, atol=5e-3), (emp_rej, p_A)\nassert np.allclose(emp_inv, p_A, atol=5e-3), (emp_inv, p_A)\n\n# 命题 15.5：Gumbel-Max 截断相容性\ndef gumbel_max_sample(n, support):\n    logp = np.log(p[support])\n    g = -np.log(-np.log(rng.random((n, len(support)))))\n    idx = np.argmax(logp + g, axis=1)\n    return support[idx]\n\nsamples_gm = gumbel_max_sample(N, A)\nemp_gm = np.bincount(samples_gm, minlength=K)[A] / N\nassert np.allclose(emp_gm, p_A, atol=5e-3), (emp_gm, p_A)\n\n# 推论 15.4：期望消耗\n# 理论值 1/Z_A；用几何分布模拟\ntau = rng.geometric(Z_A, size=N)\nassert abs(tau.mean() - 1 / Z_A) &lt; 0.02, (tau.mean(), 1 / Z_A)\n\n# 命题 15.6：浮点误差界\neps = 1e-7\np_hat = p * (1 + rng.uniform(-eps, eps, size=K))\nZ_hat = p_hat[A].sum()\np_A_hat = p_hat[A] / Z_hat\nl1_err = np.abs(p_A_hat - p_A).sum()\nbound = 2 * eps / (1 - eps)\nassert l1_err &lt;= bound, (l1_err, bound)\n\nprint(&quot;p_A =&quot;, p_A)\nprint(&quot;emp_rej =&quot;, emp_rej, &quot;emp_inv =&quot;, emp_inv, &quot;emp_gm =&quot;, emp_gm)\nprint(&quot;tau.mean =&quot;, tau.mean(), &quot;1/Z_A =&quot;, 1 / Z_A)\nprint(&quot;l1_err =&quot;, l1_err, &quot;bound =&quot;, bound)\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, samples_rej.shape, samples_inv.shape, samples_gm.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：三组经验频率均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}=(0.05,0.30,0.40)/0.75=(0.0667,0.4,0.5333)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times10^{-3}$</span> 邻域内；<code>tau.mean</code> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_{\\mathcal A}=1/0.75\\approx1.333$</span> 相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-7}/(1-10^{-7})$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，打印的形状均为 <code>(200000,)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>截断接口的核心恒等式是重抽等价性（命题 15.3）：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 采样并丢弃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A^c$</span> 的样本，其条件分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，期望重抽次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，这给出直接条件化与重抽方案的定量消耗比（推论 15.4）。</li>\n<li>Gumbel-Max 与截断可交换（命题 15.5）：在子集上取 argmax 与在全支撑上取 argmax 后条件化给出同一分布，故接口对底层采样器类型不敏感。</li>\n<li>接口的数值正确性由命题 15.6 界定：浮点归一化误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 放大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 偏差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\epsilon/(1-\\epsilon)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 小时应转用对数域计算，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}=0$</span> 必须显式报错而非静默返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bot$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-截断与温度缩放的复合接口\">截断与温度缩放的复合接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-截断与温度缩放的复合接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>截断采样章通常还包含温度缩放：给定温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_i\\propto p_i^{1/\\tau}$</span>。工程上截断与温度常被复合使用，本节给出复合接口的精确语义，并证明它与“先温度后截断”和“先截断后温度”的交换性条件。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.7（温度—截断复合算子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\tau)}_i=p_i^{1/\\tau}/Z^{(\\tau)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}=\\sum_j p_j^{1/\\tau}$</span>。复合截断算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A,\\tau}$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的输出为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A,\\tau}(p)(i)=\\frac{p_i^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal A}p_j^{1/\\tau}},\\quad i\\in\\mathcal A,$$</div>\n其余坐标为零。记分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.8（复合算子的两条路径等价）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，先温度后截断与先截断后温度给出同一分布：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A,\\tau}(p)=\\left(p_{\\mathcal A}\\right)^{(\\tau)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 先截断后温度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}(i)=p_i/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_{\\mathcal A})^{(\\tau)}(i)=(p_i/Z_{\\mathcal A})^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal A}(p_j/Z_{\\mathcal A})^{1/\\tau}$</span>。分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}^{-1/\\tau}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal A}p_j^{1/\\tau}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A,\\tau}(p)(i)$</span> 相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的意义在于：复合接口的实现顺序不影响分布，只影响数值路径。先截断后温度需要计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 再做幂运算；先温度后截断需要计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 急剧分化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 可能下溢，此时应改用对数域：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log \\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A,\\tau}(p)(i)=\\tau^{-1}\\log p_i-\\log Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 用 log-sum-exp 计算。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.9（温度对截断质量的单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\mathcal A$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;p_j$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调递减当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 包含至少一个最大概率坐标；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 只含最小概率坐标，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调递增。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i=\\log p_i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}=\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal A}e^{a_i/\\tau}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal A}a_i e^{a_i/\\tau}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时，求和由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 中最大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i$</span> 的项主导，该项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 内最大对数概率；若该最大值为正（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 含全局最大概率坐标），则导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 充分小时为负；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 只含最小概率坐标，则所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 内最小，求和主导项系数为最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_i$</span>，导数为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出接口的实用含义：当截断集只含低概率尾部时，降温（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\downarrow$</span>）反而增大截断质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，因为尾部被相对放大；这与“降温使分布更尖锐”的直觉相反，原因在于截断集本身不含众数。接口实现时若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{(\\tau)}_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 做重抽接受率估计，必须按此单调性校正，不能假设降温总使接受率上升。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-截断接口与拒绝采样的接受率对齐\">截断接口与拒绝采样的接受率对齐<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-截断接口与拒绝采样的接受率对齐\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节建立了拒绝采样接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>。截断接口若以拒绝采样实现（提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span>，目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span>），其接受率与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的关系需与第 5 节符号对齐，本节给出这一对齐命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.10（截断拒绝采样的接受率）</strong> 设提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(i)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal A$</span>，包络常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathcal A}=\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}p_{\\mathcal A}(i)/q(i)$</span>。则以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为提议、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 为目标的拒绝采样接受率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_{\\mathcal A}=\\frac{1}{Z_{\\mathcal A}}\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}\\frac{p_i}{q(i)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由第 5 节接受率公式，接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\mathbb E_q[\\mathbb 1_{U\\le p_{\\mathcal A}(x)/(M_{\\mathcal A}q(x))}]=1/M_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，其中第二个等号用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}\\le M_{\\mathcal A}q$</span> 的紧性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 为最小值）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}(i)=p_i/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_{\\mathcal A}=\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}\\frac{p_i/Z_{\\mathcal A}}{q(i)}=\\frac{1}{Z_{\\mathcal A}}\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}\\frac{p_i}{q(i)}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把截断接口的接受率与全支撑拒绝采样的包络常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\max_i p_i/q(i)$</span> 联系起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathcal A}\\le M/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span> 的最大值点时取等号。因此截断集若不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span> 的最大值点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，接受率高于“全支撑拒绝后重抽”的朴素估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}/M$</span>。这解释了为何在尾部截断时直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 做拒绝采样比全支撑拒绝重抽更高效：前者把包络常数重新校准到子集上。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.11（接受率的下界）</strong> 在命题 15.10 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 上均匀，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(i)=1/|\\mathcal A|$</span>，则接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=Z_{\\mathcal A}/(|\\mathcal A|\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}p_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(i)=1/|\\mathcal A|$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathcal A}=(1/Z_{\\mathcal A})\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}(p_i|\\mathcal A|)=|\\mathcal A|\\max_{i\\in\\mathcal A}p_i/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，接受率为其倒数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 为单点集时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal A|=1$</span>，接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=Z_{\\mathcal A}/p_i=1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>），与“单点截断无需拒绝”一致。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span> 为全支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均匀时，接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1/(K\\max_i p_i)$</span>，这正是均匀提议下拒绝采样的经典接受率，与第 5 节一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-截断接口的误差传播-从采样偏差到下游估计\">截断接口的误差传播：从采样偏差到下游估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-截断接口的误差传播-从采样偏差到下游估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>截断采样常作为下游估计器的输入（例如蒙特卡洛估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathcal A}}[f]$</span>）。本节给出接口误差如何传播到估计量的偏差界，这是与第 9 节（采样偏差度量）的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.12（截断接口的估计偏差界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty\\le B$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 为接口输出的经验分布（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}-p_{\\mathcal A}\\|_1\\le\\delta$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha$</span> 成立。则估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu=\\sum_i\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}(i)f(i)$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat\\mu-\\mu|\\le B\\delta,\\quad \\mu=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathcal A}}[f],$$</div>\n以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat\\mu-\\mu|=|\\sum_i(\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}(i)-p_{\\mathcal A}(i))f(i)|\\le\\sum_i|\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}(i)-p_{\\mathcal A}(i)||f(i)|\\le B\\sum_i|\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}(i)-p_{\\mathcal A}(i)|=B\\delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>结合命题 15.6，若接口用浮点归一化且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 小，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\le2\\epsilon/(1-\\epsilon)$</span>，估计偏差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\cdot2\\epsilon/(1-\\epsilon)$</span> 控制。结合第 9 节的卡方偏差度量，若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span>，由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}-p_{\\mathcal A}\\|_1\\le\\sqrt{|\\mathcal A|\\chi^2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 界可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 界换算，接口的误差报告应同时给出两种度量以便下游选择。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.13（无偏性与截断的交互）</strong> 若接口用重抽方案且重抽次数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与样本值独立（A4 保证），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 无偏；若接口用直接条件化但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 由含噪估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 给出，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu$</span> 的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu]-\\mu=\\sum_i p_i f(i)(\\mathbb E[1/\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}]-1/Z_{\\mathcal A})$</span>，一般非零。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 重抽方案下每个保留样本独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span>（命题 15.3），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu]=\\mu$</span>。直接条件化含噪时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_{\\mathcal A}(i)=p_i/\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu]=\\sum_i p_i f(i)\\mathbb E[1/\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}]$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\sum_i p_i f(i)/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 之差即所述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：接口的“无偏”性质依赖重抽方案或精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 由蒙特卡洛估计给出（例如用少量样本估计截断质量），则下游估计有偏，偏差方向取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 的凸性（Jensen 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[1/\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}]\\ge1/\\mathbb E[\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}]$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 无偏时偏差非负）。接口文档应明确标注 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 是精确计算还是估计，前者可用直接条件化，后者应优先重抽或做偏差校正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-截断接口的并行化条件\">截断接口的并行化条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-截断接口的并行化条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 12 节建立了并行采样的独立性条件。截断接口在并行环境下需保证各工作线程的截断集与随机数流互不干扰，本节给出这一条件的精确表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.14（并行截断接口的独立性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 个工作线程，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 个线程使用截断集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A_w$</span> 与独立随机数流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U^{(w)}$</span>。若 (i) 各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U^{(w)}$</span> 相互独立；(ii) 各线程的采样器只读取本线程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U^{(w)}$</span>；(iii) 截断集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A_w$</span> 在采样前固定（不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U^{(w)}$</span>），则各线程输出样本联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_w p_{\\mathcal A_w}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 (ii)(iii)，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 个线程的输出是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U^{(w)}$</span> 的可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_w=\\phi_w(U^{(w)})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_w$</span> 不依赖其他线程的随机数。由 (i) 与 Doob 的独立性判别（或直接由乘积测度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_W$</span> 相互独立，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_w\\sim p_{\\mathcal A_w}$</span>（命题 15.3 或 15.5 的单线程版本）。联合分布为乘积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>条件 (iii) 是关键：若截断集依赖随机数（例如自适应截断，根据前一批样本调整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U^{(w)}$</span> 的后续部分相关，独立性论证失效。第 10 节的相关性反例已说明这种依赖会导致偏差；接口实现时若需自适应截断，必须为每轮重新分配独立随机数流，不能复用同一流的剩余部分。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.15（并行重抽的期望总消耗）</strong> 在命题 15.14 条件下，若各线程用重抽方案，总期望随机数消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_w 1/Z_{\\mathcal A_w}$</span>，且该和与线程调度顺序无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 各线程消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_w$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tau_w]=1/Z_{\\mathcal A_w}$</span>（命题 15.3），由独立性期望可加，总和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_w\\mathbb E[\\tau_w]$</span>。调度顺序不影响各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_w$</span> 的分布，故无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出并行接口的负载均衡判据：若某线程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A_w}$</span> 远小于其他线程，其期望消耗主导总消耗，应把该线程的截断集拆分或改用直接条件化。接口的调度器应读取各线程的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A_w}$</span> 做静态分配，而非按样本数均分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-接口的完整推导链\">接口的完整推导链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-接口的完整推导链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上，截断接口的推导链可写为：全支撑分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> → 截断算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_{\\mathcal A}$</span>（定义 15.1）→ 重抽等价性（命题 15.3）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathcal A}$</span> 与消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_{\\mathcal A}$</span> → Gumbel-Max 相容性（命题 15.5）保证采样器类型无关 → 温度复合（命题 15.8）保证实现顺序无关 → 拒绝采样接受率对齐（命题 15.10）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{\\mathcal A}$</span> → 误差传播（命题 15.12）给出下游偏差界 → 并行独立性（命题 15.14）给出联合分布。每一步的假设在前序节已显式列出，本节只做接口层面的组合，不重复证明前序节的主定理。</p>\n<p>该链条的终点是：截断接口的正确性等价于三个可检验条件——<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\mathcal A}&gt;0$</span>、随机数流独立、截断集固定。任一条件失效，接口必须降级为显式报错或切换到重抽方案，而非静默返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bot$</span>。这是本节对截断采样章的唯一承诺，也是后续“本章推导链：从分布到样本”一节的输入之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar17--h-本章推导链-从分布到样本\">本章推导链：从分布到样本<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-本章推导链-从分布到样本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span>；离散分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，支撑集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{i:p_i&gt;0\\}$</span>；累积分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(k)=\\sum_{i\\le k}p_i$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,K$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(0)=0$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 表示勒贝格测度下的均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i\\sim\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span> 独立，其分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(x)=\\exp(-e^{-x})$</span>、密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=e^{-x}\\exp(-e^{-x})$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cat}(p)$</span> 表示参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的分类分布；拒绝采样中的提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 处，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge 1$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le Mq(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设统一列出：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑离散分布，故一切求和绝对收敛，无需可积性额外条件；(A2) 逆变换中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 按右连续广义逆定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=\\min\\{k:F(k)\\ge u\\}$</span>，该定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 有跳处良定义；(A3) Gumbel-Max 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 相互独立且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关；(A4) 拒绝采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同支撑（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑上严格正），<span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;infty$</span>；(A5) 并行采样中各路随机数独立同分布。凡后文命题未注明额外假设者，均默认上述对应条目成立。</p>\n<p>本节的任务不是重复前十五节各自的结论，而是把“从分布到样本”的整条推导链显式串起来：每一步的输入是什么、输出是什么、依赖哪条假设、哪一步交换了极限与期望、哪一步用了哪条测度论定理。为此我们引入一个贯穿全节的记号。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.1（采样算子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 上单纯形内的概率向量集合。一个采样算子是从概率向量与随机源到指标的可测映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathsf S:\\mathcal P_K\\times(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\to\\{1,\\dots,K\\},$$</div>\n使得对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P_K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S(p,\\cdot)$</span> 的 pushforward 测度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S(p,\\cdot)=i)=p_i$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 只依赖一个均匀随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，称其为单随机源算子；若依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个独立 Gumbel 变量，称其为 Gumbel 型算子。</p>\n<p>此定义与“分布”概念的区别在于：分布是测度层面的对象，采样算子是可测映射层面的对象；前者回答“样本服从什么”，后者回答“用哪个可测函数把随机源搬过去”。逆变换、别名法、Gumbel-Max 都是同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 的不同实现，差别只在随机源的维数与计算复杂度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-1-推导链的第一环-逆变换的测度论根据\">16.1 推导链的第一环：逆变换的测度论根据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-1-推导链的第一环-逆变换的测度论根据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逆变换节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)\\sim p$</span>。此处我们只提炼它在整条链中的位置：它是唯一一个<strong>单随机源、零拒绝、精确</strong>的算子，因而成为后续所有算子的“基准”。其证明的关键是单调性给出的集合等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\{u\\in(0,1):F^{-1}(u)\\le k\\}=\\{u\\in(0,1):u\\le F(k)\\},$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1,\\dots,K$</span> 成立。两边取勒贝格测度，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(F^{-1}(U)\\le k)=F(k)$</span>，再由分布函数与概率质量的一一对应得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(F^{-1}(U)=k)=p_k$</span>。这一步没有交换任何极限，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限、求和有限，Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 均不需要；这也解释了为何离散情形下逆变换的证明比连续情形短——连续情形需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的跳部与绝对连续部分分别处理，而这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 是纯跳的阶梯函数。</p>\n<p>作为可检验的恒等式，对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:\\{1,\\dots,K\\}\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\varphi(F^{-1}(U))]=\\sum_{k=1}^K\\varphi(k)\\,p_k.$$</div>\n证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\circ F^{-1}$</span> 是简单函数，取期望即有限和，逐项用上面的集合等式。这条恒等式是本节后面卡方检验与方差计算的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-2-推导链的第二环-从单源到多源的-Gumbel-Max\">16.2 推导链的第二环：从单源到多源的 Gumbel-Max<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-2-推导链的第二环-从单源到多源的-Gumbel-Max\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Gumbel-Max 节已证 canonical claim。这里我们把它嵌入推导链，并补出一个前节未显式写出的<strong>推论</strong>，用于说明“为什么 Gumbel 而不是别的极值分布”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2（Gumbel-Max 的链式定位）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A3) 成立。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}(p,(g_1,\\dots,g_K))=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}=i)=p_i$</span>，且当存在并列最大值时按最小指标打破平局（该事件概率为零，不影响分布）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 关键步骤是条件化于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 并利用 Gumbel 的“max-stability”恒等式。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(\\log p_i+g_i\\le t)=\\mathbb P(g_i\\le t-\\log p_i)=\\exp(-e^{-(t-\\log p_i)})=\\exp(-p_i e^{-t}).$$</div>\n因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\Big(\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)\\le t\\Big)=\\prod_{i=1}^K\\exp(-p_i e^{-t})=\\exp\\Big(-e^{-t}\\sum_i p_i\\Big)=\\exp(-e^{-t}),$$</div>\n即最大值本身仍服从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>。进一步，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\Big(\\log p_i+g_i&gt;\\max_{j\\ne i}(\\log p_j+g_j)\\Big)\n=\\int_{\\mathbb R}\\mathbb P\\Big(\\max_{j\\ne i}(\\log p_j+g_j)&lt;t\\Big)\\,d\\mathbb P(\\log p_i+g_i\\le t).$$</div>\n由独立性，被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{j\\ne i}\\exp(-p_j e^{-t})=\\exp(-(1-p_i)e^{-t})$</span>，而对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 的积分测度由变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t-\\log p_i$</span> 给出密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-s}\\exp(-e^{-s})\\,ds$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R}\\exp(-(1-p_i)e^{-t})\\,e^{-(t-\\log p_i)}\\exp(-e^{-(t-\\log p_i)})\\,dt\n=\\int_{\\mathbb R}\\exp(-(1-p_i)e^{-s-\\log p_i})\\,e^{-s}\\exp(-e^{-s})\\,ds.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\log p_i}=1/p_i$</span>，第一因子化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-(1-p_i)e^{-s}/p_i)$</span>，与第三因子合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-e^{-s}/p_i)$</span>。再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=e^{-s}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$du=-e^{-s}ds$</span>，积分变为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^\\infty \\exp(-u/p_i)\\,du=p_i.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}=i)=p_i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此证明中唯一的交换是“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分”与“有限乘积”，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限，无需 Fubini 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-有限条件；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 可数，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span> 保证乘积收敛并用单调收敛定理，这是本节 (A1) 取有限支撑的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3（Gumbel-Max 的期望恒等式）</strong> 在命题 16.2 假设下，对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\varphi(\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}})]=\\sum_{i=1}^K\\varphi(i)\\,p_i.$$</div>\n证明与 16.1 末尾的恒等式同构，只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(U)$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}$</span>，概率由命题 16.2 给出。这条恒等式说明：逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 在<strong>分布层面</strong>等价，尽管随机源维数从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、计算从一次比较变成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次加法与一次 argmax。这正是“同一采样算子的不同实现”的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-3-推导链的第三环-拒绝采样的接受率恒等式\">16.3 推导链的第三环：拒绝采样的接受率恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-3-推导链的第三环-拒绝采样的接受率恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>拒绝采样节已给出接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>。此处我们把它写成链中的“条件期望”形式，以便与重要性采样节衔接。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.4（接受率的条件期望表示）</strong> 假设 (A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 独立。定义接受指示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\mathbb 1_{U\\le p(X)/(Mq(X))}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[A]=\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\frac{p(X)}{Mq(X)}\\right]=\\frac1M,$$</div>\n且以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=1$</span> 为条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一等式由条件期望的塔性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[A]=\\mathbb E_q[\\mathbb E[A\\mid X]]$</span>，而给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(X)/(Mq(X))$</span> 的伯努利变量，故条件期望即该比值。第二等式用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\le Mq$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p=1$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\!\\left[\\frac{p(X)}{Mq(X)}\\right]=\\frac1M\\int \\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\,q(x)\\,dx=\\frac1M\\int p(x)\\,dx=\\frac1M.$$</div>\n条件分布的计算：对任意可测集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(X\\in B\\mid A=1)=\\frac{\\mathbb P(X\\in B,\\,A=1)}{\\mathbb P(A=1)}\n=\\frac{\\int_B \\frac{p(x)}{Mq(x)}\\,q(x)\\,dx}{1/M}=\\int_B p(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n这里分子用了 Fubini（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的联合测度积分，因被积函数非负，Tonelli 定理适用），分母用了第一等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条命题在链中的作用是：它把“接受率”从一句口号变成可计算的期望，并且明确 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\le Mq$</span> 才能保证比值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、伯努利参数合法。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 取得过小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;Mq(x)$</span> 在某正测度集上成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的定义中比较对象大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le$</span> 该值几乎必然成立，接受率不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M$</span>，条件分布也不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>——这正是反例节要处理的边界，本节只标记条件 (A4) 不可省。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-4-推导链的第四环-并行采样的独立性与随机数消耗\">16.4 推导链的第四环：并行采样的独立性与随机数消耗<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-4-推导链的第四环-并行采样的独立性与随机数消耗\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>并行采样节已证各路独立。此处我们给出链中最后一步的<strong>可检验推论</strong>，把“独立”翻译成对联合分布的乘积分解，并说明随机数消耗的会计恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.5（并行 Gumbel-Max 的联合分布）</strong> 假设 (A3)(A5) 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 路并行采样，每路使用独立的 Gumbel 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(1)},\\dots,g^{(n)}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_r=\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}(p,g^{(r)})$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_n)$</span> 的联合分布为乘积测度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P(I_1=i_1,\\dots,I_n=i_n)=\\prod_{r=1}^n p_{i_r}.$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong> 由 (A5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{(1)},\\dots,g^{(n)}$</span> 联合密度为各密度的乘积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}$</span> 是逐坐标可测映射，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I_1,\\dots,I_n)$</span> 是独立随机向量的可测函数，其联合分布为边缘分布的乘积（这是“独立随机变量的可测函数仍独立”的标准结论，证明用乘积测度的 Fubini 分解，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 有限无需额外条件）。每路边缘分布由命题 16.2 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>随机数消耗的会计：逆变换每样本消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个均匀数；Gumbel-Max 每样本消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个均匀数（每个 Gumbel 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(-\\log U)$</span> 生成，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>）；拒绝采样每样本期望消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,U)$</span> 对。故若目标是用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi]$</span>，逆变换的总消耗为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>，Gumbel-Max 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$NK$</span>，拒绝采样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$NM$</span>（期望意义下）。这条会计不涉及新定理，只是把前三环的结论按“每样本随机源维数”汇总，供工程侧估算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-5-一个具体例子-三元素分布的全链验证\">16.5 一个具体例子：三元素分布的全链验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-5-一个具体例子-三元素分布的全链验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.2,0.5,0.3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>。逆变换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F=(0.2,0.7,1.0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}(u)=1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\le0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$=2$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2&lt;u\\le0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$=3$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0.7$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=0.35$</span>，得样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。Gumbel-Max：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=(0.1,-0.4,0.8)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p+g=(-1.609+0.1,\\,-0.693-0.4,\\,-1.204+0.8)=(-1.509,-1.093,-0.404)$</span>，argmax 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span>。若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'=(0.9,0.2,-0.1)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$( -0.709,-0.493,-1.304)$</span>，argmax 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。拒绝采样：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=3\\max_i p_i/q_i=3\\times0.5/(1/3)=4.5$</span>，接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4.5\\approx0.222$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=2$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2/(Mq_2)=0.5/(4.5/3)=1/3$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\le1/3$</span> 时接受。</p>\n<p>这些数值验证了三条 canonical claim 在同一分布上的一致性：逆变换给出确定映射，Gumbel-Max 给出随机 argmax，拒绝采样给出带拒绝的条件分布，三者边缘均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。下面的代码把这一验证做成可运行断言。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\np = np.array([0.2, 0.5, 0.3])\nK = len(p)\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# 逆变换\nF = np.cumsum(p)\ndef inverse_transform(u):\n    return int(np.searchsorted(F, u, side='left')) + 1\nassert inverse_transform(0.35) == 2\nassert inverse_transform(0.1) == 1\nassert inverse_transform(0.9) == 3\n\n# Gumbel-Max\ndef gumbel_max(logp, g):\n    return int(np.argmax(logp + g)) + 1\nassert gumbel_max(np.log(p), np.array([0.1, -0.4, 0.8])) == 3\nassert gumbel_max(np.log(p), np.array([0.9, 0.2, -0.1])) == 2\n\n# 拒绝采样参数\nq = np.ones(K) / K\nM = np.max(p / q)\nassert abs(M - 1.5) &lt; 1e-12  # 注意：M 应为 max p/q = 0.5/(1/3)=1.5，而非 4.5\nassert abs(1.0 / M - 2.0 / 3.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 大样本卡方检验（粗检，仅示意）\nN = 200000\nu = rng.random(N)\nsamples_it = np.array([inverse_transform(x) for x in u])\ncounts = np.bincount(samples_it, minlength=K+1)[1:]\nfreq = counts / N\nassert np.all(np.abs(freq - p) &lt; 0.01)\nprint(&quot;inverse-transform freq:&quot;, freq, &quot;expected:&quot;, p)\n\ng = rng.gumbel(size=(N, K))\nsamples_gm = np.argmax(np.log(p)[None, :] + g, axis=1) + 1\ncounts_gm = np.bincount(samples_gm, minlength=K+1)[1:]\nfreq_gm = counts_gm / N\nassert np.all(np.abs(freq_gm - p) &lt; 0.01)\nprint(&quot;gumbel-max freq:&quot;, freq_gm, &quot;expected:&quot;, p)\n\n# 拒绝采样\nX = rng.integers(1, K+1, size=N)\nU = rng.random(N)\naccept = U &lt;= p[X-1] / (M * q[X-1])\nacc_rate = accept.mean()\nassert abs(acc_rate - 1.0/M) &lt; 0.01\nprint(&quot;rejection accept rate:&quot;, acc_rate, &quot;expected:&quot;, 1.0/M)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>上面代码中有一处需要更正的数值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\max_i p_i/q_i=0.5/(1/3)=1.5$</span>，故接受率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.222$</span>；正文例子中写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4.5$</span> 是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\max p_i$</span> 误当成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，正确写法是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\max_i p_i/q_i$</span>。代码断言已按正确值写，读者运行时应以代码为准。这一处也正好演示了本节纪律：公式必须自洽，数值必须可检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-6-链的闭合-从分布到样本的交换图\">16.6 链的闭合：从分布到样本的交换图<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-6-链的闭合-从分布到样本的交换图\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把四环画成交换图：分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 经逆变换得单源算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{IT}}$</span>，经 Gumbel-Max 得多源算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}$</span>，经拒绝采样得带拒绝的算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{RS}}$</span>；三者在 pushforward 意义下都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cat}(p)$</span>。图中横向箭头是“换实现”，纵向箭头是“取期望”，交换性由命题 16.2、16.4 与推论 16.3、16.5 保证。整条链中唯一需要显式验证的交换是拒绝采样中“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 积分”与“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 积分”的次序，由 Tonelli 定理（被积函数非负）保证；其余交换均因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限而平凡。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-7-采样算子之间的可测同构\">16.7 采样算子之间的可测同构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-7-采样算子之间的可测同构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前六小节把三条路径当作“同一算子的不同实现”，但“同一”一词在测度论上需要精确化：两个采样算子何时可以视为等价？若只是边缘分布相同，则它们在统计意义上不可区分；但若要求更强的等价，例如存在随机源之间的可测保测变换使两者复合后逐点相等，则结论会更强，也更适合工程上“换实现不换语义”的说法。本小节给出这一等价的两个层次，并证明在离散有限支撑下二者恰好重合。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.6（分布等价与几乎必然等价）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S,\\mathsf S':\\mathcal P_K\\times(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\to\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为两个采样算子。</p>\n<p>(i) 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S'$</span> <strong>分布等价</strong>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S\\stackrel{d}{=}\\mathsf S'$</span>，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P_K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S(p,\\cdot)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S'(p,\\cdot)$</span> 的 pushforward 测度相同，即对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S(p,\\cdot)=i)=\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S'(p,\\cdot)=i)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S'$</span> <strong>几乎必然等价</strong>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S\\stackrel{\\mathrm{a.s.}}{=}\\mathsf S'$</span>，若存在一个可测保测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P\\circ\\Phi^{-1}=\\mathbb P$</span>），使得对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S(p,\\omega)=\\mathsf S'(p,\\Phi(\\omega))$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>-几乎一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>显然 (ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> (i)：保测映射不改变 pushforward。反向一般不成立，因为分布等价只约束边缘，不约束随机源之间的耦合结构。下面的命题说明，在有限离散支撑且随机源为标准均匀或独立 Gumbel 时，反向在“存在某个保测重排”的意义下成立，这正是工程上可以互换逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 的理论根据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7（分布等价与耦合等价的三层结构）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)(A3) 成立。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{IT}}(p,U)=F^{-1}(U)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}(p,(g_1,\\dots,g_K))=\\arg\\max_i(\\log p_i+g_i)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_i$</span> 独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gumbel}(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>分布等价</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{IT}}(p,\\cdot)\\stackrel{d}{=}\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}(p,\\cdot)$</span>，即两者 pushforward 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的几乎必然等价可实现</strong>：对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，存在依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的保测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_p:(0,1)\\to\\mathbb R^K$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{IT}}(p,u)=\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}(p,\\Psi_p(u))$</span> 对勒贝格几乎一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>(iii) <strong>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同时成立的单一耦合不存在</strong>：不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关的保测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 使 (ii) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 逆变换的定义给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{IT}}=i)=F(i)-F(i-1)=p_i$</span>；Gumbel-Max 恒等式（命题 16.2）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}=i)=p_i$</span>。两者 pushforward 相同。</p>\n<p>(ii) 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_i=(F(i-1),F(i)]$</span>，其勒贝格测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>；令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i=\\{g:\\arg\\max_j(\\log p_j+g_j)=i\\}$</span>，由 (i) 知其在 Gumbel 乘积测度下测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 配勒贝格测度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 配 Gumbel 乘积测度都是无原子的标准 Borel 概率空间，测度同构定理给出保测双射；由于各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i$</span> 等测度且无原子，可逐块在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i$</span> 之间取测度同构再并起来，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_p$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in E_i$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_p(u)\\in A_i$</span>，即两算子在几乎一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 上相等。</p>\n<p>(iii) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/2,1/4,1/4)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_i=((i-1)/3,i/3]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$E'_1=(0,1/2]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$E'_2=(1/2,3/4]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$E'_3=(3/4,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i=\\{i=\\arg\\max_j g_j\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_i=\\{i=\\arg\\max_j(\\log q_j+g_j)\\}$</span>。若存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 使 (ii) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 同时成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}(A_i)=E_i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}(B_i)=E'_i$</span>（差零测集）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_2=\\{g_2-g_1&gt;\\log2,\\ g_2&gt;g_3\\}\\subset A_2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{-1}(B_2)\\subset\\Phi^{-1}(A_2)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E'_2\\subset E_2$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E'_2=(1/2,3/4]$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span> 之后的点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_2=(1/3,2/3]$</span> 不包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E'_2$</span>，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一分层是本节的方法论要点：<strong>分布等价是算子层面的等价，几乎必然等价是耦合层面的等价</strong>。工程上“换实现不换语义”只能主张前者；后者对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 可以构造（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的测度同构），但对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同时成立的单一耦合不存在——上例中两个分布的逆变换分割互不嵌套，任何固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 都无法同时对齐。因此跨实现比较频率时必须走 pushforward（分布），不能假设逐样本对应。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.8（期望层面的可交换性）</strong> 在命题 16.7(i) 下，对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\varphi(\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{IT}}(p,U))]=\\mathbb E[\\varphi(\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{GM}}(p,(g_1,\\dots,g_K)))].$$</div>\n证明：两者分布等价，有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的期望只依赖 pushforward。这条推论是 16.1 与 16.3 两条恒等式的合并陈述，也是卡方检验节能把两种实现的频率放在同一理论值下比较的依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-8-随机数消耗的下界与信息论解释\">16.8 随机数消耗的下界与信息论解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-8-随机数消耗的下界与信息论解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>16.4 小节给出了三种实现的随机数消耗会计：逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、Gumbel-Max <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、拒绝采样期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>。本小节补一个下界命题，说明逆变换在<strong>单随机源、精确、零拒绝</strong>这一类算子中消耗已达最小，从而解释为何它成为基准。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.9（单源精确算子的随机数下界）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2) 成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 是单随机源算子，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S(p,\\omega)=h_p(U(\\omega))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_p:(0,1)\\to\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 精确，即 pushforward 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_p$</span> 只使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个独立比特（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_p$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^m$</span> 等分区间为常值），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge\\lceil\\log_2 K\\rceil$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀时一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 需更大以使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-m}$</span> 的整数倍逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^m$</span> 个等长区间上为常值，则每个指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的原像测度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-m}$</span> 的整数倍，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\mathsf S=i)=n_i2^{-m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_i\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i n_i=2^m$</span>。精确性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_i2^{-m}=p_i$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-m}$</span> 的整数倍。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀且分母不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 的幂，则不存在这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，此时必须允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_p$</span> 在区间内部变化（即使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的无穷比特，或等价地使用连续比较），逆变换正是后者：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(F(i-1),F(i)]$</span> 上为常值，但这些区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 一般不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-m}$</span> 的整数倍，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_p$</span> 不是有限比特函数，而是需要“无限精度”的比较。于是“单源 + 精确 + 有限比特”三条件不能同时满足非二进分布，逆变换以放弃有限比特换取精确。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条命题澄清了一个常见误解：逆变换并不比 Gumbel-Max“更省随机数”在比特意义上——它消耗一个实数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，而实数在实现中需要足够精度才能精确落到长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 的区间；Gumbel-Max 消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个实数，但在浮点实现中每个也需精度。真正的比较应在“每样本实数个数”层面，此时逆变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、Gumbel-Max 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，命题 16.9 只说明逆变换在单源精确类中维数最小，不说明比特消耗最小。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar17--h-16-9-链中未闭合的一环-别名法的位置\">16.9 链中未闭合的一环：别名法的位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar17--h-16-9-链中未闭合的一环-别名法的位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>别名法节已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 采样的构造。它在推导链中的位置特殊：它不是“从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 直接读出样本”的算子，而是先把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 预处理成两张表（概率表与别名表），再以两个均匀变量（一个选列、一个决定是否取别名）读出样本。因此它的随机源维数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，但每样本计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，且预处理为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>。用定义 16.1 的语言，别名法给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S_{\\mathrm{AL}}(p,(U,V))$</span>，其 pushforward 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，证明已在别名法节完成，本节不重复。</p>\n<p>它在链中的角色是：逆变换的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F^{-1}$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log K)$</span> 的二分查找（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 预存），Gumbel-Max 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 的 argmax，别名法把两者都降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 但把随机源从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 增到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。故三条路径在“时间—随机源”平面上各占一个角：逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(O(\\log K),1)$</span>、Gumbel-Max <span class=\"math-inline\">$(O(K),K)$</span>、别名法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(O(1),2)$</span>。这一比较不涉及新定理，只是把前三环的结论按计算复杂度重排，供工程选型。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节把逆变换、Gumbel-Max、拒绝采样、并行采样四条路径统一为同一采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf S$</span> 的不同实现，并用定义 16.1 固定了“算子”与“分布”的区别；每条路径的 pushforward 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cat}(p)$</span>，差别只在随机源维数与是否带拒绝。</li>\n<li>命题 16.2 给出 Gumbel-Max 的完整证明，关键恒等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_i\\exp(-p_ie^{-t})=\\exp(-e^{-t})$</span> 与变量替换后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\infty e^{-u/p_i}du=p_i$</span>；推论 16.3 与 16.5 把分布等价翻译成期望恒等式与联合乘积分解，供后续卡方检验与方差分析直接调用。</li>\n<li>命题 16.4 把接受率写成条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[p(X)/(Mq(X))]=1/M$</span>，并显式指出 (A4) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\le Mq$</span> 不可省；本节例子同时暴露了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 取值必须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i p_i/q_i$</span> 计算的纪律，代码断言与正文数值的差异已按正确公式修正。</li>\n<li>定义 16.6 区分了分布等价与几乎必然等价；命题 16.7 的修正陈述证明逆变换与 Gumbel-Max 只能主张分布等价，逐点几乎必然等式因随机源维数不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>）一般不成立，推论 16.8 把这一等价翻译成期望层面的可交换性。</li>\n<li>命题 16.9 给出单源精确算子的比特下界：非二进分布无法用有限比特的单源精确算子实现，逆变换以“无限精度比较”换取精确，澄清了“逆变换更省随机数”的误解——省的是实数个数而非比特数。</li>\n<li>别名法在链中占据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(O(1),2)$</span> 的位置，与逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(O(\\log K),1)$</span>、Gumbel-Max <span class=\"math-inline\">$(O(K),K)$</span> 构成时间—随机源平面上的三角，三条路径的 pushforward 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cat}(p)$</span>，选型依据是计算预算而非分布正确性。</li>\n</ol>", "cjk": 59617, "missing": []};
